(451994, 41523, 11073, '<td valign="top">great shot and technique ( mirror i assume?)  very cool. Do i see some sort of "line" next to the bottle (on the left side of the pic) I don''t think its my monitor?  Oh well, spot editing forbidden right :|~  I love the leaves on the glass, cool little nuianse (sp?)  Maybe its the alcoholic in me...but I hope this wins over all the ho hum boring "apple pie" pics that I''ve seen in the rest of the comp.  Kudos for originality. 9.</td>', 'great shot and technique ( mirror i assume?)  very cool. Do i see some sort of "line" next to the bottle (on the left side of the pic) I don''t think its my monitor?  Oh well, spot editing forbidden right :|~  I love the leaves on the glass, cool little nuianse (sp?)  Maybe its the alcoholic in me...but I hope this wins over all the ho hum boring "apple pie" pics that I''ve seen in the rest of the comp.  Kudos for originality. 9.', '2003-10-16 01:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(451996, 42337, 11073, '<td valign="top">looks good...wish it were bigger...</td>', 'looks good...wish it were bigger...', '2003-10-16 01:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(451998, 42440, 11073, '<td valign="top">good shot, and technically sound, but its just missing something for me...i think that it could be brightened up a little to bring out the main subject.</td>', 'good shot, and technically sound, but its just missing something for me...i think that it could be brightened up a little to bring out the main subject.', '2003-10-16 01:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(452002, 41995, 11073, '<td valign="top">holy busy batman!  =`)  It works though - i''ll give you an extra point for the obvious hard work you put it! 7.</td>', 'holy busy batman!  =`)  It works though - i''ll give you an extra point for the obvious hard work you put it! 7.', '2003-10-16 01:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
