(452005, 42409, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is over exposed.  Especially on the white side!  It''s also a little busy.</td>', 'This is over exposed.  Especially on the white side!  It''s also a little busy.', '2003-10-16 01:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(452006, 41593, 10848, '<td valign="top">this is a gorgeous shot, the lighting is just soft enough to add eligance to this shot.</td>', 'this is a gorgeous shot, the lighting is just soft enough to add eligance to this shot.', '2003-10-16 01:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(452011, 41610, 6008, '<td valign="top">The range and varying colors here are good, it looks fresh, and fairly sharp. The main problem I see are the overblown whites, mainly on the rind of the lemon slices and the cheese(?) in the top right. They seem to dominant the image.</td>', 'The range and varying colors here are good, it looks fresh, and fairly sharp. The main problem I see are the overblown whites, mainly on the rind of the lemon slices and the cheese(?) in the top right. They seem to dominant the image.', '2003-10-16 01:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(452013, 42098, 10084, '<td valign="top">Hand me a knife and fork. A definite cookbook photo. Looks delicious. All the green veggies really help to add interest and color to the shot. I like the colorful plate you used.</td>', 'Hand me a knife and fork. A definite cookbook photo. Looks delicious. All the green veggies really help to add interest and color to the shot. I like the colorful plate you used.', '2003-10-16 01:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(452021, 42074, 6008, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked better without the utensils. As it is they are a little distractin, especially with the blown out tips. The vibrant mix of color of the food is enough on its own, and I like the herbs/parsley/stuff on the edge of the bowl/plate.</td>', 'I think this would have looked better without the utensils. As it is they are a little distractin, especially with the blown out tips. The vibrant mix of color of the food is enough on its own, and I like the herbs/parsley/stuff on the edge of the bowl/plate.', '2003-10-16 01:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(452022, 42417, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.. and I like the way you placed it in a natural setting, a little dark, but other than that wonderful shot</td>', 'Beautiful colors.. and I like the way you placed it in a natural setting, a little dark, but other than that wonderful shot', '2003-10-16 01:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452023, 42411, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot, for some reason when I think crawfish I think Cajun.. wonderful lighting and colors are great also.</td>', 'Great shot, for some reason when I think crawfish I think Cajun.. wonderful lighting and colors are great also.', '2003-10-16 01:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(452024, 42044, 10084, '<td valign="top">You sure they''re not poisonous. Great depth of field and the bright colors of the background help to bring out the sharply focus ''rooms out of the shot. Really good details in the ''rooms.</td>', 'You sure they''re not poisonous. Great depth of field and the bright colors of the background help to bring out the sharply focus ''rooms out of the shot. Really good details in the ''rooms.', '2003-10-16 01:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(452026, 42427, 10848, '<td valign="top">I have done this..and it was wonderful..mine was banana nut bread came out great! This is a wonderful shot, tmepting browns and the silver add contrast, I like it</td>', 'I have done this..and it was wonderful..mine was banana nut bread came out great! This is a wonderful shot, tmepting browns and the silver add contrast, I like it', '2003-10-16 01:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(452028, 42074, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool shot.  My only suggestion is to take out the glare on the utensils.</td>', 'cool shot.  My only suggestion is to take out the glare on the utensils.', '2003-10-16 01:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(452031, 41995, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO this shot is WAY to busy....I don''t know where my eye is supposed to stop. <br/> <br/>Awesome focus and wonderful colors but way to busy...(did I say that already?)</td>', 'IMHO this shot is WAY to busy....I don''t know where my eye is supposed to stop.  Awesome focus and wonderful colors but way to busy...(did I say that already?)', '2003-10-16 01:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(452033, 42469, 11073, '<td valign="top">i think that the forks a little distracting because its not the whole way in the shot - i''d like to see it all the way in or the shot is strong enough to do without.  Just a thought.  Nice pic.</td>', 'i think that the forks a little distracting because its not the whole way in the shot - i''d like to see it all the way in or the shot is strong enough to do without.  Just a thought.  Nice pic.', '2003-10-16 01:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(452036, 41995, 6405, '<td valign="top">Are you going to feed an army here!?Looks tasty,nice photo for lot of subjects,9 from me!</td>', 'Are you going to feed an army here!?Looks tasty,nice photo for lot of subjects,9 from me!', '2003-10-16 01:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(452038, 42452, 11073, '<td valign="top">good try at "abstract dining" i have two suggestions: wipe the crumbs off the tablemat, and pull the same down a little so that you don''t see the wood table.  Those two things, imo, would have given you a higher score from the "stock photography group" here at dpc.  Personally, that gets old for me.  I like your impromptu creativity.  I don''t think theres a enough of it around here.  Cool shot, nice work. 7.</td>', 'good try at "abstract dining" i have two suggestions: wipe the crumbs off the tablemat, and pull the same down a little so that you don''t see the wood table.  Those two things, imo, would have given you a higher score from the "stock photography group" here at dpc.  Personally, that gets old for me.  I like your impromptu creativity.  I don''t think theres a enough of it around here.  Cool shot, nice work. 7.', '2003-10-16 01:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(452040, 42462, 6405, '<td valign="top">plate too centered,light very good,looks very tasty,8 from me!</td>', 'plate too centered,light very good,looks very tasty,8 from me!', '2003-10-16 01:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
