(452074, 42402, 10084, '<td valign="top">This brings back the memory of licking the bowl after mixing the chocolate. Interesting take on the subject. Pretty good contrast. Looks like she''s definitely enjoying the aftermath of the mixing.</td>', 'This brings back the memory of licking the bowl after mixing the chocolate. Interesting take on the subject. Pretty good contrast. Looks like she''s definitely enjoying the aftermath of the mixing.', '2003-10-16 03:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(452076, 42453, 10084, '<td valign="top">Pretty good centering of the bowl. The eggs looks pretty appetizing. The bacon looks greasy like the way it should.  Lighting gives some good shadows in the eggs to shows its texture. I''m ready for breakfast now.</td>', 'Pretty good centering of the bowl. The eggs looks pretty appetizing. The bacon looks greasy like the way it should.  Lighting gives some good shadows in the eggs to shows its texture. I''m ready for breakfast now.', '2003-10-16 03:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(452077, 42433, 10084, '<td valign="top">The way you have the composition arranged gives it a feeling of a family recipe for the bread. Gives a feeling of home cooking. The bread looks very soft, fluffy and tasty. I could almost smell it.The touches of color in the background helps gives it some interest.</td>', 'The way you have the composition arranged gives it a feeling of a family recipe for the bread. Gives a feeling of home cooking. The bread looks very soft, fluffy and tasty. I could almost smell it.The touches of color in the background helps gives it some interest.', '2003-10-16 03:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(452078, 42427, 10084, '<td valign="top">I have never seen this type of breat before. It''s such a good idea for a mold. The lighting that you have gives it a dreamy type feeling. Kind of like remembering about the home cooking from the past.</td>', 'I have never seen this type of breat before. It''s such a good idea for a mold. The lighting that you have gives it a dreamy type feeling. Kind of like remembering about the home cooking from the past.', '2003-10-16 03:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(452079, 41990, 10084, '<td valign="top">Love the interesting pattern that you arrange the eggs in. Deviled eggs are excellent and if these taste as good as they look you are very lucky. The great bold shadows help to give extra interest to the shot. All the colors that are represented in the subject helps to make them pop out of the shot. Definitely a great cookbook type photo.</td>', 'Love the interesting pattern that you arrange the eggs in. Deviled eggs are excellent and if these taste as good as they look you are very lucky. The great bold shadows help to give extra interest to the shot. All the colors that are represented in the subject helps to make them pop out of the shot. Definitely a great cookbook type photo.', '2003-10-16 03:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(452081, 42429, 51167, '<td valign="top">I don''t care too much for the ginger or the cucumbers, but adding the masago is a great idea for california rolls.  You also don''t have enough wasabi.  Did you roll these yourself?  I love making sushi.  The last time I did it though, we were making some for my mother-in-law and I about burned her house down cause I let the hot oil burn dry when we were making tempura.  Photowise the picture is pretty good, I think that you should have cropped out the bottom of the plate a little more, but I love sushi so that overtakes the score in my book.</td>', 'I don''t care too much for the ginger or the cucumbers, but adding the masago is a great idea for california rolls.  You also don''t have enough wasabi.  Did you roll these yourself?  I love making sushi.  The last time I did it though, we were making some for my mother-in-law and I about burned her house down cause I let the hot oil burn dry when we were making tempura.  Photowise the picture is pretty good, I think that you should have cropped out the bottom of the plate a little more, but I love sushi so that overtakes the score in my book.', '2003-10-16 03:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(452082, 42335, 6504, '<td valign="top">That is VERY GOOD.  I can smell, taste the coffe.  Compostion is terrific, color perfect   I like everything about it.</td>', 'That is VERY GOOD.  I can smell, taste the coffe.  Compostion is terrific, color perfect   I like everything about it.', '2003-10-16 03:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(452083, 42370, 12902, '<td valign="top">Great combination of colours, excellent shot and yummy looking dessert. I don''t know much about photos but I like what I see here. I''ll be looking to see what is the colour of the ribbon you will get.</td>', 'Great combination of colours, excellent shot and yummy looking dessert. I don''t know much about photos but I like what I see here. I''ll be looking to see what is the colour of the ribbon you will get.', '2003-10-16 03:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(452084, 42411, 51167, '<td valign="top">Very awesome photo.  DOF is perfect and the focus and detail are great.  Colors fit wonderfully and I like the green in the bottom corner.  I had one of those things on my honeymoon and I didn''t like them.  The one that I had, had little red eggs all in it and it was kind of gross.  Awesome shot though.</td>', 'Very awesome photo.  DOF is perfect and the focus and detail are great.  Colors fit wonderfully and I like the green in the bottom corner.  I had one of those things on my honeymoon and I didn''t like them.  The one that I had, had little red eggs all in it and it was kind of gross.  Awesome shot though.', '2003-10-16 03:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(452087, 42467, 6504, '<td valign="top">Oh yes!!  Very appealing, colors beautiful, the lighting, compostion - good.  I have nothing but praise for this one.  Just wish I could bite into one.</td>', 'Oh yes!!  Very appealing, colors beautiful, the lighting, compostion - good.  I have nothing but praise for this one.  Just wish I could bite into one.', '2003-10-16 03:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(452088, 42453, 12902, '<td valign="top">This makes me hungry. I''ll be back after I''ll have some scrambled eggs and bacon. I won''t be the only one having this probably.</td>', 'This makes me hungry. I''ll be back after I''ll have some scrambled eggs and bacon. I won''t be the only one having this probably.', '2003-10-16 03:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(452090, 42381, 6504, '<td valign="top">oh please....noooo.    Cute idea.  Creative.</td>', 'oh please....noooo.    Cute idea.  Creative.', '2003-10-16 03:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(452091, 42098, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent looking food and excellent shot. One of the best I''ve seen. A ribbon, I hope.</td>', 'Excellent looking food and excellent shot. One of the best I''ve seen. A ribbon, I hope.', '2003-10-16 03:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(452092, 42433, 6504, '<td valign="top">I would like a bite of this bread right now!!  It is perfect color, compostion, lighting.<br/>Please , how about the recipe?  The blurred family picture is a nice touch. I might have eliminated the flowers.   Excellent photo, tho.</td>', 'I would like a bite of this bread right now!!  It is perfect color, compostion, lighting.Please , how about the recipe?  The blurred family picture is a nice touch. I might have eliminated the flowers.   Excellent photo, tho.', '2003-10-16 03:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(452094, 42431, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great colors, nicely focused.  The bread looks quite appetizing.  Lighting looks good as well. 8</td>', 'Great colors, nicely focused.  The bread looks quite appetizing.  Lighting looks good as well. 8', '2003-10-16 03:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(452097, 41990, 11923, '<td valign="top">I do love deviled eggs!  The color contrasts are very nice, I do wish the focus extended to all of the eggs.  Its a solid image but I find myself looking for an additional piece to the composition to add more depth - I''m not sure what, a prop of some sort maybe?  6</td>', 'I do love deviled eggs!  The color contrasts are very nice, I do wish the focus extended to all of the eggs.  Its a solid image but I find myself looking for an additional piece to the composition to add more depth - I''m not sure what, a prop of some sort maybe?  6', '2003-10-16 03:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(452098, 42028, 9906, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft on the bread...otherwise very nice!</td>', 'Focus is a little soft on the bread...otherwise very nice!', '2003-10-16 03:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(452099, 42100, 12316, '<td valign="top">This looks really good ... I''m hungry :)</td>', 'This looks really good ... I''m hungry :)', '2003-10-16 03:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(452100, 42028, 11923, '<td valign="top">Yum!  Great color, the lighting is good too.  I like the fact that the lemon cup is mostly in focus, but as a personal preference since the bread is an important aspect, I would''ve liked the bread to be sharper as well - the focus over there seems to be on the powdered sugar bits on the table 6</td>', 'Yum!  Great color, the lighting is good too.  I like the fact that the lemon cup is mostly in focus, but as a personal preference since the bread is an important aspect, I would''ve liked the bread to be sharper as well - the focus over there seems to be on the powdered sugar bits on the table 6', '2003-10-16 03:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(452102, 42199, 12316, '<td valign="top">Sweeeeeet ... cool ...</td>', 'Sweeeeeet ... cool ...', '2003-10-16 03:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(452103, 42370, 9906, '<td valign="top">This needs more light...</td>', 'This needs more light...', '2003-10-16 03:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452104, 42409, 11923, '<td valign="top">Looks decadent!  The background detracts from the composition to me, and the image has a harsh edge to it to me, like its been too contrasted or over-sharpened?  I like the presentation of the image - very balanced and well thought out. 5</td>', 'Looks decadent!  The background detracts from the composition to me, and the image has a harsh edge to it to me, like its been too contrasted or over-sharpened?  I like the presentation of the image - very balanced and well thought out. 5', '2003-10-16 03:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(452105, 42441, 5728, '<td valign="top">Looks great, I''m hungry now :-) This surely would not be enough to fill me up though, I''d need about 10 helpings of it. And I can''t seem to see the pasta anywhere, I see the tuna and I see the sprouts but no pasta. Doesn''t matter, Ilike this one and you probably could sell it as a stock photograph - 9.</td>', 'Looks great, I''m hungry now :-) This surely would not be enough to fill me up though, I''d need about 10 helpings of it. And I can''t seem to see the pasta anywhere, I see the tuna and I see the sprouts but no pasta. Doesn''t matter, Ilike this one and you probably could sell it as a stock photograph - 9.', '2003-10-16 03:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(452106, 42231, 11923, '<td valign="top">Love to see what it looks like done!  Nice color contrasts, I like the fact that this is taken in process rather than after - it gives the image more energy, more of a story.  The lighting works well and the important areas look to be in focus.  I am distracted by the red border - I find it pulls my eyes away instead of inward.  7</td>', 'Love to see what it looks like done!  Nice color contrasts, I like the fact that this is taken in process rather than after - it gives the image more energy, more of a story.  The lighting works well and the important areas look to be in focus.  I am distracted by the red border - I find it pulls my eyes away instead of inward.  7', '2003-10-16 03:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(452108, 42370, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great profusion of color.  Seems a bit over-sized for the plate, but that could be the perspective.  I like the presentation and the lighting.  Focus appears to be good.  7</td>', 'Great profusion of color.  Seems a bit over-sized for the plate, but that could be the perspective.  I like the presentation and the lighting.  Focus appears to be good.  7', '2003-10-16 03:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(452109, 42427, 11923, '<td valign="top">How different!  I''ve never heard of coffee can bread.  I like the lighting and the color is nice and neutral which plays well with the light.  I like that you chose to have the picture framed by the oven - completes the image nicely.  My only real change would be to crop or center it so that that little bit of can wasn''t cut off.  Excellent job!  8</td>', 'How different!  I''ve never heard of coffee can bread.  I like the lighting and the color is nice and neutral which plays well with the light.  I like that you chose to have the picture framed by the oven - completes the image nicely.  My only real change would be to crop or center it so that that little bit of can wasn''t cut off.  Excellent job!  8', '2003-10-16 03:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(452111, 42417, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting color play!  Everything looks to be in good focus, I like the clearish bowl allowing the background in beneath.  I do like the idea behind the background too, but with the low light it doesn''t set the salad off as much as a different bkgrnd might.  I do like the way the lavender/purple inner border ties the photo together.  7</td>', 'Interesting color play!  Everything looks to be in good focus, I like the clearish bowl allowing the background in beneath.  I do like the idea behind the background too, but with the low light it doesn''t set the salad off as much as a different bkgrnd might.  I do like the way the lavender/purple inner border ties the photo together.  7', '2003-10-16 03:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(452112, 42294, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!  I like the way this looks against the black background, but I think it would look even better if the green was highlighted a bit more - more vivid.  Perhaps more pods would give the image a bit more depth/interest points.  6</td>', 'Nice idea!  I like the way this looks against the black background, but I think it would look even better if the green was highlighted a bit more - more vivid.  Perhaps more pods would give the image a bit more depth/interest points.  6', '2003-10-16 03:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(452113, 41860, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective!  The deep reddish black color goes nicely with the glass and white.  The lighting is effective, but I do find the glare on the berries a tiny bit disturbing to the eye.  Over-all a marvelous shot!  7</td>', 'Interesting perspective!  The deep reddish black color goes nicely with the glass and white.  The lighting is effective, but I do find the glare on the berries a tiny bit disturbing to the eye.  Over-all a marvelous shot!  7', '2003-10-16 04:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(452114, 42392, 11923, '<td valign="top">Mmm psketti.. ;)   I like how the ingredients have been put out.  Everything looks appetizing, the focus is good and for the most part the lighting is good.  I do find the cheese? in the bottom right corner to be distracting due to the light source.  6</td>', 'Mmm psketti.. ;)   I like how the ingredients have been put out.  Everything looks appetizing, the focus is good and for the most part the lighting is good.  I do find the cheese? in the bottom right corner to be distracting due to the light source.  6', '2003-10-16 04:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(452116, 42433, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wonderful presentation!  I really like the added touch of the oldtime photo in the background.  The bread looks fantastic - fresh and ready to eat.  The focus is great, lighting is clear and perfect in my opinion.  I even like the border for this shot.  10</td>', 'Wonderful presentation!  I really like the added touch of the oldtime photo in the background.  The bread looks fantastic - fresh and ready to eat.  The focus is great, lighting is clear and perfect in my opinion.  I even like the border for this shot.  10', '2003-10-16 04:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(452117, 42411, 10887, '<td valign="top">This must be a shot from Sweden! Don´t know anywhere else where people eat the crawfish with dillkronor! A very very good picture, so sharp and just perfect!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-23 01:12:23.</i></td>', 'This must be a shot from Sweden! Don´t know anywhere else where people eat the crawfish with dillkronor! A very very good picture, so sharp and just perfect!', '2003-10-16 04:07:24.000000', '2003-10-23 02:12:23.000000', 1),
(452118, 41610, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love color and this has oodles!  Great setup, the color play is perfect. Lighting looks a bit over-bright, particularly in the cheese and lemon rinds.  The tomatoes have just a bit too much glare as well.  But as a whole this ia marvelous shot.  7</td>', 'I love color and this has oodles!  Great setup, the color play is perfect. Lighting looks a bit over-bright, particularly in the cheese and lemon rinds.  The tomatoes have just a bit too much glare as well.  But as a whole this ia marvelous shot.  7', '2003-10-16 04:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(452119, 42467, 10887, '<td valign="top">I know how good they taste! A good shot!</td>', 'I know how good they taste! A good shot!', '2003-10-16 04:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(452120, 42411, 11923, '<td valign="top">eww.. heh.  Great closeup, fantastic brilliant colors - I like the yellow &amp; green against the red.  Not overly cluttered, great focus.  Only complaint is that sprig of whatever in the lower left corner, fairly distracting.  7</td>', 'eww.. heh.  Great closeup, fantastic brilliant colors - I like the yellow & green against the red.  Not overly cluttered, great focus.  Only complaint is that sprig of whatever in the lower left corner, fairly distracting.  7', '2003-10-16 04:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(452122, 42044, 6349, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Make sure to pick em and use em before they get inky!  I think this will do well.</td>', 'Awesome!  Make sure to pick em and use em before they get inky!  I think this will do well.', '2003-10-16 04:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(452123, 42419, 12578, '<td valign="top">Just shooting the main dish itself with possibley an object or two behind or at the side would have been fine bit to me there is too much clutter on the left to warrant a top mark, good looking tasty dish and scores well for that in my view ! ;0)</td>', 'Just shooting the main dish itself with possibley an object or two behind or at the side would have been fine bit to me there is too much clutter on the left to warrant a top mark, good looking tasty dish and scores well for that in my view ! ;0)', '2003-10-16 04:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(452124, 42074, 12578, '<td valign="top">The food looks to be about to slide off the left hand side of the shot, it also looks unbalanced from the wine glass too , the fork that is cropped short seems odd too, nice what youve done with the chives ! ;0)</td>', 'The food looks to be about to slide off the left hand side of the shot, it also looks unbalanced from the wine glass too , the fork that is cropped short seems odd too, nice what youve done with the chives ! ;0)', '2003-10-16 04:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(452125, 42238, 2279, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this more if it was against an all green background. The White is somewhat distracting. 7.</td>', 'I would have liked this more if it was against an all green background. The White is somewhat distracting. 7.', '2003-10-16 04:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(452126, 41981, 2279, '<td valign="top">I wish there was more of a distinct line between the top of the plate and the white background.</td>', 'I wish there was more of a distinct line between the top of the plate and the white background.', '2003-10-16 04:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(452128, 42022, 2279, '<td valign="top">What is that on the bottom right of the shot? It does not look like it should be there.</td>', 'What is that on the bottom right of the shot? It does not look like it should be there.', '2003-10-16 04:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(452131, 42411, 2279, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Should do well. 10.<br/> <br/>Edit: This is my pick for first.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Should do well. 10. Edit: This is my pick for first.', '2003-10-16 04:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(452136, 42238, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed with wonderful attention to background. Great colours. Very appetising. Biggest strawb doesn''t seem quite sharp though.</td>', 'Beautifully composed with wonderful attention to background. Great colours. Very appetising. Biggest strawb doesn''t seem quite sharp though.', '2003-10-16 05:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(452137, 42294, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - the kind of image I could see being used in advertising campaigns. I''m self employed and working on a huge project for a posh UK food retailer/ supermarket and this is just the kind of image they are a) adorning their offices and corridors with and b) commissioning for the project I''m working on.</td>', 'Beautiful - the kind of image I could see being used in advertising campaigns. I''m self employed and working on a huge project for a posh UK food retailer/ supermarket and this is just the kind of image they are a) adorning their offices and corridors with and b) commissioning for the project I''m working on.', '2003-10-16 05:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(452138, 42431, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice attention to detail (no fussy background or extraneous objects in frame) but I really find myself wanting to see the fondue itself and assuming the pot is empty!</td>', 'Nice attention to detail (no fussy background or extraneous objects in frame) but I really find myself wanting to see the fondue itself and assuming the pot is empty!', '2003-10-16 05:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(452139, 41981, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great colours - wonderfully vivid and very appealing. Like the use of white plate on white background to really pull focus onto food and nothing else.</td>', 'Great colours - wonderfully vivid and very appealing. Like the use of white plate on white background to really pull focus onto food and nothing else.', '2003-10-16 05:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(452140, 42100, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea on presentation - much more interesting than seeing a static bowl of the stuff... looks wonderful. Background has a little shadow to the lower left (which could easily be edited out post challenge). Great shot!</td>', 'Nice idea on presentation - much more interesting than seeing a static bowl of the stuff... looks wonderful. Background has a little shadow to the lower left (which could easily be edited out post challenge). Great shot!', '2003-10-16 05:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(452141, 42199, 3087, '<td valign="top">Looks great and I love the composition - works very well indeed. The clean white of plate and background work well, especially when separated by the tea towel to give shape to the edge of the plate and to contrast with all the reds.</td>', 'Looks great and I love the composition - works very well indeed. The clean white of plate and background work well, especially when separated by the tea towel to give shape to the edge of the plate and to contrast with all the reds.', '2003-10-16 05:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(452142, 42335, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very professional, nice use of DOF to throw out beans on table surface and focus on those in cup. Composition with curved sweep of cup edge and then handle... love it!</td>', 'Very professional, nice use of DOF to throw out beans on table surface and focus on those in cup. Composition with curved sweep of cup edge and then handle... love it!', '2003-10-16 05:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(452143, 42411, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonal composition, great use of a touch of vivid green and blue to contrast with the crawfish. Detail in the eyes very good. Very professional.</td>', 'Nice diagonal composition, great use of a touch of vivid green and blue to contrast with the crawfish. Detail in the eyes very good. Very professional.', '2003-10-16 05:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452144, 42441, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very muted colours, I can imagine this working in an advert with text over some of the image. Nice perspective and I like the out of focus bowl in the background. Adds interest without interfering.</td>', 'Very muted colours, I can imagine this working in an advert with text over some of the image. Nice perspective and I like the out of focus bowl in the background. Adds interest without interfering.', '2003-10-16 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(452146, 42381, 8643, '<td valign="top">Laughed out loud - good photo too!</td>', 'Laughed out loud - good photo too!', '2003-10-16 06:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(452147, 42012, 8643, '<td valign="top">Good enough to eat!</td>', 'Good enough to eat!', '2003-10-16 06:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(452148, 41593, 8643, '<td valign="top">A little more light from the front may have improved this but this is one of the best, beautifully crisp and nicely presented.</td>', 'A little more light from the front may have improved this but this is one of the best, beautifully crisp and nicely presented.', '2003-10-16 06:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(452151, 42462, 8643, '<td valign="top">The food looks good and I love the the muted tones of the background - the colours of the items on the plate are enhanced by its mainly white colour.  Excellent control of exposure in difficult lighting conditions and the DoF is just right.</td>', 'The food looks good and I love the the muted tones of the background - the colours of the items on the plate are enhanced by its mainly white colour.  Excellent control of exposure in difficult lighting conditions and the DoF is just right.', '2003-10-16 06:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(452200, 41995, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points: At first I was thinking 3, too cluttered, but it kind of works I think, I would expect to see this kind of thing in an old cook book, a traditional one. Composed well, and great colors. Very seasonal<br/>Bad Points:Perhaps slightly too much going on..and would have left out the china.<br/>Final Score:8</td>', 'Good Points: At first I was thinking 3, too cluttered, but it kind of works I think, I would expect to see this kind of thing in an old cook book, a traditional one. Composed well, and great colors. Very seasonalBad Points:Perhaps slightly too much going on..and would have left out the china.Final Score:8', '2003-10-16 07:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(452202, 41593, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:well composed, and a nice subject. Inclusion of flower is good idea. Good textures on the tablecloth.<br/>Bad Points:slightly underlit with the white plate not being white enough. try using curves if you have photoshop.  Also a bit more blue at the bottom, perhaps a bit too closley cropped.<br/>Overall Score:7</td>', 'Good Points:well composed, and a nice subject. Inclusion of flower is good idea. Good textures on the tablecloth.Bad Points:slightly underlit with the white plate not being white enough. try using curves if you have photoshop.  Also a bit more blue at the bottom, perhaps a bit too closley cropped.Overall Score:7', '2003-10-16 07:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452203, 41610, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:nice idea with the different colors, like the way you have centred teh lemon.<br/>Bad Points:way to brightly lit. A lot of detail has been lost as a result of that and the lemons are blown out.<br/>Overall Score:4</td>', 'Good Points:nice idea with the different colors, like the way you have centred teh lemon.Bad Points:way to brightly lit. A lot of detail has been lost as a result of that and the lemons are blown out.Overall Score:4', '2003-10-16 07:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(452205, 42452, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:creative thinking with teh composition<br/>Bad Points: sadly it doesn''t work for me, if the plates were closer this would be much better I feel. Also the food on the fork doesn''t look pretty<br/>Overall Score:3</td>', 'Good Points:creative thinking with teh compositionBad Points: sadly it doesn''t work for me, if the plates were closer this would be much better I feel. Also the food on the fork doesn''t look prettyOverall Score:3', '2003-10-16 07:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(452206, 42335, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:awsome focusing, good choice of apature, composition is spot on<br/>Bad Points:woudl like to have seen more enphassis on actual cooking, but guess your legal being before ;)<br/>Overall Score:9</td>', 'Good Points:awsome focusing, good choice of apature, composition is spot onBad Points:woudl like to have seen more enphassis on actual cooking, but guess your legal being before ;)Overall Score:9', '2003-10-16 07:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(452211, 42074, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice (Better than my effore...)  Would have liked to have seen the rest of the first piece of cutlery. Nice decoration around the bowl too!</td>', 'Very nice (Better than my effore...)  Would have liked to have seen the rest of the first piece of cutlery. Nice decoration around the bowl too!', '2003-10-16 08:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
