(452243, 42195, 11678, '<td valign="top">Oh my... hard to critisize, but I will. First, I gave you a 9... now-- I think that you needed to get the "white balance" to match the lighting. I think the yellowish tinge is probably avoidable though it would be work, I''m sure. The ''cream'' could get away with being yellowish, but not the doillies. I do have a gamma matched monitor and I''ll admit that my critique is on the edge. The photo is, otherwise, flawless.</td>', 'Oh my... hard to critisize, but I will. First, I gave you a 9... now-- I think that you needed to get the "white balance" to match the lighting. I think the yellowish tinge is probably avoidable though it would be work, I''m sure. The ''cream'' could get away with being yellowish, but not the doillies. I do have a gamma matched monitor and I''ll admit that my critique is on the edge. The photo is, otherwise, flawless.', '2003-10-16 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(452245, 42022, 11678, '<td valign="top">Terrific apple photo ! BUT... didn''t meet guidelines. Supposed to be the ''result'' not the ingrediant. Still, I''ll give a 7</td>', 'Terrific apple photo ! BUT... didn''t meet guidelines. Supposed to be the ''result'' not the ingrediant. Still, I''ll give a 7', '2003-10-16 09:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
