(452290, 42439, 11678, '<td valign="top">9.. would have been 10 except I think it needed one more contrasting element to balance image... perhaps even more of the pan edge would have worked. I know I''m being picky, but it''s my opinion.<br/>Oh, man I''m hungry</td>', '9.. would have been 10 except I think it needed one more contrasting element to balance image... perhaps even more of the pan edge would have worked. I know I''m being picky, but it''s my opinion.Oh, man I''m hungry', '2003-10-16 09:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(452293, 42012, 6624, '<td valign="top">looks delicious, and nice highlights on the sauce - not so nice on the edge of the serving dish but a small detraction</td>', 'looks delicious, and nice highlights on the sauce - not so nice on the edge of the serving dish but a small detraction', '2003-10-16 09:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(452294, 42074, 11155, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and colors.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent lighting and colors.  Good luck!', '2003-10-16 09:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(452295, 42429, 6624, '<td valign="top">looks delicious and beutifully presented - the high key approach with shadows very nice</td>', 'looks delicious and beutifully presented - the high key approach with shadows very nice', '2003-10-16 09:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452298, 42433, 11155, '<td valign="top">Good lighting - I''m not sure, but I think this would look with a deeper DOF, maybe.  8 from me.</td>', 'Good lighting - I''m not sure, but I think this would look with a deeper DOF, maybe.  8 from me.', '2003-10-16 09:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(452300, 41981, 6624, '<td valign="top">this looks wonderfully and the presentation is very fine - nice to have the courage to do it all white</td>', 'this looks wonderfully and the presentation is very fine - nice to have the courage to do it all white', '2003-10-16 09:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(452305, 42462, 6624, '<td valign="top">there''s a lushness is the presentation that is very satis fying - now I am ravenous</td>', 'there''s a lushness is the presentation that is very satis fying - now I am ravenous', '2003-10-16 09:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(452308, 42231, 6624, '<td valign="top">this looks delicious, I can''t wait for the recipe</td>', 'this looks delicious, I can''t wait for the recipe', '2003-10-16 09:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(452309, 42462, 11155, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  It looks like a picture straight from an elegant food magazine.  Great lighting, wonderful placement of the items and it looks delicious.  10 from me!</td>', 'This is beautiful.  It looks like a picture straight from an elegant food magazine.  Great lighting, wonderful placement of the items and it looks delicious.  10 from me!', '2003-10-16 09:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(452311, 42411, 11155, '<td valign="top">Great color, excellent lighting.  I like the DOF.</td>', 'Great color, excellent lighting.  I like the DOF.', '2003-10-16 09:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(452313, 42392, 11155, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks a little harsh and most of the image is out of focus.  The ingredients are placed well, especially the pasta.</td>', 'The lighting looks a little harsh and most of the image is out of focus.  The ingredients are placed well, especially the pasta.', '2003-10-16 09:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(452315, 42267, 11155, '<td valign="top">The focus is on the edge of the tomato - would like to have seen more of the image focused.  The blue, red and yellow make for a nice contrast.</td>', 'The focus is on the edge of the tomato - would like to have seen more of the image focused.  The blue, red and yellow make for a nice contrast.', '2003-10-16 09:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452358, 42420, 6624, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait for the recipe for this one...what a color</td>', 'I can''t wait for the recipe for this one...what a color', '2003-10-16 10:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452361, 42100, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice approach to presenting the food in photographic image...look very bite-able</td>', 'nice approach to presenting the food in photographic image...look very bite-able', '2003-10-16 10:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452368, 42417, 3585, '<td valign="top">Good staging idea, would have worked best with some plainer looking preparation. There is too much similarity in and out of this circle to set off your salad well.</td>', 'Good staging idea, would have worked best with some plainer looking preparation. There is too much similarity in and out of this circle to set off your salad well.', '2003-10-16 10:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(452374, 42429, 3585, '<td valign="top">This looks good ( I go crazy with wasabi) Would have been more spectacular on a darker dish, possibly.</td>', 'This looks good ( I go crazy with wasabi) Would have been more spectacular on a darker dish, possibly.', '2003-10-16 10:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(452376, 42441, 3585, '<td valign="top">Very unusual angle for a food shot. interesting</td>', 'Very unusual angle for a food shot. interesting', '2003-10-16 10:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(452378, 42238, 3585, '<td valign="top">Good volume placement in this composition. If you brush your fruits with a little oil they will appear much fresher on the picture.</td>', 'Good volume placement in this composition. If you brush your fruits with a little oil they will appear much fresher on the picture.', '2003-10-16 10:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(452383, 42044, 3585, '<td valign="top">These are great mushrooms, but at a much earlier stage of growth, when just an inch high, lighty sauteed in butter.</td>', 'These are great mushrooms, but at a much earlier stage of growth, when just an inch high, lighty sauteed in butter.', '2003-10-16 10:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452387, 42044, 10887, '<td valign="top">A really nice picture here! And I know that omelette will taste good, I picked this kind of mushrooms just the other day here in Sweden and they are soooo good! Very well done taking this photo. Can´t wait to get the recipe!  <br/>Regards/Kaja Lund<br/></td>', 'A really nice picture here! And I know that omelette will taste good, I picked this kind of mushrooms just the other day here in Sweden and they are soooo good! Very well done taking this photo. Can´t wait to get the recipe!  Regards/Kaja Lund', '2003-10-16 10:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452388, 42428, 9906, '<td valign="top">With such a high-key simple approach as this the lines on the bottom are a little distractiong.</td>', 'With such a high-key simple approach as this the lines on the bottom are a little distractiong.', '2003-10-16 10:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(452389, 42028, 10887, '<td valign="top">Looks tasty! And a good shot, well done!</td>', 'Looks tasty! And a good shot, well done!', '2003-10-16 10:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(452391, 42431, 3585, '<td valign="top">Not that many will notice or mind, being Swiss, I can tell you this is not cheese fondue equipment. This a meat fondue set (Fondue bourguignone) with the typical color coded forks. otherwise neat and well balanced composition with a nice set of tones. 7</td>', 'Not that many will notice or mind, being Swiss, I can tell you this is not cheese fondue equipment. This a meat fondue set (Fondue bourguignone) with the typical color coded forks. otherwise neat and well balanced composition with a nice set of tones. 7', '2003-10-16 10:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(452392, 42384, 10887, '<td valign="top">Yep.. disaster it is... But a good photo, well arranged. Well done!</td>', 'Yep.. disaster it is... But a good photo, well arranged. Well done!', '2003-10-16 10:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(452393, 41523, 9906, '<td valign="top">Technically not food (wink). Very nice image.  Love the reflections.  Would love to see it with the bottle in the mirror being in focus.  Not sure that would WORK but would like to see it!</td>', 'Technically not food (wink). Very nice image.  Love the reflections.  Would love to see it with the bottle in the mirror being in focus.  Not sure that would WORK but would like to see it!', '2003-10-16 10:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(452394, 42231, 10887, '<td valign="top">This makes me hungry. Well done with this photo!</td>', 'This makes me hungry. Well done with this photo!', '2003-10-16 10:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(452395, 42392, 10887, '<td valign="top">Well arranged!</td>', 'Well arranged!', '2003-10-16 11:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(452396, 42472, 10887, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and light, well done! Looks tasty too!</td>', 'Nice colors and light, well done! Looks tasty too!', '2003-10-16 11:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(452397, 42470, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not terribly interesting to look at.  I do like the shadow and highlights in the ''L478'' on the center top tablet and would probably tried to arrange it so you saw more of them with different lighting angles depending on location in pile!  Good dof, but a touch noisy in the red of the plate (intentional?).</td>', 'Not terribly interesting to look at.  I do like the shadow and highlights in the ''L478'' on the center top tablet and would probably tried to arrange it so you saw more of them with different lighting angles depending on location in pile!  Good dof, but a touch noisy in the red of the plate (intentional?).', '2003-10-16 11:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(452398, 41981, 11800, '<td valign="top">Might not be able to vote. Wanted to leave a note. I really like the cleaness of this, the composition and colors. The missing back edge of the plate is the only thing I don''t like.  Maybe a different base color would have worked better. I apologize if this is what you intended.</td>', 'Might not be able to vote. Wanted to leave a note. I really like the cleaness of this, the composition and colors. The missing back edge of the plate is the only thing I don''t like.  Maybe a different base color would have worked better. I apologize if this is what you intended.', '2003-10-16 11:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(452401, 41981, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice image!  Great focus (a little hard to see much detail in the lime though) and DOF!  Nice selection of colors.  I would have used a slightly different color for plate or background.   I''m distracted from the image by trying to find the edge of the plate especially in the background.</td>', 'Nice image!  Great focus (a little hard to see much detail in the lime though) and DOF!  Nice selection of colors.  I would have used a slightly different color for plate or background.   I''m distracted from the image by trying to find the edge of the plate especially in the background.', '2003-10-16 11:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(452402, 42074, 3585, '<td valign="top">"Elicoidali Lovers" to be precise. I like the thyme rim on the platter.</td>', '"Elicoidali Lovers" to be precise. I like the thyme rim on the platter.', '2003-10-16 11:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(452403, 42381, 11678, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2003-10-16 11:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(452405, 42100, 11678, '<td valign="top">gotta be a 10</td>', 'gotta be a 10', '2003-10-16 11:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(452406, 42238, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Only thing I would have tried to change would be to make the frosting on the cake level with the plate.  (a piece closer to the center of the cake?)  Oh and I would have liked a touch more DOF to get a little detail in the milk glass.  Did you paint the berries to get more shine?</td>', 'Nice shot.  Only thing I would have tried to change would be to make the frosting on the cake level with the plate.  (a piece closer to the center of the cake?)  Oh and I would have liked a touch more DOF to get a little detail in the milk glass.  Did you paint the berries to get more shine?', '2003-10-16 11:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452407, 41984, 11678, '<td valign="top">Too low key for me, only a 9</td>', 'Too low key for me, only a 9', '2003-10-16 11:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(452408, 41981, 3585, '<td valign="top">One of the only ones with a contemporary flare to it. Too bad the plate disappears totally in the background.</td>', 'One of the only ones with a contemporary flare to it. Too bad the plate disappears totally in the background.', '2003-10-16 11:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(452409, 41984, 10702, '<td valign="top">Do you always eat off the floor ?</td>', 'Do you always eat off the floor ?', '2003-10-16 11:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(452411, 42028, 11678, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see tighter focus on the ''bread'', so only a 9. Very nice otherwise</td>', 'I would have liked to see tighter focus on the ''bread'', so only a 9. Very nice otherwise', '2003-10-16 11:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(452413, 42441, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the slant.  Where''s the pasta BTW?  Nice focus but DOF is a little shallow IMHO!</td>', 'Not sure I like the slant.  Where''s the pasta BTW?  Nice focus but DOF is a little shallow IMHO!', '2003-10-16 11:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(452414, 42381, 3585, '<td valign="top">I have an old American community cook book that has a recipe that starts with "take 80 squirells, dressed and cut up"</td>', 'I have an old American community cook book that has a recipe that starts with "take 80 squirells, dressed and cut up"', '2003-10-16 11:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(452416, 42472, 11678, '<td valign="top">I''m giving a 10. My only comments would be that I think the grouping is a little too tight. But who knows.... I''m comfortable with it.</td>', 'I''m giving a 10. My only comments would be that I think the grouping is a little too tight. But who knows.... I''m comfortable with it.', '2003-10-16 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(452419, 42447, 9550, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, maybe a little to much. Nice clear shot. Very nice arangment.</td>', 'Good lighting, maybe a little to much. Nice clear shot. Very nice arangment.', '2003-10-16 11:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(452422, 42335, 11678, '<td valign="top">I''ll go 10 because I know it rates it. I am a little uncomfortable with it but can''t figure out why. Perhaps the lack of another contrasting object ? hhmmm... althought the lettering may fit that bill. Ain''t I picky...</td>', 'I''ll go 10 because I know it rates it. I am a little uncomfortable with it but can''t figure out why. Perhaps the lack of another contrasting object ? hhmmm... althought the lettering may fit that bill. Ain''t I picky...', '2003-10-16 11:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(452423, 42381, 9411, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to see the recipe. Very good opportunistic shot. 7</td>', 'Can''t wait to see the recipe. Very good opportunistic shot. 7', '2003-10-16 11:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(452424, 41508, 11678, '<td valign="top">I''ll go 9. I can only think that the lighting doesn''t quite work for me. Perhaps just a tiny bit from the left may have helped.... Brighten up that outside cookie edge just a hair. Sorry I''m being so picky.</td>', 'I''ll go 9. I can only think that the lighting doesn''t quite work for me. Perhaps just a tiny bit from the left may have helped.... Brighten up that outside cookie edge just a hair. Sorry I''m being so picky.', '2003-10-16 11:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(452425, 42462, 9411, '<td valign="top">Bravo, looking forward to this recipe.  The shot is a bit busy for my tastes. Having a plate with squares and a mat with plaid is too much. I might have left the fork and napkin out also.  Manga!  7</td>', 'Bravo, looking forward to this recipe.  The shot is a bit busy for my tastes. Having a plate with squares and a mat with plaid is too much. I might have left the fork and napkin out also.  Manga!  7', '2003-10-16 11:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(452426, 41523, 9411, '<td valign="top">mmm, very nice, creative angle. I\''m distracted by the line (?) in the upper left of the glass. It\''s part of the cut design of the glass I think. Possibley a plain uncut glass would have been better. Keep with the other clean lines of the shot. 7</td>', 'mmm, very nice, creative angle. I\''m distracted by the line (?) in the upper left of the glass. It\''s part of the cut design of the glass I think. Possibley a plain uncut glass would have been better. Keep with the other clean lines of the shot. 7', '2003-10-16 11:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(452428, 42370, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very tasty looking. The dof is a little short, and I would have used a much bigger plate, this presentation looks crowed.</td>', 'Very tasty looking. The dof is a little short, and I would have used a much bigger plate, this presentation looks crowed.', '2003-10-16 11:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(452429, 42428, 3585, '<td valign="top">Very well done, smart move. And luckily for you, no one had the same idea...</td>', 'Very well done, smart move. And luckily for you, no one had the same idea...', '2003-10-16 11:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(452430, 42267, 11678, '<td valign="top">Getting an 8. Focus and arraignment are my issues. I would have pulled back and tried to get the plate edge to give some ''linear'' object edge for contrast. The focus speaks for itself. I do know that the focus it tough at this distance.</td>', 'Getting an 8. Focus and arraignment are my issues. I would have pulled back and tried to get the plate edge to give some ''linear'' object edge for contrast. The focus speaks for itself. I do know that the focus it tough at this distance.', '2003-10-16 11:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(452431, 42012, 9411, '<td valign="top">Yum!  The dof is a little shallow, or needs to more shallow. one or the other. I like the contrast of the more formal silver platter with the casual table cloth.</td>', 'Yum!  The dof is a little shallow, or needs to more shallow. one or the other. I like the contrast of the more formal silver platter with the casual table cloth.', '2003-10-16 11:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(452432, 42462, 11678, '<td valign="top">It''s a 10.. I have no other comment to make other than- bon appetit</td>', 'It''s a 10.. I have no other comment to make other than- bon appetit', '2003-10-16 11:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(452433, 41860, 11678, '<td valign="top">oooh.. only a 9. Just a tad too dark for me. I know the color is beautiful and would have liked to see just a bit more of it. Good otherwise.</td>', 'oooh.. only a 9. Just a tad too dark for me. I know the color is beautiful and would have liked to see just a bit more of it. Good otherwise.', '2003-10-16 11:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(452435, 42420, 9411, '<td valign="top">This is  a very intersting still life. I like the compostion. I question the use of the victorian style service w/ it though. Something more rustic maybe would have fit better. Also the mousse is rather lost. in all that is going on.  It also doesn''t look quite real. But it sounds like an inovative recipe.</td>', 'This is  a very intersting still life. I like the compostion. I question the use of the victorian style service w/ it though. Something more rustic maybe would have fit better. Also the mousse is rather lost. in all that is going on.  It also doesn''t look quite real. But it sounds like an inovative recipe.', '2003-10-16 11:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(452436, 41610, 11678, '<td valign="top">Got my 10, though I would have liked to see an edge for contrast.. the bowl or plate</td>', 'Got my 10, though I would have liked to see an edge for contrast.. the bowl or plate', '2003-10-16 11:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(452437, 42441, 9411, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF. The angle on the other hand is too drastic. I keep expecting it all to slide off the screen.</td>', 'Great use of DOF. The angle on the other hand is too drastic. I keep expecting it all to slide off the screen.', '2003-10-16 11:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(452438, 42195, 656, '<td valign="top">The reflections on the table from the flower is good, and adds some colour - Almost feel this could have been better against a white background though - feels very dark.</td>', 'The reflections on the table from the flower is good, and adds some colour - Almost feel this could have been better against a white background though - feels very dark.', '2003-10-16 11:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452439, 42178, 656, '<td valign="top">Not a huge fan of the obvious manipulation - though onions cut like this make great subjects, red onions in particular.</td>', 'Not a huge fan of the obvious manipulation - though onions cut like this make great subjects, red onions in particular.', '2003-10-16 11:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(452440, 42409, 11678, '<td valign="top">Only a 9. I will get picky.. I think the part red background, though a neat idea, didn''t work right. Would have been better all white.. IMHO<br/></td>', 'Only a 9. I will get picky.. I think the part red background, though a neat idea, didn''t work right. Would have been better all white.. IMHO', '2003-10-16 11:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(452442, 42429, 656, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - good presentation and the red mat sets off the top edge too.<br/> <br/>A bit more light thrown into the ''near'' side with a reflector or flash could have helped out the ginger and lightened the shadows there ?</td>', 'Nicely done - good presentation and the red mat sets off the top edge too. A bit more light thrown into the ''near'' side with a reflector or flash could have helped out the ginger and lightened the shadows there ?', '2003-10-16 11:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(452444, 42409, 10643, '<td valign="top">looks like it''s oversharpened, the whites are so stark. very nice presentation and color though.</td>', 'looks like it''s oversharpened, the whites are so stark. very nice presentation and color though.', '2003-10-16 11:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(452445, 42429, 10643, '<td valign="top">Best I''ve seen so far! Excellent color and focus, and love love love the reflections on the plate.</td>', 'Best I''ve seen so far! Excellent color and focus, and love love love the reflections on the plate.', '2003-10-16 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(452446, 42022, 656, '<td valign="top">Is that a hair in the middle of the apple ?   Good colour, though the stuff in the upper left and lower right corners seems out of place or not needed.   If you have a polariser, that would really help cut some of the reflections and boost the saturation too.</td>', 'Is that a hair in the middle of the apple ?   Good colour, though the stuff in the upper left and lower right corners seems out of place or not needed.   If you have a polariser, that would really help cut some of the reflections and boost the saturation too.', '2003-10-16 11:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(452447, 42384, 11678, '<td valign="top">I''ll give an 8. Issues are composition.. I think the things away from the table are irrelevant. It is a ''food'' picture not a still life. And tighter focus would work. I like the effort, however. Probably a nice little meal, too.</td>', 'I''ll give an 8. Issues are composition.. I think the things away from the table are irrelevant. It is a ''food'' picture not a still life. And tighter focus would work. I like the effort, however. Probably a nice little meal, too.', '2003-10-16 11:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(452450, 42370, 10643, '<td valign="top">softer lighting instead of a flash would make this look more welcoming</td>', 'softer lighting instead of a flash would make this look more welcoming', '2003-10-16 11:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(452451, 42462, 10643, '<td valign="top">nice thoughtful composition and this looks delicious!</td>', 'nice thoughtful composition and this looks delicious!', '2003-10-16 11:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(452452, 41990, 11678, '<td valign="top">Only a 9. Focus could have been better, perhaps. And, I personally, don''t think green works that well. Makes the yolk seem greenish. Perhaps something in pink towards red, though soft, may have worked better.</td>', 'Only a 9. Focus could have been better, perhaps. And, I personally, don''t think green works that well. Makes the yolk seem greenish. Perhaps something in pink towards red, though soft, may have worked better.', '2003-10-16 11:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(452454, 42431, 10643, '<td valign="top">excellent composition, focus and color are spot on. wish it was a slightly higher angle so we could actually see the cheese!</td>', 'excellent composition, focus and color are spot on. wish it was a slightly higher angle so we could actually see the cheese!', '2003-10-16 11:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452455, 41523, 11678, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but didn''t fit challenge quite right. gets an 8</td>', 'Nice photo but didn''t fit challenge quite right. gets an 8', '2003-10-16 11:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
