(452461, 41995, 11678, '<td valign="top">wow... giving a 9. My only real issue is lighting. Perhaps more from left, if but to highlight. Was it yummy ?</td>', 'wow... giving a 9. My only real issue is lighting. Perhaps more from left, if but to highlight. Was it yummy ?', '2003-10-16 11:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
