(452468, 42453, 11678, '<td valign="top">Has all the elements but isn''t as exciting as I would have wished. Perhaps it just needs contrasting colors to take it up a notch. Some slices of orange or red pepper would have helped. Gets a 9</td>', 'Has all the elements but isn''t as exciting as I would have wished. Perhaps it just needs contrasting colors to take it up a notch. Some slices of orange or red pepper would have helped. Gets a 9', '2003-10-16 11:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
