(452475, 42392, 11678, '<td valign="top">Only an 8. I''m uncomfortable with the ''lean'' of the wall and book. Also.. was supposed to be a prepared dish. Better focus would have helped.</td>', 'Only an 8. I''m uncomfortable with the ''lean'' of the wall and book. Also.. was supposed to be a prepared dish. Better focus would have helped.', '2003-10-16 11:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
