(452478, 42420, 656, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and good balance of colours with that vibrant green.  Light or exposure seems a touch too dark though - would prefer the whites of the china to look really white.</td>', 'Very nice composition and good balance of colours with that vibrant green.  Light or exposure seems a touch too dark though - would prefer the whites of the china to look really white.', '2003-10-16 11:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
