(452568, 42417, 656, '<td valign="top">Seems very purply tinged - is the bowl purple too ?  The border probably re-enforces that.  I''m not sure it makes it more appealing.</td>', 'Seems very purply tinged - is the bowl purple too ?  The border probably re-enforces that.  I''m not sure it makes it more appealing.', '2003-10-16 12:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
