(452584, 42462, 656, '<td valign="top">great food ''styling'' very nicely put together still life.  Feels ever so slightly tilted though, but other than that excellent.  Food looks very appealing too</td>', 'great food ''styling'' very nicely put together still life.  Feels ever so slightly tilted though, but other than that excellent.  Food looks very appealing too', '2003-10-16 12:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
