(452648, 42420, 12966, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I like the placement of the elements and the choice of colors.</td>', 'Great composition. I like the placement of the elements and the choice of colors.', '2003-10-16 13:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(452650, 42028, 12966, '<td valign="top">I really like this image and the choice of focus.</td>', 'I really like this image and the choice of focus.', '2003-10-16 13:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(452655, 42012, 7190, '<td valign="top">the lighting is one of the best so far but (the old "but" again) I have been spoiled by magazines like martha''s and the like. I would have liked to see more of the galette and the place mat/table cover (have the same one) is lumpy/not flat  and the placement of the tray pulls my eye right to it.</td>', 'the lighting is one of the best so far but (the old "but" again) I have been spoiled by magazines like martha''s and the like. I would have liked to see more of the galette and the place mat/table cover (have the same one) is lumpy/not flat  and the placement of the tray pulls my eye right to it.', '2003-10-16 13:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452656, 42100, 12966, '<td valign="top">You can almost taste the pasta "al dente".</td>', 'You can almost taste the pasta "al dente".', '2003-10-16 13:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(452658, 41995, 12966, '<td valign="top">I like the colors of the elements, very well chosen. Great also the dynamic of the picture.</td>', 'I like the colors of the elements, very well chosen. Great also the dynamic of the picture.', '2003-10-16 13:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(452659, 41610, 12966, '<td valign="top">I like the texture and colors, a little too much light on the lemon slices. But a enjoyable photo.</td>', 'I like the texture and colors, a little too much light on the lemon slices. But a enjoyable photo.', '2003-10-16 13:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(452672, 41995, 656, '<td valign="top">What a  sumptuous feast - for the eyes too.</td>', 'What a  sumptuous feast - for the eyes too.', '2003-10-16 13:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(452717, 42062, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great celebration of color!  I like the free presentation - a rigid bowl isn''t seen.  The lighting works well.  7</td>', 'Great celebration of color!  I like the free presentation - a rigid bowl isn''t seen.  The lighting works well.  7', '2003-10-16 14:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(452720, 42144, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, nice simple background.  The popcorn looks fresh and light and buttery.  I think the focus is a bit soft and I''m not sure if that border detracts or not - the color seems a little washed out and brings down the tone of the bowl, IMO.  6</td>', 'Good lighting, nice simple background.  The popcorn looks fresh and light and buttery.  I think the focus is a bit soft and I''m not sure if that border detracts or not - the color seems a little washed out and brings down the tone of the bowl, IMO.  6', '2003-10-16 14:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(452723, 42465, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation - would like to see the chocolate aspect a bit more clearly - perhaps a chocolate drizzled strawberry on the end of the stick.  The lighting works well, I like the lit candle.  The focus is a bit soft in the right hand corner for me - especially since the placing of the fondue fork has the wooden end sticking out in a way that draws attention.  That said, I like its position, tempts the viewer to reach in and take some.   7</td>', 'Nice presentation - would like to see the chocolate aspect a bit more clearly - perhaps a chocolate drizzled strawberry on the end of the stick.  The lighting works well, I like the lit candle.  The focus is a bit soft in the right hand corner for me - especially since the placing of the fondue fork has the wooden end sticking out in a way that draws attention.  That said, I like its position, tempts the viewer to reach in and take some.   7', '2003-10-16 14:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(452726, 42012, 11923, '<td valign="top">This certainly looks delicious!  I like the simple presentation - not too busy.  The slightly muted background color really helps highlight the browns of the glazing and the crust.  I would like either the whole piece showing in the picture, or a symmetrical amount (only half vs more than half)  Lighting is great, nice focus.  8</td>', 'This certainly looks delicious!  I like the simple presentation - not too busy.  The slightly muted background color really helps highlight the browns of the glazing and the crust.  I would like either the whole piece showing in the picture, or a symmetrical amount (only half vs more than half)  Lighting is great, nice focus.  8', '2003-10-16 14:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(452729, 42467, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, good close up.  I like the black background - makes the photo pop with the red and pale color of the dough.  Looks appetizing!  7</td>', 'Nice lighting, good close up.  I like the black background - makes the photo pop with the red and pale color of the dough.  Looks appetizing!  7', '2003-10-16 14:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(452730, 42428, 2130, '<td valign="top">this is the only photo I gave a 10...it´s just brilliant..so simple and so powerful</td>', 'this is the only photo I gave a 10...it´s just brilliant..so simple and so powerful', '2003-10-16 14:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(452732, 41508, 11923, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite desserts!  I like the simple composition.  Lighting looks ok.  Perhaps a different colored background would make the images stand out more though - can''t be sure.  The only thing I would''ve changed was the glass - though it gives that oomph of color, I find the blue band distracting and the light seems to diffuse oddly with it.  That may be due to the background as well though.  Still a nice shot!  6</td>', 'One of my favorite desserts!  I like the simple composition.  Lighting looks ok.  Perhaps a different colored background would make the images stand out more though - can''t be sure.  The only thing I would''ve changed was the glass - though it gives that oomph of color, I find the blue band distracting and the light seems to diffuse oddly with it.  That may be due to the background as well though.  Still a nice shot!  6', '2003-10-16 14:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(452735, 42238, 11923, '<td valign="top">Mmmm cake.  Great color coordination.  Presentation and lighting is good.  I think that''s a glass of milk in the background - would''ve preferred it to be completely visible or have the level lower (visible in the photo) so you could be sure it was milk.  Everything looks fresh and delicious!  Borders might look better a bit thinner, not a huge issue though.   8</td>', 'Mmmm cake.  Great color coordination.  Presentation and lighting is good.  I think that''s a glass of milk in the background - would''ve preferred it to be completely visible or have the level lower (visible in the photo) so you could be sure it was milk.  Everything looks fresh and delicious!  Borders might look better a bit thinner, not a huge issue though.   8', '2003-10-16 14:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(452738, 42384, 11923, '<td valign="top">Hehehe.  Perhaps beans aren''t the best idea for romance ;)  I like the humor of the composition.  The lighting is great both one the ingredients and the nicely soft focused table and candles.  Mood is set perfectly and each aspect of the photo is well defined.  I am curious.. what is on the table with the candles?  A flower?  It looks like a little man about to blow the candle out!  Nice set-up.  8</td>', 'Hehehe.  Perhaps beans aren''t the best idea for romance ;)  I like the humor of the composition.  The lighting is great both one the ingredients and the nicely soft focused table and candles.  Mood is set perfectly and each aspect of the photo is well defined.  I am curious.. what is on the table with the candles?  A flower?  It looks like a little man about to blow the candle out!  Nice set-up.  8', '2003-10-16 14:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452742, 42267, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love macaroni &amp; cheese but I have to be honest and say this looks a little unappealing.  Might be the soft focus, the noodles don''t look very defined and the color is a bit washed- out.   I do like the color differences however - nice use of primaries.  4</td>', 'I love macaroni & cheese but I have to be honest and say this looks a little unappealing.  Might be the soft focus, the noodles don''t look very defined and the color is a bit washed- out.   I do like the color differences however - nice use of primaries.  4', '2003-10-16 14:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(452745, 42439, 11923, '<td valign="top">Looks good!   I like the feel of this photo.  Has an outdoor feel to it for me because of the clear lighting and the bit of grill showing.   The meat looks great, just the way it should.  I generally like the whole food item to be in the photo but I think this works perfectly, especially with the grill accent at the top.  Nice job.  8</td>', 'Looks good!   I like the feel of this photo.  Has an outdoor feel to it for me because of the clear lighting and the bit of grill showing.   The meat looks great, just the way it should.  I generally like the whole food item to be in the photo but I think this works perfectly, especially with the grill accent at the top.  Nice job.  8', '2003-10-16 14:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(452748, 42098, 11923, '<td valign="top">Getting hungry..  The presentation is fantastic, food looks to be cooked to perfection.  I would''ve liked the focus to be deeper so the rice and pork were all in equal focus.  Also the light seems a bit low, there''s a slight yellow tinge, though that could be a symptom of the focus.  It all looks fresh with that greenery on it.  I like it!  7</td>', 'Getting hungry..  The presentation is fantastic, food looks to be cooked to perfection.  I would''ve liked the focus to be deeper so the rice and pork were all in equal focus.  Also the light seems a bit low, there''s a slight yellow tinge, though that could be a symptom of the focus.  It all looks fresh with that greenery on it.  I like it!  7', '2003-10-16 14:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(452750, 42420, 11923, '<td valign="top">Well.. I''m not sure how tasty this is, but it looks pretty!  I like the choice of dinnerware, mixed with the background of leaves and the like it gives the photo a bit of extra detail and interest.   The green is a bit unappealing on its own - but it works in the shot.  Lighting looks good.  Would prefer the dishes weren''t cut off on the side.  Good image!  7</td>', 'Well.. I''m not sure how tasty this is, but it looks pretty!  I like the choice of dinnerware, mixed with the background of leaves and the like it gives the photo a bit of extra detail and interest.   The green is a bit unappealing on its own - but it works in the shot.  Lighting looks good.  Would prefer the dishes weren''t cut off on the side.  Good image!  7', '2003-10-16 14:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(452757, 42452, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement of the foods, with the fork sort of ''bridging the gap'' so to speak.  However, I find the colors a bit off (makes the meat look a bit unappealing), perhaps the lighting?  Or hue changes?  Background is nice and uniform - maybe would''ve tried to move some of the crumbs and cover up that bit of wood with the plate at the bottom left.  I bet the eating part was fun!  5</td>', 'I like the arrangement of the foods, with the fork sort of ''bridging the gap'' so to speak.  However, I find the colors a bit off (makes the meat look a bit unappealing), perhaps the lighting?  Or hue changes?  Background is nice and uniform - maybe would''ve tried to move some of the crumbs and cover up that bit of wood with the plate at the bottom left.  I bet the eating part was fun!  5', '2003-10-16 15:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(452762, 42335, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of coffee in any form, but I''m willing to overcome my bias.  I love this photo.  The lighting is great, I like that the words on the cup and the beans inside are all in focus.  The use of other beans as background is great - gives wonderful depth.  Nothing looks overdone - simple.  10</td>', 'I''m not a fan of coffee in any form, but I''m willing to overcome my bias.  I love this photo.  The lighting is great, I like that the words on the cup and the beans inside are all in focus.  The use of other beans as background is great - gives wonderful depth.  Nothing looks overdone - simple.  10', '2003-10-16 15:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(452765, 42472, 11923, '<td valign="top">Cookies look delicious!  I like the range of color, and the lighting.  I find myself wishing the bottom part of the pyrex was in focus more, but only because everything else in the photo seems to have a nice clear look.  That''s my only real complaint.  I like how the photo comes together.  8</td>', 'Cookies look delicious!  I like the range of color, and the lighting.  I find myself wishing the bottom part of the pyrex was in focus more, but only because everything else in the photo seems to have a nice clear look.  That''s my only real complaint.  I like how the photo comes together.  8', '2003-10-16 15:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(452766, 42447, 11923, '<td valign="top">YUM!  That cake looks very good.  I''ll be checking for the recipe once this challenge is over.  I like the set-up.  It looks very princess/high-society.  The cake looks extremely appetizing, both in its full form and in the slice.   Those strawberries are huge and to die for!   Choice of settings work very well.  I wish the cake was a bit more in focus in the back - this could just be the light on the glaze though.  Very delicious looking photo.  8</td>', 'YUM!  That cake looks very good.  I''ll be checking for the recipe once this challenge is over.  I like the set-up.  It looks very princess/high-society.  The cake looks extremely appetizing, both in its full form and in the slice.   Those strawberries are huge and to die for!   Choice of settings work very well.  I wish the cake was a bit more in focus in the back - this could just be the light on the glaze though.  Very delicious looking photo.  8', '2003-10-16 15:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(452768, 42022, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple set up!  Lighting is good, colors are nice - I wish the background were black however as well as that bit of color in the right-hand corner.  Might make things pop more.  Perhaps not so close a shot/crop too.  Just a little more breathing room at the top would help IMO.  Other than that, I think its a great photo.  7</td>', 'Nice and simple set up!  Lighting is good, colors are nice - I wish the background were black however as well as that bit of color in the right-hand corner.  Might make things pop more.  Perhaps not so close a shot/crop too.  Just a little more breathing room at the top would help IMO.  Other than that, I think its a great photo.  7', '2003-10-16 15:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(452771, 42458, 11923, '<td valign="top">This looks good!  I love the color and texture of the photo, I also like the perspective, really close in.  I do wish the whole foreground was in focus though, since the photo has a ''being served'' feel to me.  A little more light on the area in focus may have highlighted just right - seems a bit dark to me.  Well done!  7</td>', 'This looks good!  I love the color and texture of the photo, I also like the perspective, really close in.  I do wish the whole foreground was in focus though, since the photo has a ''being served'' feel to me.  A little more light on the area in focus may have highlighted just right - seems a bit dark to me.  Well done!  7', '2003-10-16 15:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(452773, 42074, 11923, '<td valign="top">Stunning presentation!  I like the crisp white look, really brings out the color and texture of the food.  The greenery really tops this piece off - the bits around the edge are perfect.  Perhaps a shift over to the right for the wine glass - just so its edges are all deliniated - not really a huge deal.  Excellent job.   10</td>', 'Stunning presentation!  I like the crisp white look, really brings out the color and texture of the food.  The greenery really tops this piece off - the bits around the edge are perfect.  Perhaps a shift over to the right for the wine glass - just so its edges are all deliniated - not really a huge deal.  Excellent job.   10', '2003-10-16 15:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(452776, 41995, 11923, '<td valign="top">These look very good!  Must''ve taken forever!  The light is pretty good, and I like the presentation of the fowl - but I do find the photo overall to be a bit busy.  There is a huge riot of color over on the left side that makes it seem a little out of balance.  Leaving that left corner empty with just the black background may have toned down the business - particularly since the plate looks highly decorated.  I think a follow through with the black as the background would''ve worked best as well - there are a few ''wood'' background areas.  Still a fantastic shot, very impressive.  8</td>', 'These look very good!  Must''ve taken forever!  The light is pretty good, and I like the presentation of the fowl - but I do find the photo overall to be a bit busy.  There is a huge riot of color over on the left side that makes it seem a little out of balance.  Leaving that left corner empty with just the black background may have toned down the business - particularly since the plate looks highly decorated.  I think a follow through with the black as the background would''ve worked best as well - there are a few ''wood'' background areas.  Still a fantastic shot, very impressive.  8', '2003-10-16 15:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452778, 41593, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nicely accented.  This is a very ''cool'' toned photo, I like the way all the colors tie in.  Everything looks crisp and very appealing.  Only suggestions I have would be a bit more light on the face of the muffin, and to turn one of the muffins so the hint of powdered sugar would be more obvious - possibly give more depth and contrast.  Wonderful job.  8</td>', 'Nicely accented.  This is a very ''cool'' toned photo, I like the way all the colors tie in.  Everything looks crisp and very appealing.  Only suggestions I have would be a bit more light on the face of the muffin, and to turn one of the muffins so the hint of powdered sugar would be more obvious - possibly give more depth and contrast.  Wonderful job.  8', '2003-10-16 15:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(452781, 42419, 11923, '<td valign="top">I very much like this shot!  The focus and color is fantastic.  Lighting is good.  I also like the added dynamic of the ''before &amp; after'' feel.   Well balanced and not too busy.  8</td>', 'I very much like this shot!  The focus and color is fantastic.  Lighting is good.  I also like the added dynamic of the ''before & after'' feel.   Well balanced and not too busy.  8', '2003-10-16 15:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(452789, 42178, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow, very abstract.  A different take and look.  I like the colors and the way they manifest because of the veins/layers of the onion.  I like its uniqueness but find it a bit rough for my personal tastes.  Interesting vision.  The whites are a bit harsh, not sure if that would''ve been possible to change.  6</td>', 'Wow, very abstract.  A different take and look.  I like the colors and the way they manifest because of the veins/layers of the onion.  I like its uniqueness but find it a bit rough for my personal tastes.  Interesting vision.  The whites are a bit harsh, not sure if that would''ve been possible to change.  6', '2003-10-16 15:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(452798, 42462, 3102, '<td valign="top">A wonderful presentation!  I was hoping to see a lot of shots in this challenge that look like they could appear in a cookbook, and this is one of the few that really does meet that expectation.</td>', 'A wonderful presentation!  I was hoping to see a lot of shots in this challenge that look like they could appear in a cookbook, and this is one of the few that really does meet that expectation.', '2003-10-16 15:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(452800, 42420, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very nicely arranged!  You did a great job of selecting appropriately-colored items to surround the main dish.</td>', 'Very nicely arranged!  You did a great job of selecting appropriately-colored items to surround the main dish.', '2003-10-16 15:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(452801, 42337, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit small to make a good judgement, but it seems like the lighting could have been a little better for this one.  Sometimes it takes multiple light sources placed just right to balance the lighting evenly.</td>', 'It''s a bit small to make a good judgement, but it seems like the lighting could have been a little better for this one.  Sometimes it takes multiple light sources placed just right to balance the lighting evenly.', '2003-10-16 15:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(452802, 42178, 3102, '<td valign="top">This one might have been more compelling without the effect, although I''m sure you''ll get an equal number of people who say "love the effect!"  :)</td>', 'This one might have been more compelling without the effect, although I''m sure you''ll get an equal number of people who say "love the effect!"  :)', '2003-10-16 15:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(452803, 41984, 3102, '<td valign="top">I may have tried getting nice &amp; close to the main dish, rather than attempt the entire setting.  Actually, I think I would have enjoyed seeing the dish a lot closer -- it''s probably something I would enjoy eating!  I also would have tried to avoid using the flash (at least it appears that a flash was used here).  The flash brings out bright spots in the fork, the top &amp; bottom of the dish, the spoon, etc.  Try using a tripod with a long exposure -- the results provide for much better lighting.</td>', 'I may have tried getting nice & close to the main dish, rather than attempt the entire setting.  Actually, I think I would have enjoyed seeing the dish a lot closer -- it''s probably something I would enjoy eating!  I also would have tried to avoid using the flash (at least it appears that a flash was used here).  The flash brings out bright spots in the fork, the top & bottom of the dish, the spoon, etc.  Try using a tripod with a long exposure -- the results provide for much better lighting.', '2003-10-16 15:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(452805, 41981, 7889, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot but it would have been better if the background or plate where a different colour as there is no definition at the top of the shop. good effort, should do very well</td>', 'I like this a lot but it would have been better if the background or plate where a different colour as there is no definition at the top of the shop. good effort, should do very well', '2003-10-16 15:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(452806, 42409, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement a lot -- unfortunately the overall quality of the shot seems to be lacking a bit.  I''m not sure if you used a flash here, but it seems like the overall image has a bit too much contrast and is a bit blown out in spots.  The idea of using the red/white background is great, though.</td>', 'I like the arrangement a lot -- unfortunately the overall quality of the shot seems to be lacking a bit.  I''m not sure if you used a flash here, but it seems like the overall image has a bit too much contrast and is a bit blown out in spots.  The idea of using the red/white background is great, though.', '2003-10-16 15:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(452807, 42428, 12101, '<td valign="top">Nice and Soft -- Good Job!</td>', 'Nice and Soft -- Good Job!', '2003-10-16 15:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(452808, 42440, 7889, '<td valign="top">Looks good! a bit on the dark side, a boost of the contrast would have helped.</td>', 'Looks good! a bit on the dark side, a boost of the contrast would have helped.', '2003-10-16 15:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(452811, 41610, 7889, '<td valign="top">The flash is a bit too harsh and has given washed out the colours.</td>', 'The flash is a bit too harsh and has given washed out the colours.', '2003-10-16 15:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(452813, 42402, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute shot, but I''m not sure it has a lot of artistic value.  The background seems to be awfully cluttered; the same shot with a pure black background would probably do really well -- as it is, it just seems a little "snapshot-ish."</td>', 'It''s a cute shot, but I''m not sure it has a lot of artistic value.  The background seems to be awfully cluttered; the same shot with a pure black background would probably do really well -- as it is, it just seems a little "snapshot-ish."', '2003-10-16 15:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(452816, 42098, 3102, '<td valign="top">A very nice presentation!  One of my top picks for the challenge.  I think the colors could have been tweaked just a *little* better (I think that it bothers me that the rice isn''t very white), but still a classy, appetizing shot!  - 8</td>', 'A very nice presentation!  One of my top picks for the challenge.  I think the colors could have been tweaked just a *little* better (I think that it bothers me that the rice isn''t very white), but still a classy, appetizing shot!  - 8', '2003-10-16 15:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(452817, 42337, 7889, '<td valign="top">Bit too small and lacks contrast.</td>', 'Bit too small and lacks contrast.', '2003-10-16 15:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(452818, 42411, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great colour and composition</td>', 'Great colour and composition', '2003-10-16 15:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(452819, 42411, 3102, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear him saying, "C''mon, you''re not gonna EAT me, are ya?!"  Almost makes me feel guilty for loving seafood!  I like the DOF here -- a very nice shot.</td>', 'I can almost hear him saying, "C''mon, you''re not gonna EAT me, are ya?!"  Almost makes me feel guilty for loving seafood!  I like the DOF here -- a very nice shot.', '2003-10-16 15:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(452820, 42419, 7889, '<td valign="top">It would have been better without the peppers/onion etc on side. it makes the photo untidy.</td>', 'It would have been better without the peppers/onion etc on side. it makes the photo untidy.', '2003-10-16 15:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(452821, 42441, 7889, '<td valign="top">angle is good but the colours look a bit flat and washed out</td>', 'angle is good but the colours look a bit flat and washed out', '2003-10-16 15:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(452822, 42465, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see there''s only one other fondue shot in the challenge -- we''re reasonably original (I shot the other one)!  I might have tried using a light background on this one.  I''m having a hard time making out the dish against the dark background.  My only other suggestion would have been to use a smaller aperature so that the whole fork could be in focus -- that''s something I struggled with in my own shot.</td>', 'I''m glad to see there''s only one other fondue shot in the challenge -- we''re reasonably original (I shot the other one)!  I might have tried using a light background on this one.  I''m having a hard time making out the dish against the dark background.  My only other suggestion would have been to use a smaller aperature so that the whole fork could be in focus -- that''s something I struggled with in my own shot.', '2003-10-16 15:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(452823, 42267, 7889, '<td valign="top">DOF lets this down</td>', 'DOF lets this down', '2003-10-16 15:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(452824, 42428, 7889, '<td valign="top">They say the simple ideas are the best and this is my favourite of the challenge.  nice one!</td>', 'They say the simple ideas are the best and this is my favourite of the challenge.  nice one!', '2003-10-16 15:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(452825, 42428, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice &amp; simple!  Not a whole lot of "wow" here in all honesty, but I like the simplicity of it.</td>', 'Nice & simple!  Not a whole lot of "wow" here in all honesty, but I like the simplicity of it.', '2003-10-16 15:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(452826, 42294, 7889, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favourites - its simple and it works for me. good luck</td>', 'This was one of my favourites - its simple and it works for me. good luck', '2003-10-16 15:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(452827, 42074, 7190, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it more if you would have pulled back a bit the truncated base of the bowl and tops of the silverware not as much, can''t find the expression but something disorientatimg or out of balance. Like how the shadow of the boel anchors the image though and maybe like a hair light on the wine glass too</td>', 'I would have liked it more if you would have pulled back a bit the truncated base of the bowl and tops of the silverware not as much, can''t find the expression but something disorientatimg or out of balance. Like how the shadow of the boel anchors the image though and maybe like a hair light on the wine glass too', '2003-10-16 16:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(452828, 42392, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement of the items quite a bit... the lighting seems a bit harsh, though.  I might have tried it without the cookbook, bringing the ingredients closer and into sharper focus.</td>', 'I like the arrangement of the items quite a bit... the lighting seems a bit harsh, though.  I might have tried it without the cookbook, bringing the ingredients closer and into sharper focus.', '2003-10-16 16:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(452829, 42417, 7190, '<td valign="top">Really like the relationship of the colors of the food and the background , very nice</td>', 'Really like the relationship of the colors of the food and the background , very nice', '2003-10-16 16:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452834, 42411, 2223, '<td valign="top">Lets take a guess..mmmmm..Pitsaman?<br/>Great pic! 10</td>', 'Lets take a guess..mmmmm..Pitsaman?Great pic! 10', '2003-10-16 16:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452835, 41981, 7190, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot but i wouldd have liked to see more of a horizon line by seeing the back and right side edge of the plate just a little more shadow .the chopsticks are a bit to jarring. really nice</td>', 'Really nice shot but i wouldd have liked to see more of a horizon line by seeing the back and right side edge of the plate just a little more shadow .the chopsticks are a bit to jarring. really nice', '2003-10-16 16:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(452869, 41995, 12268, '<td valign="top">wow that looks sooo good!</td>', 'wow that looks sooo good!', '2003-10-16 16:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452896, 42098, 11678, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, very yummy.. got my 10</td>', 'Very pretty, very yummy.. got my 10', '2003-10-16 17:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(452897, 42417, 11678, '<td valign="top">Seems slightly out of focus, but a 10 anyway</td>', 'Seems slightly out of focus, but a 10 anyway', '2003-10-16 17:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(452898, 42044, 11678, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. Didn''t fit criteria of a prepared dish, so only an 8</td>', 'Very nice image. Didn''t fit criteria of a prepared dish, so only an 8', '2003-10-16 17:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(452901, 42427, 11678, '<td valign="top">A little stark.. maybe needed some offsetting something, like an ornate hot-mitt ? Gets a 9 though</td>', 'A little stark.. maybe needed some offsetting something, like an ornate hot-mitt ? Gets a 9 though', '2003-10-16 17:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(452902, 42441, 12578, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, nice angle , good choice of crockery and especially like the other crockery in the distance, an overall excellent shot but for what the title states as being pasta I am struggling to see any! Maybe too many bean sprouts in the way of the pasta - BUT that is the only one thing lacking on this shot... Brilliant</td>', 'Excellent shot, nice angle , good choice of crockery and especially like the other crockery in the distance, an overall excellent shot but for what the title states as being pasta I am struggling to see any! Maybe too many bean sprouts in the way of the pasta - BUT that is the only one thing lacking on this shot... Brilliant', '2003-10-16 17:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(452905, 42231, 11678, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah... gets my 10. The red border was a VERY good thing to do.. put a wrapper on it all. Use of lighting was extremely good. The offsetting blue really works out. One of the best compositions I''ve seen yet. You''re a pro, huh ?</td>', 'Oh yeah... gets my 10. The red border was a VERY good thing to do.. put a wrapper on it all. Use of lighting was extremely good. The offsetting blue really works out. One of the best compositions I''ve seen yet. You''re a pro, huh ?', '2003-10-16 17:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(452907, 41981, 12578, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation, lovely Black Chop Sticks and crockery but I would have prefered to see more definition in the crockery by the use of perhaps a Navy Blue table cloth or something darker under the plate as it sems to merge too much , apart from that its excellent.</td>', 'Nice presentation, lovely Black Chop Sticks and crockery but I would have prefered to see more definition in the crockery by the use of perhaps a Navy Blue table cloth or something darker under the plate as it sems to merge too much , apart from that its excellent.', '2003-10-16 17:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(452910, 42447, 11678, '<td valign="top">Yup, gets my 10. Wow, I''ll bet you agonized over the focus point on this and chose the right spot. Great.. and oh, would I love a bite of that !</td>', 'Yup, gets my 10. Wow, I''ll bet you agonized over the focus point on this and chose the right spot. Great.. and oh, would I love a bite of that !', '2003-10-16 17:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(452911, 42447, 12578, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too much clutter and no actual focal point, composition sits well together but there is too much scattering, a little off level on the shot which I imagine to be hard to correct in the way of after wards in photoshop or the like as the cup of tea/coffee would then we un-level.</td>', 'Maybe a little too much clutter and no actual focal point, composition sits well together but there is too much scattering, a little off level on the shot which I imagine to be hard to correct in the way of after wards in photoshop or the like as the cup of tea/coffee would then we un-level.', '2003-10-16 17:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(452912, 42178, 11678, '<td valign="top">Innovative approach. I like it for what it is, but it isn''t a prepared dish, so only a 9</td>', 'Innovative approach. I like it for what it is, but it isn''t a prepared dish, so only a 9', '2003-10-16 17:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(452913, 42429, 12578, '<td valign="top">mouth watering, only thing that I can see that spoils it is the floral pattern on the plate, nice reflections and great composition though :0)</td>', 'mouth watering, only thing that I can see that spoils it is the floral pattern on the plate, nice reflections and great composition though :0)', '2003-10-16 17:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(452915, 41771, 11678, '<td valign="top">Unexpected and very cool. I suppose it fits the ''prepared dish'' criteria.  Heck, I think I''d try those. Look yummy. Gets my 9 only because I think people food would have been more appropriate for this. It IS a 10 quality image, though.</td>', 'Unexpected and very cool. I suppose it fits the ''prepared dish'' criteria.  Heck, I think I''d try those. Look yummy. Gets my 9 only because I think people food would have been more appropriate for this. It IS a 10 quality image, though.', '2003-10-16 17:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(452917, 42381, 12578, '<td valign="top">This to me suits teh Irony contest alot better as teh chupmunk appears to be playing with fire so to speak, great capture but I don''t see it fitting the challenge.</td>', 'This to me suits teh Irony contest alot better as teh chupmunk appears to be playing with fire so to speak, great capture but I don''t see it fitting the challenge.', '2003-10-16 17:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(452919, 42337, 11678, '<td valign="top">B+W works here. But a slight focus problem and possibly stronger light or mixed light (hard right, soft left) might have worked better. Also, it isn''t a prepared dish, so I can only go 8</td>', 'B+W works here. But a slight focus problem and possibly stronger light or mixed light (hard right, soft left) might have worked better. Also, it isn''t a prepared dish, so I can only go 8', '2003-10-16 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(452922, 42238, 12578, '<td valign="top">Absolutely mouth watering !!! I would personally have prefered the shot to be taken slightly elavated or have cropped off tha bottom part of the crockery, Beautiful strawberries and great colour balances - cant wait to see the recipe for this one.</td>', 'Absolutely mouth watering !!! I would personally have prefered the shot to be taken slightly elavated or have cropped off tha bottom part of the crockery, Beautiful strawberries and great colour balances - cant wait to see the recipe for this one.', '2003-10-16 17:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(452924, 42370, 11678, '<td valign="top">Very nice presentation and balance. I would have liked to see heavier lighting.. bring it up a notch. Gets a 9. I also see where you agonized over the correct point of focus. But it works.</td>', 'Very nice presentation and balance. I would have liked to see heavier lighting.. bring it up a notch. Gets a 9. I also see where you agonized over the correct point of focus. But it works.', '2003-10-16 17:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(452926, 42465, 12578, '<td valign="top">An awkward shot to shoot - having not tried to shoot anything as tall on a plate you want to zoom into a fair ammount I can''t see how difficult it would have been to get a slightly over head shot whilst keeping the part of the candle burning in this picture but overall as you have it it is a brilliant presentation... Nice reds in the strawberries too - reminds me of Fresh Strawberries with fresh mint and heaped up clotted cream  :0) Yummmmmmmmy</td>', 'An awkward shot to shoot - having not tried to shoot anything as tall on a plate you want to zoom into a fair ammount I can''t see how difficult it would have been to get a slightly over head shot whilst keeping the part of the candle burning in this picture but overall as you have it it is a brilliant presentation... Nice reds in the strawberries too - reminds me of Fresh Strawberries with fresh mint and heaped up clotted cream  :0) Yummmmmmmmy', '2003-10-16 17:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(452927, 42452, 11678, '<td valign="top">Innovative composition. Just caught the rule of thirds. Gets a 9, though, only because I feel that you needed to bring the meat in just a tad closer. I think there is just a bit too much ''table'' there and it nearly distracts. My opinion, of course</td>', 'Innovative composition. Just caught the rule of thirds. Gets a 9, though, only because I feel that you needed to bring the meat in just a tad closer. I think there is just a bit too much ''table'' there and it nearly distracts. My opinion, of course', '2003-10-16 17:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(452932, 42238, 11678, '<td valign="top">Gets a 10 even though I think you needed a front spot on just the cake to hightlight the texture. You have made a texture shot with the strawberries and some more ''grain'' on the cake would have helped balance it.  Gee, that''s a nice picture !</td>', 'Gets a 10 even though I think you needed a front spot on just the cake to hightlight the texture. You have made a texture shot with the strawberries and some more ''grain'' on the cake would have helped balance it.  Gee, that''s a nice picture !', '2003-10-16 17:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452934, 42465, 11678, '<td valign="top">Oh boy, a tough one. Gets my 10, though, it''s very good. It''s one of those shots where you''re going to like it a lot or not. Low key really annoys some folks, but I think it came off as injecting a romantic feel that really pumps it up. Wow.</td>', 'Oh boy, a tough one. Gets my 10, though, it''s very good. It''s one of those shots where you''re going to like it a lot or not. Low key really annoys some folks, but I think it came off as injecting a romantic feel that really pumps it up. Wow.', '2003-10-16 17:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(452936, 42334, 11678, '<td valign="top">Needs much stronger light inside. Maybe a straight down spot. Also is slightly out of focus at the raviolis. Focus cught the plate too much. Gets an 8 though</td>', 'Needs much stronger light inside. Maybe a straight down spot. Also is slightly out of focus at the raviolis. Focus cught the plate too much. Gets an 8 though', '2003-10-16 17:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(452938, 42074, 11678, '<td valign="top">Well, this one ought to be top 3. VERY nice. Gets my 10.</td>', 'Well, this one ought to be top 3. VERY nice. Gets my 10.', '2003-10-16 17:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(452942, 42441, 11678, '<td valign="top">Wow, focal point nightmare, but you caught it OK. The lighting seems too blue to me, perhaps a white balance adjust would have helped. The simplistic effect of the presentation actually works. Normally an angular approach bothers me, but not this time. Gets my 9.</td>', 'Wow, focal point nightmare, but you caught it OK. The lighting seems too blue to me, perhaps a white balance adjust would have helped. The simplistic effect of the presentation actually works. Normally an angular approach bothers me, but not this time. Gets my 9.', '2003-10-16 17:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(452945, 42467, 11678, '<td valign="top">Oh, you just know it when it''s good, huh ? Gets my 10.</td>', 'Oh, you just know it when it''s good, huh ? Gets my 10.', '2003-10-16 17:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(453027, 42428, 10702, '<td valign="top">Great, like it, love it. Brilliant approach on a simple thing.</td>', 'Great, like it, love it. Brilliant approach on a simple thing.', '2003-10-16 18:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(453033, 41981, 10702, '<td valign="top">Might have been lighter in the top left corner but in every other apect just a spactecular shot. Love the strong colors v.s. the white background.</td>', 'Might have been lighter in the top left corner but in every other apect just a spactecular shot. Love the strong colors v.s. the white background.', '2003-10-16 18:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(453034, 42144, 9906, '<td valign="top">DOF is nice but focus is a little soft for my taste!  Like the subtle reflection of the popcorn in the dish!</td>', 'DOF is nice but focus is a little soft for my taste!  Like the subtle reflection of the popcorn in the dish!', '2003-10-16 18:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(453036, 42417, 9906, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft for my taste.  Nice composition.  Like how you matched pretty closely the colors in and out of the dish!</td>', 'Focus is a little soft for my taste.  Nice composition.  Like how you matched pretty closely the colors in and out of the dish!', '2003-10-16 18:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(453044, 42447, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.  A little bit more light from above/ behind  would help eliminate the shadows.  There is a little bit of a tilt too.  From a compositional view point, It''s a little busy.  There are too many competing visual patterns or textures.</td>', 'Nice focus.  A little bit more light from above/ behind  would help eliminate the shadows.  There is a little bit of a tilt too.  From a compositional view point, It''s a little busy.  There are too many competing visual patterns or textures.', '2003-10-16 18:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(453122, 42335, 5475, '<td valign="top">So far, this is my favorite shot in the challenge.  I love the composition, with just 1/4 of the cup showing, with handle.  I''ve seen shots with coffee beans surrounding the cup, but never in it too!  Great job!  I give it a 9 (10 if it had just a little more DOF for the handle).  JD Anderson</td>', 'So far, this is my favorite shot in the challenge.  I love the composition, with just 1/4 of the cup showing, with handle.  I''ve seen shots with coffee beans surrounding the cup, but never in it too!  Great job!  I give it a 9 (10 if it had just a little more DOF for the handle).  JD Anderson', '2003-10-16 19:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(453124, 42294, 13044, '<td valign="top">Nice. Weston could relate.</td>', 'Nice. Weston could relate.', '2003-10-16 19:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(453126, 42433, 5475, '<td valign="top">I especially like the wooden rolling pin and the old family picture.  They really make the photo for me.  The bread looks awesome, too!  Well done.<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'I especially like the wooden rolling pin and the old family picture.  They really make the photo for me.  The bread looks awesome, too!  Well done.JD Anderson', '2003-10-16 19:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(453133, 42195, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nicely set up.  I like how you put the one further back instead of keeping them in a row.  Everything looks great, but it seems the colors could be a little bit richer.<br/> <br/>Very nice work.</td>', 'Nicely set up.  I like how you put the one further back instead of keeping them in a row.  Everything looks great, but it seems the colors could be a little bit richer. Very nice work.', '2003-10-16 20:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(453138, 42335, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful theme and nicely executed.  I love the smell of coffee... this makes me thirsty :) = 10</td>', 'Beautiful theme and nicely executed.  I love the smell of coffee... this makes me thirsty :) = 10', '2003-10-16 20:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(453139, 42178, 772, '<td valign="top">There''s a photo in here somewhere :)  This one is a bit too artistic for me.</td>', 'There''s a photo in here somewhere :)  This one is a bit too artistic for me.', '2003-10-16 20:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(453140, 42465, 12809, '<td valign="top">Superb!  Nice colors - the strawberries are nice ''n red, not washed out.<br/> <br/>When should I arrive? :-)</td>', 'Superb!  Nice colors - the strawberries are nice ''n red, not washed out. When should I arrive? :-)', '2003-10-16 20:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(453141, 42409, 772, '<td valign="top">The exposure here is a bit harsh for my taste.  The whites are a bit overpowering.</td>', 'The exposure here is a bit harsh for my taste.  The whites are a bit overpowering.', '2003-10-16 20:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(453144, 41995, 772, '<td valign="top">The food looks tasty but this particular photo seems a bit busy for my personal taste.</td>', 'The food looks tasty but this particular photo seems a bit busy for my personal taste.', '2003-10-16 20:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(453145, 42074, 12809, '<td valign="top">Yummy.  Good lighting, colors are good and everything is sharp.<br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'Yummy.  Good lighting, colors are good and everything is sharp. Good job.', '2003-10-16 20:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(453146, 41610, 772, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this one seems a bit harsh...</td>', 'The lighting on this one seems a bit harsh...', '2003-10-16 20:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(453147, 42238, 12809, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious!  Looks like it may need a little USM, though.</td>', 'Looks delicious!  Looks like it may need a little USM, though.', '2003-10-16 20:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(453154, 42433, 12809, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I like how you left the baking stoneware, picture and other stuff in the background.  Gives it an old Italian feel.  Bread broken following the Rule.  Nice job!</td>', 'Excellent.  I like how you left the baking stoneware, picture and other stuff in the background.  Gives it an old Italian feel.  Bread broken following the Rule.  Nice job!', '2003-10-16 20:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(453157, 42472, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nicely setup.  The red plate really adds color to this shot.<br/> <br/>Now I''ll be craving pb cookies.  Haven''t made them in so long..  Mmmm...</td>', 'Nicely setup.  The red plate really adds color to this shot. Now I''ll be craving pb cookies.  Haven''t made them in so long..  Mmmm...', '2003-10-16 20:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(453164, 42462, 12809, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious!  You did an excellent job with the colors.  The fruit, flowers, and placemap all tie in with the colors of the carrots and asparagus.  I like the placemat on an angle, too.<br/> <br/>Can''t wait to see the recipe!</td>', 'Looks delicious!  You did an excellent job with the colors.  The fruit, flowers, and placemap all tie in with the colors of the carrots and asparagus.  I like the placemat on an angle, too. Can''t wait to see the recipe!', '2003-10-16 20:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(453170, 42411, 12809, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Good colors, sharp, angle is good.  Very nice work.  Lobster is yummy, but I can never eat ''em when they''re looking at me. :-)</td>', 'Great shot!  Good colors, sharp, angle is good.  Very nice work.  Lobster is yummy, but I can never eat ''em when they''re looking at me. :-)', '2003-10-16 20:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(453175, 42452, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice job on the placement of the plates.  I like the in the corners like that.  The lines on the placemat form nice diagonals.  Looks like it might need a little USM.  And a nitpick - the crumbs on the placemat are a little distracting.  But, I can''t talk much ''cuz I''m messy. :-)</td>', 'Very nice job on the placement of the plates.  I like the in the corners like that.  The lines on the placemat form nice diagonals.  Looks like it might need a little USM.  And a nitpick - the crumbs on the placemat are a little distracting.  But, I can''t talk much ''cuz I''m messy. :-)', '2003-10-16 20:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(453176, 41523, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I like how everything is upside down and/or on an angle.  The glass looks like it''s floating.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I like how everything is upside down and/or on an angle.  The glass looks like it''s floating.', '2003-10-16 20:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(453179, 42431, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nicely set up.  The color is nice; the red really livens it up.  My critique - I wish I could see more of the fondue.  I can just see a bit of it, but at first glance the pot looks empty.</td>', 'Very nicely set up.  The color is nice; the red really livens it up.  My critique - I wish I could see more of the fondue.  I can just see a bit of it, but at first glance the pot looks empty.', '2003-10-16 20:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(453183, 41593, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation!  Like the flower and the added fruit.  I feel like a little USM could sharpen this up a bit.<br/> <br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Nice presentation!  Like the flower and the added fruit.  I feel like a little USM could sharpen this up a bit. Nice work.', '2003-10-16 20:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(453184, 42458, 6576, '<td valign="top">Where''s the beef?</td>', 'Where''s the beef?', '2003-10-16 20:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(453210, 41995, 9411, '<td valign="top">Looks very inviting, and wow what a lot of work. There is so much going on in this shot I found it a little hard to focus on what is being presented. There is little definition to the actual hens in the shot. I would have left more space around the platter and chosen one theme to use as props,, the gourds and leaves or the crockery.6</td>', 'Looks very inviting, and wow what a lot of work. There is so much going on in this shot I found it a little hard to focus on what is being presented. There is little definition to the actual hens in the shot. I would have left more space around the platter and chosen one theme to use as props,, the gourds and leaves or the crockery.6', '2003-10-16 20:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(453219, 42472, 1280, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge, and technically is fine, however it could be presented in a more attractive way. Eg: a nice plate instead of plastic,  and perhaps having the indgredients measured out instead of in their commercial containers.  Just my preference of course.</td>', 'It meets the challenge, and technically is fine, however it could be presented in a more attractive way. Eg: a nice plate instead of plastic,  and perhaps having the indgredients measured out instead of in their commercial containers.  Just my preference of course.', '2003-10-16 21:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(453220, 42370, 1280, '<td valign="top">You''ve used attractive colours that capture attention, and obviously went through the trouble of setting this up.  The choice of white is a good bg.  The major drawback here is that there is no strong focal point.  My eyes wander around looking for it.  Another con is that there is no strong focus any where.  It''s all a bit soft.  It''s a complicated picture with too much going on and vying for attention, but each item isn''t readily identifiable.  <br/>I hope this helps.  <br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Grayce<br/> <br/></td>', 'You''ve used attractive colours that capture attention, and obviously went through the trouble of setting this up.  The choice of white is a good bg.  The major drawback here is that there is no strong focal point.  My eyes wander around looking for it.  Another con is that there is no strong focus any where.  It''s all a bit soft.  It''s a complicated picture with too much going on and vying for attention, but each item isn''t readily identifiable.  I hope this helps.  Regards, Grayce ', '2003-10-16 21:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(453221, 42467, 1280, '<td valign="top">Appealing.</td>', 'Appealing.', '2003-10-16 21:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(453222, 42381, 11923, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, but he looks kinda lean to me ;)   Lighting is good, the darker color scheme is nice.  Has a good open feel to it.  I do feel it leans more towards a humor challenge than actual recipe/food - but since folks have been known to eat them..   7</td>', 'Cute photo, but he looks kinda lean to me ;)   Lighting is good, the darker color scheme is nice.  Has a good open feel to it.  I do feel it leans more towards a humor challenge than actual recipe/food - but since folks have been known to eat them..   7', '2003-10-16 21:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(453224, 42334, 1280, '<td valign="top">I can imagine this is yummy.  Presentation could be improved by using a complimentary plate, maybe red, or white with a red garnish.</td>', 'I can imagine this is yummy.  Presentation could be improved by using a complimentary plate, maybe red, or white with a red garnish.', '2003-10-16 21:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(453225, 42044, 11923, '<td valign="top">Those are some odd looking mushrooms.  I like the cool blue of the one mushroom contrasting with the warm lighting and colors of the grass/leaves.  Focus works well for me and the composition is nice.  I covered much of the top half and found that I liked it better without that large expanse of soft focus background, the crispness of the focus on the foreground really draws my eyes, but I find them straining as they stray up to the top.  Nicely done!  7</td>', 'Those are some odd looking mushrooms.  I like the cool blue of the one mushroom contrasting with the warm lighting and colors of the grass/leaves.  Focus works well for me and the composition is nice.  I covered much of the top half and found that I liked it better without that large expanse of soft focus background, the crispness of the focus on the foreground really draws my eyes, but I find them straining as they stray up to the top.  Nicely done!  7', '2003-10-16 21:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(453227, 42440, 11923, '<td valign="top">What is this?  It looks desserty but.. are those olives?  I like the off-kilter perspective, but I think more lighting on the subject, as well as a different background might have helped.  It looks too dark to me - I have difficulties enjoying the layered look of the concoction because the lighting doesn''t highlight that detail.  6</td>', 'What is this?  It looks desserty but.. are those olives?  I like the off-kilter perspective, but I think more lighting on the subject, as well as a different background might have helped.  It looks too dark to me - I have difficulties enjoying the layered look of the concoction because the lighting doesn''t highlight that detail.  6', '2003-10-16 21:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(453229, 42447, 1280, '<td valign="top">I think the cup of coffee and one slice of cake would have been better.  It''s over done imho.  I like the crochet table cloth...that works well.  Too many elements overall, and it needs to be simplified. Just my opinions, hope they help.<br/>Regards,<br/>Grayce</td>', 'I think the cup of coffee and one slice of cake would have been better.  It''s over done imho.  I like the crochet table cloth...that works well.  Too many elements overall, and it needs to be simplified. Just my opinions, hope they help.Regards,Grayce', '2003-10-16 21:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(453231, 42402, 1280, '<td valign="top">Cute little girl.</td>', 'Cute little girl.', '2003-10-16 21:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(453233, 42439, 1280, '<td valign="top">Looks good..BUT...isn''t Tobasco from Louisiana?  lol...it''s ok.  Nicely charbroiled.</td>', 'Looks good..BUT...isn''t Tobasco from Louisiana?  lol...it''s ok.  Nicely charbroiled.', '2003-10-16 21:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(453234, 42417, 1280, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites so far.  Good mix of colours, good choice of plates, and I like the leaves as a bg. Ohhh I also like the speckles of pepper.  Good job!</td>', 'one of my favorites so far.  Good mix of colours, good choice of plates, and I like the leaves as a bg. Ohhh I also like the speckles of pepper.  Good job!', '2003-10-16 21:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(453236, 42294, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  Great stand out against the black bg.  Although it''s food, I don''t really equate recipe though, so I''m not sure it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like this image.  Great stand out against the black bg.  Although it''s food, I don''t really equate recipe though, so I''m not sure it meets the challenge.', '2003-10-16 21:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(453237, 42381, 1280, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Not on subject though.</td>', 'Cute!  Not on subject though.', '2003-10-16 21:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(453241, 42419, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colour, good dof, and I like the subject.  The cheese, is it ricotta?  It is a bit oe.  It''s a tough one to get right, prolly shoulda left it out of the pic.  I''m not crazy about the composition.  Maybe because it is cut down too close to the middle.  The place may is a distraction.  The wooden bg would work better. I think you may have used it to define two parts: ingredients and finished dish.  I think more cohesion would be effective.</td>', 'Nice use of colour, good dof, and I like the subject.  The cheese, is it ricotta?  It is a bit oe.  It''s a tough one to get right, prolly shoulda left it out of the pic.  I''m not crazy about the composition.  Maybe because it is cut down too close to the middle.  The place may is a distraction.  The wooden bg would work better. I think you may have used it to define two parts: ingredients and finished dish.  I think more cohesion would be effective.', '2003-10-16 21:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(453243, 42429, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job capturing the colours. I''m not sure I like the ultra shiny plate.  I think it detracts frm the subject. Overall nice!</td>', 'Good job capturing the colours. I''m not sure I like the ultra shiny plate.  I think it detracts frm the subject. Overall nice!', '2003-10-16 22:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(453245, 42420, 1280, '<td valign="top">Fancy schmancy china!  Lol....very nice colouring, and composition. I love the seasonal bg.</td>', 'Fancy schmancy china!  Lol....very nice colouring, and composition. I love the seasonal bg.', '2003-10-16 22:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(453250, 42074, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good image. Smart too...since almost everyone loves Italian food.   You used colour very well here.  Ilike that you took the time to dip  the rim in chopped parsley. Using wine in a stem glass helps complete the picture. My only nitpick is the two utensils sticking up. Imho they don''t really contribute to the overall picture.  But that''s just me perhaps. Still one of my faves so far.</td>', 'Good image. Smart too...since almost everyone loves Italian food.   You used colour very well here.  Ilike that you took the time to dip  the rim in chopped parsley. Using wine in a stem glass helps complete the picture. My only nitpick is the two utensils sticking up. Imho they don''t really contribute to the overall picture.  But that''s just me perhaps. Still one of my faves so far.', '2003-10-16 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(453251, 42012, 9162, '<td valign="top">Composition  and color are terrific, one of my favorites.</td>', 'Composition  and color are terrific, one of my favorites.', '2003-10-16 22:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(453253, 42409, 1280, '<td valign="top">Bold, brash, and colourful. Whites are oe, and focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Bold, brash, and colourful. Whites are oe, and focus is a bit soft.', '2003-10-16 22:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(453255, 42098, 1280, '<td valign="top">Oh my!!! This is my kinda eating!!!  I always like ethnic foods, and this one is nicely presented.  I can''t tell what the little yellowish things are on the pork.  Is it corn?  Woulda been better without them.  Also I don''t think you need the parsley.  There is enough green already with the chives, peas and peppers.  Red peppers would have been even better.</td>', 'Oh my!!! This is my kinda eating!!!  I always like ethnic foods, and this one is nicely presented.  I can''t tell what the little yellowish things are on the pork.  Is it corn?  Woulda been better without them.  Also I don''t think you need the parsley.  There is enough green already with the chives, peas and peppers.  Red peppers would have been even better.', '2003-10-16 22:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(453261, 42431, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Good simple composition, utilizing a couple of strong diagonals.  The red fondue pot adds a lot to this without over powering.   The bread could be better.  Not your fault, but it looks spongy rather than good and crusty. The black bg works well here.<br/>Overall nice picture.</td>', 'Very nice!  Good simple composition, utilizing a couple of strong diagonals.  The red fondue pot adds a lot to this without over powering.   The bread could be better.  Not your fault, but it looks spongy rather than good and crusty. The black bg works well here.Overall nice picture.', '2003-10-16 22:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(453263, 42409, 4338, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the idea, but the image looks out of focus or maybe too much light reflecting off the glass plate, or maybe too much light was used, or resizing for the web may have cause some pixelation or softness</td>', 'I like the composition and the idea, but the image looks out of focus or maybe too much light reflecting off the glass plate, or maybe too much light was used, or resizing for the web may have cause some pixelation or softness', '2003-10-16 22:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(453264, 42199, 9162, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but I think I would have liked it more if it was sharpened just a bit.  The composition is good and it looks delicious.</td>', 'I like this shot but I think I would have liked it more if it was sharpened just a bit.  The composition is good and it looks delicious.', '2003-10-16 22:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(453268, 42470, 1280, '<td valign="top">Funny, but low score for not meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Funny, but low score for not meeting the challenge.', '2003-10-16 22:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(453270, 42433, 10768, '<td valign="top">This one is my favorite in this challenge.  I love the blurred objects in the background which give this photo a sense of homecooking and nostalgia.  The texture that was captured within the bread is terrific.  Wonderful colors, focus, and composition.  10</td>', 'This one is my favorite in this challenge.  I love the blurred objects in the background which give this photo a sense of homecooking and nostalgia.  The texture that was captured within the bread is terrific.  Wonderful colors, focus, and composition.  10', '2003-10-16 22:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(453273, 42419, 10768, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of colors.</td>', 'Wonderful use of colors.', '2003-10-16 22:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(453274, 42419, 10084, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious. Great colors in the shot. I like how you arranged all the ingredients  around the plate that you used in the salad. The composition is rather interesting because of the colors. Lighting seems to be stronger on the ingredients then the finished food. This would make for a good cover for a cookbook. Great job.</td>', 'Looks delicious. Great colors in the shot. I like how you arranged all the ingredients  around the plate that you used in the salad. The composition is rather interesting because of the colors. Lighting seems to be stronger on the ingredients then the finished food. This would make for a good cover for a cookbook. Great job.', '2003-10-16 22:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(453276, 41610, 1280, '<td valign="top">This could be very nice but is oe, especially on the cheese and lemons.</td>', 'This could be very nice but is oe, especially on the cheese and lemons.', '2003-10-16 22:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(453278, 42472, 10768, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement.  Crisp colors.  Well done</td>', 'Nice arrangement.  Crisp colors.  Well done', '2003-10-16 22:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(453283, 41981, 12448, '<td valign="top">Even though this is something I would probably never eat in my life time this whole shot just JUMPED out of the monitor at me!  I didn''t even hesitate when I hit the 10!</td>', 'Even though this is something I would probably never eat in my life time this whole shot just JUMPED out of the monitor at me!  I didn''t even hesitate when I hit the 10!', '2003-10-16 22:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(453284, 42074, 10768, '<td valign="top">I like the angle that you took this shot at.  It''s a bit different from the usual overhead shots.  Nice composition.</td>', 'I like the angle that you took this shot at.  It''s a bit different from the usual overhead shots.  Nice composition.', '2003-10-16 22:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(453287, 42267, 1280, '<td valign="top">You made good use of the tomato to add red. Cheese and tomatoes are appealing to most people thus the popularity of Pizza and lots of other dishes.  The blue plate adds an unexpected element. Personally I don''t like when the oof area is in front.  To me, most of the time, the foreground should be in focus or cropped out.  BUT...that''s just personal.  :-)</td>', 'You made good use of the tomato to add red. Cheese and tomatoes are appealing to most people thus the popularity of Pizza and lots of other dishes.  The blue plate adds an unexpected element. Personally I don''t like when the oof area is in front.  To me, most of the time, the foreground should be in focus or cropped out.  BUT...that''s just personal.  :-)', '2003-10-16 22:32:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(453289, 42429, 12448, '<td valign="top">One of these days I''m going to have to try Sushi, just not quite brave enough yet, LOL!  This is a wonderful shot, the colors, the lighting, the refelction on the place.  The only thing is the flowers on the plate are not overpowering but just slightly distracting and the chop sticks, for some reason they keep trying to pull me up out of the shot.  A 9 from me</td>', 'One of these days I''m going to have to try Sushi, just not quite brave enough yet, LOL!  This is a wonderful shot, the colors, the lighting, the refelction on the place.  The only thing is the flowers on the plate are not overpowering but just slightly distracting and the chop sticks, for some reason they keep trying to pull me up out of the shot.  A 9 from me', '2003-10-16 22:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(453290, 42022, 12448, '<td valign="top">My mouth is watering, I love Apple Crisp!  This is a wonderful shot, the light reflecting off the side of the apple, the clarity, the color, just wonderful.  The only thing that gets me is the purple and gree handle that is crossing the bottom right corner.  You get a 9 from me.</td>', 'My mouth is watering, I love Apple Crisp!  This is a wonderful shot, the light reflecting off the side of the apple, the clarity, the color, just wonderful.  The only thing that gets me is the purple and gree handle that is crossing the bottom right corner.  You get a 9 from me.', '2003-10-16 22:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(453291, 41610, 12448, '<td valign="top">WOW!  What colors!  What variety!  What clarity!  Just a tad bright, especially off that white cheese in the upper right but still a 9 from me!</td>', 'WOW!  What colors!  What variety!  What clarity!  Just a tad bright, especially off that white cheese in the upper right but still a 9 from me!', '2003-10-16 22:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(453292, 42465, 10768, '<td valign="top">The red of the strawberrys really stand out.  Love the perspective that this was shot.  Very nice composition.   10</td>', 'The red of the strawberrys really stand out.  Love the perspective that this was shot.  Very nice composition.   10', '2003-10-16 22:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(453295, 42411, 12448, '<td valign="top">HEY!  HE IS STARING AT ME!  LOL!  One of the reasons I don''t eat crawfish though I hear they are delicious.  This is a wonderful shot, the colors are vibrant, the clarity is fanstistic, the subject fits the challenge without a doubt and capturing those eyes so they look right in the camera, wonderul.  The only thing that bothered me about the whole this was the sprig in the front, the blurred out one, it adds to the shot but takes away at the same time.  You get a 9 from me.</td>', 'HEY!  HE IS STARING AT ME!  LOL!  One of the reasons I don''t eat crawfish though I hear they are delicious.  This is a wonderful shot, the colors are vibrant, the clarity is fanstistic, the subject fits the challenge without a doubt and capturing those eyes so they look right in the camera, wonderul.  The only thing that bothered me about the whole this was the sprig in the front, the blurred out one, it adds to the shot but takes away at the same time.  You get a 9 from me.', '2003-10-16 22:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
