(453377, 42294, 3080, '<td valign="top">What''s the recipe for making a pea pod?  I guess this could be the ''before'' of some great dish found in a cookbook.  The photo is nice.  Because the outter edge of the pod is not crisp focus, and the light glares on the peas are soft, it makes the shot look like it''s a bit out of focus, even if it''s not really all out of focus.  The shallow DOF is not really needed here.  I would have prefered the entire thing to be in focus.  That would have worked better for me.  I like how it''s centered, and I like the dark background.  Overall, nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'What''s the recipe for making a pea pod?  I guess this could be the ''before'' of some great dish found in a cookbook.  The photo is nice.  Because the outter edge of the pod is not crisp focus, and the light glares on the peas are soft, it makes the shot look like it''s a bit out of focus, even if it''s not really all out of focus.  The shallow DOF is not really needed here.  I would have prefered the entire thing to be in focus.  That would have worked better for me.  I like how it''s centered, and I like the dark background.  Overall, nice. ~Heather~', '2003-10-17 00:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
