(453381, 42453, 3080, '<td valign="top">First thing I notice here is thre really harsh shadow to the right of the bowl.  This is really distracting to the photo as a whole.  The next thing I notice is that your subject is off center enough to make this a non centered shot, but not quite off center enough to give it any dramatic angle or anything.  It looks like a sloppy job lining up the shot.  The food looks good, although the crispest focus seems to be in the bottom left corner on the table cloth.  The eggs seem a bit soft, but look at the detail in the bottom left corner.  I wish that kind of detail and focus were on the eggs.  ~Heather~</td>', 'First thing I notice here is thre really harsh shadow to the right of the bowl.  This is really distracting to the photo as a whole.  The next thing I notice is that your subject is off center enough to make this a non centered shot, but not quite off center enough to give it any dramatic angle or anything.  It looks like a sloppy job lining up the shot.  The food looks good, although the crispest focus seems to be in the bottom left corner on the table cloth.  The eggs seem a bit soft, but look at the detail in the bottom left corner.  I wish that kind of detail and focus were on the eggs.  ~Heather~', '2003-10-17 00:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
