(453389, 42178, 3080, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this at all.  Definatly not my cup of tea so to speak.  If you hadn''t specified what this was, I would not have even guessed it.  Secondly, since I now know it''s an onion, I wouldn''t think it would have these silly colors in it.  It might appeal to some, but not to me.  Sorry.  Also, whatever effect you used, really made it grainy and aweful in the background part in the upper right.</td>', 'I don''t like this at all.  Definatly not my cup of tea so to speak.  If you hadn''t specified what this was, I would not have even guessed it.  Secondly, since I now know it''s an onion, I wouldn''t think it would have these silly colors in it.  It might appeal to some, but not to me.  Sorry.  Also, whatever effect you used, really made it grainy and aweful in the background part in the upper right.', '2003-10-17 00:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(453390, 42462, 9004, '<td valign="top">Great shot but image should have been rotated a tad CCW.</td>', 'Great shot but image should have been rotated a tad CCW.', '2003-10-17 00:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(453391, 42411, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice presentation of an ugly beast.  I really like how you have his face in focus and the dof kind of trickling off from there.  I also like how a little bit of the garnish is also in focus.  the bottom left corner is a little busy with the different directions of the out of focus leaves, but it doesn''t take away horribly from the main subject.  Very nice detail in his face.  You show us the textures really well.  Nice shot.  ~Heather~<br/> <br/>UPDATE: I had already given this a 9, but after reviewing the other submissions, I have no doubt this will be in the top 3.  Good work.</td>', 'Very nice presentation of an ugly beast.  I really like how you have his face in focus and the dof kind of trickling off from there.  I also like how a little bit of the garnish is also in focus.  the bottom left corner is a little busy with the different directions of the out of focus leaves, but it doesn''t take away horribly from the main subject.  Very nice detail in his face.  You show us the textures really well.  Nice shot.  ~Heather~ UPDATE: I had already given this a 9, but after reviewing the other submissions, I have no doubt this will be in the top 3.  Good work.', '2003-10-17 00:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(453392, 42370, 9004, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Need I say more?</td>', 'Great picture. Need I say more?', '2003-10-17 00:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(453394, 42267, 3080, '<td valign="top">Mac and cheese and tomatoes??  That just looks discusting.  As for the photo, it seems that the DOF is a bit shallow.  TOO shallow.  The only part that really stands out to me as being at all in focus is the edge of the tomato.  Also, the shot seems grainy.  Especially in the blue area.  It bothers me that the large area of mac and cheese in the bottom right is badly out of focus.  I would prefer this part to be in focus. ~Heather~</td>', 'Mac and cheese and tomatoes??  That just looks discusting.  As for the photo, it seems that the DOF is a bit shallow.  TOO shallow.  The only part that really stands out to me as being at all in focus is the edge of the tomato.  Also, the shot seems grainy.  Especially in the blue area.  It bothers me that the large area of mac and cheese in the bottom right is badly out of focus.  I would prefer this part to be in focus. ~Heather~', '2003-10-17 00:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(453399, 42294, 10084, '<td valign="top">A bit more light would give the peas more contrast. You can see some nice shadows under the peas, but more light would help pop them out of the shot. The highlights on the peas itself would really shine.</td>', 'A bit more light would give the peas more contrast. You can see some nice shadows under the peas, but more light would help pop them out of the shot. The highlights on the peas itself would really shine.', '2003-10-17 00:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(453401, 42178, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors. Beautiful shapes capture off of the onion. Some good looking patterns. Almost like a closeup of a fingerprint.</td>', 'Interesting colors. Beautiful shapes capture off of the onion. Some good looking patterns. Almost like a closeup of a fingerprint.', '2003-10-17 00:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(453403, 42012, 10084, '<td valign="top">The colors and the dish that you made really gives off a great feeling of autumn. Really nice color selection. The table cloth is perfect. The shinyness of the glaze seems really sweet. The light really helps to make the dish shine. Probably really tasty too.</td>', 'The colors and the dish that you made really gives off a great feeling of autumn. Really nice color selection. The table cloth is perfect. The shinyness of the glaze seems really sweet. The light really helps to make the dish shine. Probably really tasty too.', '2003-10-17 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(453405, 42472, 811, '<td valign="top">I use this recipe frequently.  My family calls them cuppa cuppa cuppa cookies.  <br/> <br/>The lighting seems a little harsh or off.  Maybe try bouncing it onto the subject, rather than shining on it directly.</td>', 'I use this recipe frequently.  My family calls them cuppa cuppa cuppa cookies.   The lighting seems a little harsh or off.  Maybe try bouncing it onto the subject, rather than shining on it directly.', '2003-10-17 00:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(453440, 42381, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hahahahaha, that''s funny.  Hope you share the recipe! :)</td>', 'Hahahahaha, that''s funny.  Hope you share the recipe! :)', '2003-10-17 01:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(453441, 42429, 4494, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like Sushi too much but that''s a great picture of it!  Good job.</td>', 'I don''t really like Sushi too much but that''s a great picture of it!  Good job.', '2003-10-17 01:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(453443, 42417, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice job using the leaves as the background, really good.  I think the shot needs more light however.  It looks a little dark.</td>', 'Nice job using the leaves as the background, really good.  I think the shot needs more light however.  It looks a little dark.', '2003-10-17 01:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(453445, 42012, 4494, '<td valign="top">Umm umm. :)</td>', 'Umm umm. :)', '2003-10-17 01:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(453446, 42429, 9411, '<td valign="top">One of my absolutely favourite dishes... I question the use of this patterned plate. It''s a bit distracting. Very nice colour and focus.</td>', 'One of my absolutely favourite dishes... I question the use of this patterned plate. It''s a bit distracting. Very nice colour and focus.', '2003-10-17 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(453449, 42419, 4494, '<td valign="top">Love the layout of all the different foods all over the table, the uncooked noodles in the background, etc., very good.   The shot maybe needs a little more light on the dish itself.</td>', 'Love the layout of all the different foods all over the table, the uncooked noodles in the background, etc., very good.   The shot maybe needs a little more light on the dish itself.', '2003-10-17 01:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(453452, 42044, 4494, '<td valign="top">Great shot... for the Title you could have said "Mushroom Omelette, Starts Here" instead of that long text.</td>', 'Great shot... for the Title you could have said "Mushroom Omelette, Starts Here" instead of that long text.', '2003-10-17 01:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(453454, 42452, 4494, '<td valign="top">Seems like there is too much dead space between the fries and meat.</td>', 'Seems like there is too much dead space between the fries and meat.', '2003-10-17 01:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(453457, 41981, 4494, '<td valign="top">Maybe take off a little from the top (crop it).  I really like the strong, realistic colors of the food on the pure white dish and background, excellent.  The chop sticks also add "strength" to the shot.  8.</td>', 'Maybe take off a little from the top (crop it).  I really like the strong, realistic colors of the food on the pure white dish and background, excellent.  The chop sticks also add "strength" to the shot.  8.', '2003-10-17 01:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(453461, 42427, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice unique image.  One thing you could do is increase the contrast a little using Levels.</td>', 'Nice unique image.  One thing you could do is increase the contrast a little using Levels.', '2003-10-17 01:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(453464, 42392, 4494, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little too strong on the right... use another light on the left to dim the shadows a little.  Also, you should have shot this from a lower angle I think.   And the pic is tilted to the right (or at least the book is).</td>', 'Lighting is a little too strong on the right... use another light on the left to dim the shadows a little.  Also, you should have shot this from a lower angle I think.   And the pic is tilted to the right (or at least the book is).', '2003-10-17 01:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(453468, 41610, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice vivid colors and great lighting.  A little too much light at the top-right but oh well, nothing is perfect.  7.</td>', 'Nice vivid colors and great lighting.  A little too much light at the top-right but oh well, nothing is perfect.  7.', '2003-10-17 01:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(453469, 42074, 4494, '<td valign="top">Picture looks tilted to the left. :(  Great subject however.  If you could have lit up the wine with a seperate light source that would be nice.</td>', 'Picture looks tilted to the left. :(  Great subject however.  If you could have lit up the wine with a seperate light source that would be nice.', '2003-10-17 01:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(453472, 42467, 4494, '<td valign="top">I''d have "pulled" the crop down and to the right to remove the black part in the upper left, and to show a little more of the two bottom and right cheesecakes.   They look delicous!!</td>', 'I''d have "pulled" the crop down and to the right to remove the black part in the upper left, and to show a little more of the two bottom and right cheesecakes.   They look delicous!!', '2003-10-17 01:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(453473, 42028, 4494, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot, but the bottom-left black area is distracting.   And a little more DOF would have been better so that the entire dish and bread (both pieces) are in perfect focus.</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot, but the bottom-left black area is distracting.   And a little more DOF would have been better so that the entire dish and bread (both pieces) are in perfect focus.', '2003-10-17 01:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(453476, 42462, 4494, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot I love it but one critical problem:  It''s titled to the right!!  I can''t believe that a photographer would make a good shot like this but not notice the extreme tilt. :(</td>', 'It''s a great shot I love it but one critical problem:  It''s titled to the right!!  I can''t believe that a photographer would make a good shot like this but not notice the extreme tilt. :(', '2003-10-17 01:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(453477, 42195, 4494, '<td valign="top">All you need is John Ritter in the shot!</td>', 'All you need is John Ritter in the shot!', '2003-10-17 01:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(453478, 42335, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very nice.... :)  Whoot this one may win.  Extremely pleasing to look at and very well done!  Best so far.  9.</td>', 'Very nice.... :)  Whoot this one may win.  Extremely pleasing to look at and very well done!  Best so far.  9.', '2003-10-17 01:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(453479, 41995, 4494, '<td valign="top">What a feast!!!</td>', 'What a feast!!!', '2003-10-17 01:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(453485, 42437, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great set up, everything is placed well.  I would''ve liked more of the items on the left side to be visible (not so tight a crop).  The energy is great, looks realistic not over-done or fake (whether she''s actually posing or not).  My main complaints are the focus of the whole scene feels soft to me, and that slight blurredness is distracting.  Also, I''m not sure if it is the lighting or what, but there seems to be an oversaturation of hue, there''s a yellowy/red tone that is looking overloaded to my eye.   6</td>', 'Great set up, everything is placed well.  I would''ve liked more of the items on the left side to be visible (not so tight a crop).  The energy is great, looks realistic not over-done or fake (whether she''s actually posing or not).  My main complaints are the focus of the whole scene feels soft to me, and that slight blurredness is distracting.  Also, I''m not sure if it is the lighting or what, but there seems to be an oversaturation of hue, there''s a yellowy/red tone that is looking overloaded to my eye.   6', '2003-10-17 02:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(453486, 42402, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, evokes memories.  I like the black &amp; white tone, it helps calm the shot down.  I find it a bit busy with all the items in the background - but the coloring helps diffuse that.  Your model is adorable and the lighting looks good.  A little more focus on the face, rather than the dress would''ve appealed to me more but overall its a good shot! 7</td>', 'Nice capture, evokes memories.  I like the black & white tone, it helps calm the shot down.  I find it a bit busy with all the items in the background - but the coloring helps diffuse that.  Your model is adorable and the lighting looks good.  A little more focus on the face, rather than the dress would''ve appealed to me more but overall its a good shot! 7', '2003-10-17 02:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(453489, 41981, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow very vivid!  The colors are marvelous.  The setup is crisp and clean.  I like the fact that spring rolls for the most part have the lion''s share of the focus.  Artfully arranged, which increases the interest.  The only thing I find off is the white on white look.  I think keeping the white plate - so the decor stands out would be good, but a different background.  Maybe a red to tie in with the peppers and would still show off the white plate/rolls and the black chopsticks.  Otherwise the plate blends too much for my tastes and gets lost.  Outstanding all the same.  9</td>', 'Wow very vivid!  The colors are marvelous.  The setup is crisp and clean.  I like the fact that spring rolls for the most part have the lion''s share of the focus.  Artfully arranged, which increases the interest.  The only thing I find off is the white on white look.  I think keeping the white plate - so the decor stands out would be good, but a different background.  Maybe a red to tie in with the peppers and would still show off the white plate/rolls and the black chopsticks.  Otherwise the plate blends too much for my tastes and gets lost.  Outstanding all the same.  9', '2003-10-17 02:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(453492, 42462, 11923, '<td valign="top">Wow!  No, double wow!  This composition is nearly perfect.  Just the right amount of background ambience.  The colors work wonderfully together and the lighting is great.  The food looks excellent - even the set up on the plate is fabulous.  Focus is very nice, though seems a bit soft on the.. carrot curls? that could just be a strange anomoly however.  Maybe a teensy wider crop on the right side, just to get a bit more of the fork in.  That''s mostly being picky though.  Fantastic.  10</td>', 'Wow!  No, double wow!  This composition is nearly perfect.  Just the right amount of background ambience.  The colors work wonderfully together and the lighting is great.  The food looks excellent - even the set up on the plate is fabulous.  Focus is very nice, though seems a bit soft on the.. carrot curls? that could just be a strange anomoly however.  Maybe a teensy wider crop on the right side, just to get a bit more of the fork in.  That''s mostly being picky though.  Fantastic.  10', '2003-10-17 02:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(453494, 42429, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation!  Good color contrasts.  The food looks well put together, and more importantly it looks like it would be good to eat.  Only complaint on that end I have is the orange stuff on top (carrots?), it brings a great color contrast but has focus issues for me.  The lighting makes the rolls look nice and crisp, but I find the plate due to the light reflection has too cool of a hue to it, competing with the food''s coloring.  Perhaps a solid colored plate in light blue or purple might have offset the food better.  Very sound photo.  7</td>', 'Nice presentation!  Good color contrasts.  The food looks well put together, and more importantly it looks like it would be good to eat.  Only complaint on that end I have is the orange stuff on top (carrots?), it brings a great color contrast but has focus issues for me.  The lighting makes the rolls look nice and crisp, but I find the plate due to the light reflection has too cool of a hue to it, competing with the food''s coloring.  Perhaps a solid colored plate in light blue or purple might have offset the food better.  Very sound photo.  7', '2003-10-17 02:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(453496, 42334, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice simple presentation, draws the eyes directly to the meal.  The food looks good!  I do think the plate, though it adds a splash of color, is a bit busy and competes with the food in this instance.  Also, the ravioli seems a touch out of focus, while the fork - simply a prop - has more clarity.   I like the low lighting, but would''ve preferred a bit more intense light directly on the food, just to give it that extra attention &amp; oomph.  As I said, I do like the low lighting, with it and the mesh-like table background, it gives the feel of an early evening dinner on the patio.  6</td>', 'Nice simple presentation, draws the eyes directly to the meal.  The food looks good!  I do think the plate, though it adds a splash of color, is a bit busy and competes with the food in this instance.  Also, the ravioli seems a touch out of focus, while the fork - simply a prop - has more clarity.   I like the low lighting, but would''ve preferred a bit more intense light directly on the food, just to give it that extra attention & oomph.  As I said, I do like the low lighting, with it and the mesh-like table background, it gives the feel of an early evening dinner on the patio.  6', '2003-10-17 02:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(453497, 42100, 11923, '<td valign="top">Heh, great title.  Works perfectly with the shot.  The food looks great, love the lighting.  Crisp lines and good focus.  Would''ve liked all the tendrils of spaghetti to be fully in the shot.  Nice solid photo.  7</td>', 'Heh, great title.  Works perfectly with the shot.  The food looks great, love the lighting.  Crisp lines and good focus.  Would''ve liked all the tendrils of spaghetti to be fully in the shot.  Nice solid photo.  7', '2003-10-17 02:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(453498, 41523, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I love the differing perspectives all in one go.  With the cocktail/wine glass and the glass liquor bottle, it has a clear crisp feel that is shaken up a bit with the vivid read coloring.  Everything looks splendid to me.  9</td>', 'Great shot!  I love the differing perspectives all in one go.  With the cocktail/wine glass and the glass liquor bottle, it has a clear crisp feel that is shaken up a bit with the vivid read coloring.  Everything looks splendid to me.  9', '2003-10-17 02:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(453499, 42195, 11923, '<td valign="top">Hmm.. I like the set up.  Black background works nicely with the white doilies and carnation.  The food looks good, but it has a lack of dynamic to keep me in the picture - I find the props hold my interest more.  Maybe if there were more layers in the dessert, then the view we have of it would attract my attention better.  Lighting is great and the arrangement of items works well.  7</td>', 'Hmm.. I like the set up.  Black background works nicely with the white doilies and carnation.  The food looks good, but it has a lack of dynamic to keep me in the picture - I find the props hold my interest more.  Maybe if there were more layers in the dessert, then the view we have of it would attract my attention better.  Lighting is great and the arrangement of items works well.  7', '2003-10-17 02:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(453502, 42441, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting set up.  I like the off-kilter perspective and the light tones.  Lighting is great.  I even like the small focus area - it really works for this photo.  The food looks appetizing, the bits of parsley? give it extra texture.  Nice!  7</td>', 'Interesting set up.  I like the off-kilter perspective and the light tones.  Lighting is great.  I even like the small focus area - it really works for this photo.  The food looks appetizing, the bits of parsley? give it extra texture.  Nice!  7', '2003-10-17 03:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(453503, 42428, 11923, '<td valign="top">Simple, great impact.  I do have to be honest and say that I don''t really like white on white presentations - I like a little color contrast to shake things up.  That said I do like the composition of this photo.  The egg gives just enough difference in color to keep it interesting.  lighting does seem a little harsh on the right side - to the point of losing definition on the egg cup.  Good image.  7</td>', 'Simple, great impact.  I do have to be honest and say that I don''t really like white on white presentations - I like a little color contrast to shake things up.  That said I do like the composition of this photo.  The egg gives just enough difference in color to keep it interesting.  lighting does seem a little harsh on the right side - to the point of losing definition on the egg cup.  Good image.  7', '2003-10-17 03:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(453505, 41984, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great set up, I like how it gets all aspects in the photo without it feeling busy or crammed.  Nice space.  I do wish though the food had more presence than it does, I think it was lost due to the perspective the photo was taken from.  I would''ve also liked the whole presentation to be brighter - with the nice feeling of space, comes a need imo for greater light depth.  Other than those points I think its a very good photo.  7</td>', 'Great set up, I like how it gets all aspects in the photo without it feeling busy or crammed.  Nice space.  I do wish though the food had more presence than it does, I think it was lost due to the perspective the photo was taken from.  I would''ve also liked the whole presentation to be brighter - with the nice feeling of space, comes a need imo for greater light depth.  Other than those points I think its a very good photo.  7', '2003-10-17 03:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(453507, 41771, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''ll be looking this recipe up when the challenge is over, my dog loves treats, and honestly - these look kind of appetizing to me too.  I love the detail showing on the ''bones'', the colors are a nice array of neutral tones, excellent texture.  Great lighting.  Focus is perfect.  I don''t see anything I would change.  10</td>', 'I''ll be looking this recipe up when the challenge is over, my dog loves treats, and honestly - these look kind of appetizing to me too.  I love the detail showing on the ''bones'', the colors are a nice array of neutral tones, excellent texture.  Great lighting.  Focus is perfect.  I don''t see anything I would change.  10', '2003-10-17 03:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(453509, 42337, 11923, '<td valign="top">To be truthful, I find little of interest in the photo.  Perhaps the black &amp; white aspect of it took out what could''ve been a nice contrast - whitish garlic against a wooden background (looks like wood could be wrong).  The size of the photo does take away for me as well.  May have added a bit of drama if the garlic was in one corner, with an expanse of background - giving it a depth of space and interest.  That said, I do like the lighting, it creates some interesting shadows and the focus looks crisp on the end of the garlic.  4</td>', 'To be truthful, I find little of interest in the photo.  Perhaps the black & white aspect of it took out what could''ve been a nice contrast - whitish garlic against a wooden background (looks like wood could be wrong).  The size of the photo does take away for me as well.  May have added a bit of drama if the garlic was in one corner, with an expanse of background - giving it a depth of space and interest.  That said, I do like the lighting, it creates some interesting shadows and the focus looks crisp on the end of the garlic.  4', '2003-10-17 03:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(453510, 42470, 11923, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind the photo, but I think it needs a few more elements to add interest.  I don''t have any off the cuff suggestions though.  A different colored plate, may be a solution - I don''t think that particular color offsets the pale coloring of the tablets very well.  Great idea - rather unique, but needs a little better presentation.  4</td>', 'I like the idea behind the photo, but I think it needs a few more elements to add interest.  I don''t have any off the cuff suggestions though.  A different colored plate, may be a solution - I don''t think that particular color offsets the pale coloring of the tablets very well.  Great idea - rather unique, but needs a little better presentation.  4', '2003-10-17 03:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(453511, 42199, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great colors, I do like the off-centered presentation in this instance.. I do think the white border coupled with the white plate and background are a little too much.  Maybe if the white beneath the blue cloth were a different color it would give an added depth.   Since not all of the stack is in the photo, I would''ve liked all that is showing to be in focus.  Otherwise, its a nice photo.  Good job.  5</td>', 'Great colors, I do like the off-centered presentation in this instance.. I do think the white border coupled with the white plate and background are a little too much.  Maybe if the white beneath the blue cloth were a different color it would give an added depth.   Since not all of the stack is in the photo, I would''ve liked all that is showing to be in focus.  Otherwise, its a nice photo.  Good job.  5', '2003-10-17 03:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(453513, 42469, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great color usage.  The noodles look fairly well defined.  The food does look good.  I like the use of the black background, but I find the ingredients spilled in the back a bit distracting.  Would''ve rathered the shot be filled by the goulash instead - not cut off in the right hand corner, I think it is strong enough to stand on its own - no props needed.  Lighting looks good.  6</td>', 'Great color usage.  The noodles look fairly well defined.  The food does look good.  I like the use of the black background, but I find the ingredients spilled in the back a bit distracting.  Would''ve rathered the shot be filled by the goulash instead - not cut off in the right hand corner, I think it is strong enough to stand on its own - no props needed.  Lighting looks good.  6', '2003-10-17 03:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(453514, 42294, 11078, '<td valign="top">I like the photo nice Idea but hardly a receipe</td>', 'I like the photo nice Idea but hardly a receipe', '2003-10-17 03:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(453555, 42100, 11078, '<td valign="top">yes please I''d love to</td>', 'yes please I''d love to', '2003-10-17 05:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(453556, 42028, 11078, '<td valign="top">looks very tasty nice presentation</td>', 'looks very tasty nice presentation', '2003-10-17 05:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(453557, 42469, 11078, '<td valign="top">I would love to taste this very colourful meal  I think the nuts are a bit distracting<br/>Well done</td>', 'I would love to taste this very colourful meal  I think the nuts are a bit distractingWell done', '2003-10-17 05:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
