(453632, 41995, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yum, those look delicious!  I''ve only had Cornish Hen once in my lifetime and it wad delicious too.  <br/> <br/>As for this shot, wow, very busy.  Lots of different things going on. the hens, the plate, the background.  The hens end up just blending into the shot instead of being highlighted.  The light from the side is also a tad bright to me but that could be my monitor too.  If there wasn''t so much going on in the background I would rate this much higher, as is, it starts at a 5</td>', 'Yum, those look delicious!  I''ve only had Cornish Hen once in my lifetime and it wad delicious too.   As for this shot, wow, very busy.  Lots of different things going on. the hens, the plate, the background.  The hens end up just blending into the shot instead of being highlighted.  The light from the side is also a tad bright to me but that could be my monitor too.  If there wasn''t so much going on in the background I would rate this much higher, as is, it starts at a 5', '2003-10-17 09:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(453633, 42428, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent, loved how clean and simple it looks. What did you put the egg cup on, can see lines going off into the distance, draws my eyes upwards though which is good. 10</td>', 'Excellent, loved how clean and simple it looks. What did you put the egg cup on, can see lines going off into the distance, draws my eyes upwards though which is good. 10', '2003-10-17 09:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(453634, 42433, 10167, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  With your choice of background items, this screams "home made bread".  DOF is perfect.  Nice work!</td>', 'Very nice.  With your choice of background items, this screams "home made bread".  DOF is perfect.  Nice work!', '2003-10-17 09:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(453638, 42462, 10167, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites this time around.  Nice arrangement, nice colors, nice all around!</td>', 'This was one of my favorites this time around.  Nice arrangement, nice colors, nice all around!', '2003-10-17 09:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(453647, 42074, 10167, '<td valign="top">Really nice!  I find my eyes drawn to the bright reflections at the top of the utensils a bit, but aside from that little nit-pick, this is a really great photo.  Good work!</td>', 'Really nice!  I find my eyes drawn to the bright reflections at the top of the utensils a bit, but aside from that little nit-pick, this is a really great photo.  Good work!', '2003-10-17 09:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(453651, 42419, 10167, '<td valign="top">Nice pic!  I think I would have liked to have seen some silverware rather than the raw ingredients though.  I understand where you were going with it, but you obviously spent a lot of time preparing the beautiful dish to the right...  I''m finding that I''m paying more attention to the onion and red bell pepper wayyyyy over at the other side of the pic though, which (in my mind at least!) isn''t really intended to be the main subject.  Another possibility might have been to bring the main dish into the frame more with the ingredients behind but blurred a bit with a shallow DOF set on the dish to really make it stand out.</td>', 'Nice pic!  I think I would have liked to have seen some silverware rather than the raw ingredients though.  I understand where you were going with it, but you obviously spent a lot of time preparing the beautiful dish to the right...  I''m finding that I''m paying more attention to the onion and red bell pepper wayyyyy over at the other side of the pic though, which (in my mind at least!) isn''t really intended to be the main subject.  Another possibility might have been to bring the main dish into the frame more with the ingredients behind but blurred a bit with a shallow DOF set on the dish to really make it stand out.', '2003-10-17 09:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(453653, 42199, 10167, '<td valign="top">Yum!  Nice pic!  I''m a tad distracted by the blue napkin...  One with some red in it might have complimented the dish a little more.  It''s a minor issue with me though.  <br/>Still one of my favorites this challenge.  Good work!</td>', 'Yum!  Nice pic!  I''m a tad distracted by the blue napkin...  One with some red in it might have complimented the dish a little more.  It''s a minor issue with me though.  Still one of my favorites this challenge.  Good work!', '2003-10-17 10:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(453718, 42337, 12448, '<td valign="top">Used in many different recipes, spagetti sauce being my favorite.  The shotis a bit small though I do like the cropping, having the garlic just off center.  The lines on the table help draw you in  but the clarity is a bit lacking and the shadows are undefined towards the back left.  I''m giving this one a 5, maybe if you had broken the garlic open  or crushed it like you were getting ready to use it?</td>', 'Used in many different recipes, spagetti sauce being my favorite.  The shotis a bit small though I do like the cropping, having the garlic just off center.  The lines on the table help draw you in  but the clarity is a bit lacking and the shadows are undefined towards the back left.  I''m giving this one a 5, maybe if you had broken the garlic open  or crushed it like you were getting ready to use it?', '2003-10-17 11:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(453724, 42402, 12448, '<td valign="top">They do love the cookie dough, don''t they!  My girls used to actually stick their heads in the bowl to lick it, what a mess! :)<br/> <br/>This is a lovely shot, a very big part of the baking/cooking process, having the kids involved and teaching them.  I like the cropping, the picture looks a bit skewed, slightly off balance, I thnk it''s the way te floor flows through the shot.  The B&amp;W works well with this shot, helps keep the background from becoming too distracting.  A tad more sharpness, contrast and balance overall and I would score this much higher.  Starting at a 5 but I will be back, I too cannot resist cookie dough.</td>', 'They do love the cookie dough, don''t they!  My girls used to actually stick their heads in the bowl to lick it, what a mess! :) This is a lovely shot, a very big part of the baking/cooking process, having the kids involved and teaching them.  I like the cropping, the picture looks a bit skewed, slightly off balance, I thnk it''s the way te floor flows through the shot.  The B&W works well with this shot, helps keep the background from becoming too distracting.  A tad more sharpness, contrast and balance overall and I would score this much higher.  Starting at a 5 but I will be back, I too cannot resist cookie dough.', '2003-10-17 11:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(453726, 42178, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ah, a sweet onion perhaps?  The colors actually work on this one.  Though the blue in the upper right tends to be distracting.  But making the colors like you did it could almost be a purple onion!  The cropping is well done, the lines draw you from lower right to upper left and it almost makes me want to cry! ;)  I''m starting this one at a 6</td>', 'Ah, a sweet onion perhaps?  The colors actually work on this one.  Though the blue in the upper right tends to be distracting.  But making the colors like you did it could almost be a purple onion!  The cropping is well done, the lines draw you from lower right to upper left and it almost makes me want to cry! ;)  I''m starting this one at a 6', '2003-10-17 11:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(453730, 41990, 12448, '<td valign="top">Gimme, Gimme, GIMME!  I love deviled eggs and these look delicious.  Great presentation on the eggs and I can''t wait to see the recipe.   As for the balance, the off center doesn''t really work for me personally and the background is a nice contrast but I''m almost wondering how a blue one would have looked.  I''m starting this one at 6 but I''ll be back to drool, er, vote again</td>', 'Gimme, Gimme, GIMME!  I love deviled eggs and these look delicious.  Great presentation on the eggs and I can''t wait to see the recipe.   As for the balance, the off center doesn''t really work for me personally and the background is a nice contrast but I''m almost wondering how a blue one would have looked.  I''m starting this one at 6 but I''ll be back to drool, er, vote again', '2003-10-17 11:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(453735, 42439, 12448, '<td valign="top">On the grill, yummmmmmmm!  They look delicious but the presentation leaves something to be desired.  The shot is almost too filled and the grill ends up being a distraction to me.  The cropping isn''t bad but since you have T-Bone in the title, to see a completed one would have really drove the point home for m.  THere''s part of one here, part of one there, kinda jumbled to me.  I''m starting this one at a 5 but I will be back.</td>', 'On the grill, yummmmmmmm!  They look delicious but the presentation leaves something to be desired.  The shot is almost too filled and the grill ends up being a distraction to me.  The cropping isn''t bad but since you have T-Bone in the title, to see a completed one would have really drove the point home for m.  THere''s part of one here, part of one there, kinda jumbled to me.  I''m starting this one at a 5 but I will be back.', '2003-10-17 11:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(453738, 42411, 2764, '<td valign="top">My favorite picture even though I have never eaten a crawfish.  THis one seems t be daring me to try.  The sprigs of greaan give a nice touch of color, the border is well done. Technically lovely, perfect focus and nice DOF to make those accusing eyes really stand out. All leading lines point towards the eyes.</td>', 'My favorite picture even though I have never eaten a crawfish.  THis one seems t be daring me to try.  The sprigs of greaan give a nice touch of color, the border is well done. Technically lovely, perfect focus and nice DOF to make those accusing eyes really stand out. All leading lines point towards the eyes.', '2003-10-17 11:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(453741, 42440, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very unique way to present this.  Not sure what it is but the coloring seems dark to me, the table it''s on really takes away from the dessert glass and while the dessert may be tasty, overall this picture is not very appetizing.  Skewing the shot to give it a different prespective is original but the fact that the contents of the glass are not leaning with the shot doesn''t work very well for me.  I''m giving this one a 5 for the unique approach, meeting the challenge without a doubt and the anticipation for the recipe. :)</td>', 'A very unique way to present this.  Not sure what it is but the coloring seems dark to me, the table it''s on really takes away from the dessert glass and while the dessert may be tasty, overall this picture is not very appetizing.  Skewing the shot to give it a different prespective is original but the fact that the contents of the glass are not leaning with the shot doesn''t work very well for me.  I''m giving this one a 5 for the unique approach, meeting the challenge without a doubt and the anticipation for the recipe. :)', '2003-10-17 11:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(453746, 41508, 12448, '<td valign="top">jummy???  LOL!  Different title, not sure if you meant to do that but you get points for originality, LOL!  As for the shot, yes, cookies and milk, the perfect afterschool snack.  I like the overall composition and positioning of the shot but the cookies are dwarfed by the glass of milk and if the glass was full instead of 1/2 full (yes I''m an optimist) I would score much higher on this one.  I''m starting at a 6 but I will be back.</td>', 'jummy???  LOL!  Different title, not sure if you meant to do that but you get points for originality, LOL!  As for the shot, yes, cookies and milk, the perfect afterschool snack.  I like the overall composition and positioning of the shot but the cookies are dwarfed by the glass of milk and if the glass was full instead of 1/2 full (yes I''m an optimist) I would score much higher on this one.  I''m starting at a 6 but I will be back.', '2003-10-17 11:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(453749, 41981, 12654, '<td valign="top">Superb picture!!!!!!</td>', 'Superb picture!!!!!!', '2003-10-17 11:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(453751, 42470, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hey now!  Are you that bad a cook?  LOL!  I know I can be!  This is a good idea, the after effects of a great meal.  This would have worked much better if you could have gotten more focus on the overall picture and for me, just one or two tablets would have really driven the point home, as they are, it''s rather jumbled and confusing.  I''m starting with a 6 but I will be back after dinner for some relief :)</td>', 'Hey now!  Are you that bad a cook?  LOL!  I know I can be!  This is a good idea, the after effects of a great meal.  This would have worked much better if you could have gotten more focus on the overall picture and for me, just one or two tablets would have really driven the point home, as they are, it''s rather jumbled and confusing.  I''m starting with a 6 but I will be back after dinner for some relief :)', '2003-10-17 11:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(453754, 42409, 12448, '<td valign="top">I cannot wait for this recipe, I love peaches and strawberries!  The brightness of this shot makes it jump out but once you get here the sharpness is a bit much and the tabletop is very distracting being cut in half with color.  I would have gone with all red on this one, the white ends up blowing the plate out and being distracting.  I''m starting with a 6 on this one but I will be back.</td>', 'I cannot wait for this recipe, I love peaches and strawberries!  The brightness of this shot makes it jump out but once you get here the sharpness is a bit much and the tabletop is very distracting being cut in half with color.  I would have gone with all red on this one, the white ends up blowing the plate out and being distracting.  I''m starting with a 6 on this one but I will be back.', '2003-10-17 11:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(453758, 42231, 12448, '<td valign="top">This looks delicious even before it''s cooked, I can''t wait for this recipe!  The light is well done the the cropping could have been just a tad tighter on the right.  The little blue glass figure is a bit of a distraction.    I like this shot but am starting it at a6 but I''ll be back to look some more and possibly bump it up</td>', 'This looks delicious even before it''s cooked, I can''t wait for this recipe!  The light is well done the the cropping could have been just a tad tighter on the right.  The little blue glass figure is a bit of a distraction.    I like this shot but am starting it at a6 but I''ll be back to look some more and possibly bump it up', '2003-10-17 11:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(453760, 42074, 2764, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  Is it tilred ever so slightly to the right?  I think the level of the wine should be straightened to match the frame (nice frame too). 8</td>', 'This is lovely.  Is it tilred ever so slightly to the right?  I think the level of the wine should be straightened to match the frame (nice frame too). 8', '2003-10-17 11:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(453768, 42433, 2764, '<td valign="top">Very nice - A lot of "stuff" is included in the image wothout maiking ot look cluttered.  I think keeping the colors either bread colored or blue helped.  The blue in the napkin us picked up by the blue in the flowers.  I question the rolling pin - you don''t need one to make french bread.  Focus and DOF work to bring the attention right into the fresh bread flesh. 9</td>', 'Very nice - A lot of "stuff" is included in the image wothout maiking ot look cluttered.  I think keeping the colors either bread colored or blue helped.  The blue in the napkin us picked up by the blue in the flowers.  I question the rolling pin - you don''t need one to make french bread.  Focus and DOF work to bring the attention right into the fresh bread flesh. 9', '2003-10-17 11:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(453776, 42062, 2764, '<td valign="top">Though technically well done (maybe a bit too light) this image is boring because there is no focal point, no center of attention, no leading lines to give me a hint where I am supposed to look.  The viewers eyes will wander around for a few seconds, find nothing to pay attention to and think "I''m done, next picture".  In a contest like this where the voting is done very fast, you want something of importance to make the viewer linger long enough to notice that the focus is indeed very good and the food is fresh and probably would taste good. 5</td>', 'Though technically well done (maybe a bit too light) this image is boring because there is no focal point, no center of attention, no leading lines to give me a hint where I am supposed to look.  The viewers eyes will wander around for a few seconds, find nothing to pay attention to and think "I''m done, next picture".  In a contest like this where the voting is done very fast, you want something of importance to make the viewer linger long enough to notice that the focus is indeed very good and the food is fresh and probably would taste good. 5', '2003-10-17 11:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(453798, 42335, 10686, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, Great DOF and the form of the cup/handle balances well with the texture of the beans</td>', 'Very nice shot, Great DOF and the form of the cup/handle balances well with the texture of the beans', '2003-10-17 11:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(453801, 41523, 10686, '<td valign="top">Love the use of reflection and transparency here. This is really a good shot. The ONLY thing I would want to see is maybe some more light on the greern bottle label in the reflection, not fully lit, but just a bit more. That would bring out the contrast between the green in the label and the red of the cosmo. Then again, you might have tried that and not liked it. Anyway, good job!</td>', 'Love the use of reflection and transparency here. This is really a good shot. The ONLY thing I would want to see is maybe some more light on the greern bottle label in the reflection, not fully lit, but just a bit more. That would bring out the contrast between the green in the label and the red of the cosmo. Then again, you might have tried that and not liked it. Anyway, good job!', '2003-10-17 12:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(453809, 41610, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition a lot here, but I think this could use some improvement on the lighting, the Tomatoes look kind of orange and the cheese and the white part of the lemon are too bright. I can''t really tell exactly how this was lit, but I think if you had broadly diffused the main source and used a bit of direct light to bring out the highlights it might help.</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition a lot here, but I think this could use some improvement on the lighting, the Tomatoes look kind of orange and the cheese and the white part of the lemon are too bright. I can''t really tell exactly how this was lit, but I think if you had broadly diffused the main source and used a bit of direct light to bring out the highlights it might help.', '2003-10-17 12:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(453811, 42370, 10686, '<td valign="top">This looks really delicious and the shot is good overall, my only suggestion is that the rear part of the treat needs to have the same bright "pop" that the front part has.</td>', 'This looks really delicious and the shot is good overall, my only suggestion is that the rear part of the treat needs to have the same bright "pop" that the front part has.', '2003-10-17 12:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
