(453829, 42334, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is one I''m looking forward to how it was made!  As for the shot, I''m thinking it was outside on a cloudy day, more light would have really helped this piccture pop.  The plate, while beautiful is very distracting with the design, a plain white wone might have worked better.  The cropping is perfect.  The fork right on the edge and plate just sky of the edges, very well done.  Starting this one at a 6</td>', 'This is one I''m looking forward to how it was made!  As for the shot, I''m thinking it was outside on a cloudy day, more light would have really helped this piccture pop.  The plate, while beautiful is very distracting with the design, a plain white wone might have worked better.  The cropping is perfect.  The fork right on the edge and plate just sky of the edges, very well done.  Starting this one at a 6', '2003-10-17 12:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
