(453869, 42100, 10263, '<td valign="top">I should NOT be scoring these photos before lunch! This look good :) I love how you set this up.</td>', 'I should NOT be scoring these photos before lunch! This look good :) I love how you set this up.', '2003-10-17 13:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(453871, 41593, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is so unfair. An hour until lunch and I''m starved and this muffin looks sooooo good. Beautiful presentation, nice tones.</td>', 'This is so unfair. An hour until lunch and I''m starved and this muffin looks sooooo good. Beautiful presentation, nice tones.', '2003-10-17 13:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(453882, 42417, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big avocado fan but this does look yummy!  The plate is a perfect setting for the salad and the colors and set up are wonderful.  About the only things that seem to be working against you is light.  I''m betting you are outside and it''s cloudy.  I think this would look so much more alive and really pop if there was better lighting.  I like the leaves for your backdrop too.  Started at a 6 but bumping to an 8 because you can''t control weather, can you? :)</td>', 'I''m not a big avocado fan but this does look yummy!  The plate is a perfect setting for the salad and the colors and set up are wonderful.  About the only things that seem to be working against you is light.  I''m betting you are outside and it''s cloudy.  I think this would look so much more alive and really pop if there was better lighting.  I like the leaves for your backdrop too.  Started at a 6 but bumping to an 8 because you can''t control weather, can you? :)', '2003-10-17 14:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(453887, 42392, 12448, '<td valign="top">Whens dinner?  And where''s the BEEF? :)  Couldn''t resist.  <br/> <br/>This is an appealing shot, the food looks inviting and ready to go, but the lighting is a bit harsh on the right and the overall shot is off, a bit tilted to the right.  More balance, less light and this would have been a 8 or 9 in my book.  Going with a 7 though.</td>', 'Whens dinner?  And where''s the BEEF? :)  Couldn''t resist.   This is an appealing shot, the food looks inviting and ready to go, but the lighting is a bit harsh on the right and the overall shot is off, a bit tilted to the right.  More balance, less light and this would have been a 8 or 9 in my book.  Going with a 7 though.', '2003-10-17 14:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(453889, 42453, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love eggs in the morning and that bacon looks just about perfect to the way I like it!  The colors and clarity on this shot is wonderful but the presentation throws me a bit.  Guess I''m used to seeing eggs and bacon on a plate with toast but then that''s been done to death so your original presentation will earn you points.  The smudge on the bowl to the left is just a bit distracting, and the tablecloth is pretty but again, distracting.  I give you a 7 today.</td>', 'I love eggs in the morning and that bacon looks just about perfect to the way I like it!  The colors and clarity on this shot is wonderful but the presentation throws me a bit.  Guess I''m used to seeing eggs and bacon on a plate with toast but then that''s been done to death so your original presentation will earn you points.  The smudge on the bowl to the left is just a bit distracting, and the tablecloth is pretty but again, distracting.  I give you a 7 today.', '2003-10-17 14:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(453890, 42199, 12448, '<td valign="top">Maple?  It looks like blueberries to me with strawberry or cherry syrup, is my color that far off?  I do like the presentaion on this one, the cropping is perfect and the syrup running down makes me want to reach out with my finger and stop it!  Bet this was fun eating afterwards!  A tad more sharpness on the subject itself (the left side is blurring out) and no border or a darker border so the top doesn''t just disappear would have raised your score a couple more points.  I start with a 7 on this one.</td>', 'Maple?  It looks like blueberries to me with strawberry or cherry syrup, is my color that far off?  I do like the presentaion on this one, the cropping is perfect and the syrup running down makes me want to reach out with my finger and stop it!  Bet this was fun eating afterwards!  A tad more sharpness on the subject itself (the left side is blurring out) and no border or a darker border so the top doesn''t just disappear would have raised your score a couple more points.  I start with a 7 on this one.', '2003-10-17 14:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(453891, 42427, 12448, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait for the recipe on this one!  Looks like something I can do with my girls.  The cropping on this shot really works well for me, the overall balance of the shot is very good.  It does seem a bit bright and slightly washed out, the light reflecting off the one can is what causes it the most I''m guessing.  I like the reflection of the plates in the toaster oven, they look pretty and add a nice touch for me.  This gets a 7 for now</td>', 'I can''t wait for the recipe on this one!  Looks like something I can do with my girls.  The cropping on this shot really works well for me, the overall balance of the shot is very good.  It does seem a bit bright and slightly washed out, the light reflecting off the one can is what causes it the most I''m guessing.  I like the reflection of the plates in the toaster oven, they look pretty and add a nice touch for me.  This gets a 7 for now', '2003-10-17 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(453892, 42238, 12448, '<td valign="top">hehehe, your title made me think of that old 70''s song and it sure wasn''t about chocolate cake with strawberries, LOL!  You have hit upon two of my favorite foods so that alone earns you extra points, :)  THe shot itself is well done, outside, the green back drop is perfect, the tall glass of milk to help wash it all down, the only thing missing is............................the fork!  How am I supposed to eat this? *sniff*  The light seems a shade off for me, just a bit dark but otherwise a wonderful overall photo. An 8</td>', 'hehehe, your title made me think of that old 70''s song and it sure wasn''t about chocolate cake with strawberries, LOL!  You have hit upon two of my favorite foods so that alone earns you extra points, :)  THe shot itself is well done, outside, the green back drop is perfect, the tall glass of milk to help wash it all down, the only thing missing is............................the fork!  How am I supposed to eat this? *sniff*  The light seems a shade off for me, just a bit dark but otherwise a wonderful overall photo. An 8', '2003-10-17 14:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(453893, 42469, 12448, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm, this looks soooooooooo good!  What time is dinner? :)<br/> <br/>This is a very appetizing photo, it makes me hungry, which is good, the colors are vibrant, clear, crisp and the lighting seems just a hair bright but overall very well done.  The only distraction is the cashews in the upper left corner.  I like the fork peeking into the shot, my utinsil to eat but the cashews throw me off, there are too many of them.  Starting with an 8 on this one.</td>', 'Mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm, this looks soooooooooo good!  What time is dinner? :) This is a very appetizing photo, it makes me hungry, which is good, the colors are vibrant, clear, crisp and the lighting seems just a hair bright but overall very well done.  The only distraction is the cashews in the upper left corner.  I like the fork peeking into the shot, my utinsil to eat but the cashews throw me off, there are too many of them.  Starting with an 8 on this one.', '2003-10-17 14:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(453894, 42431, 12448, '<td valign="top">I scored this an 8 and will be leaving it there for now and I''ll tell you why.  This is a perfect shot with two little details that made me say,"Where''s the cheese?"  If I look super close I an just see the bubble of the warmed cheese right over the bottom edge of the fondue pot, a different angle would have helped with this.  Also, the the piece on the fork had cheese on it, sitting on a small plate would have gotten you a 10 on this.</td>', 'I scored this an 8 and will be leaving it there for now and I''ll tell you why.  This is a perfect shot with two little details that made me say,"Where''s the cheese?"  If I look super close I an just see the bubble of the warmed cheese right over the bottom edge of the fondue pot, a different angle would have helped with this.  Also, the the piece on the fork had cheese on it, sitting on a small plate would have gotten you a 10 on this.', '2003-10-17 14:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(453917, 41981, 10643, '<td valign="top">great shot, the garnish and the spare asian feel of the composition are very striking</td>', 'great shot, the garnish and the spare asian feel of the composition are very striking', '2003-10-17 15:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(453918, 42411, 10643, '<td valign="top">outstanding! even the look on his face is good. excellent focus and the garnish makes him look like a boiled crawfish in his natural habitat. or something :)</td>', 'outstanding! even the look on his face is good. excellent focus and the garnish makes him look like a boiled crawfish in his natural habitat. or something :)', '2003-10-17 15:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(453919, 42335, 10643, '<td valign="top">gorgeous, my favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'gorgeous, my favorite in the challenge.', '2003-10-17 15:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(453921, 41995, 9452, '<td valign="top">I can´t wait to see the receip, looks yummy, by the way, the best shot of the contest by far. 10</td>', 'I can´t wait to see the receip, looks yummy, by the way, the best shot of the contest by far. 10', '2003-10-17 15:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(453930, 42062, 6597, '<td valign="top">good color</td>', 'good color', '2003-10-17 15:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(453935, 42100, 6597, '<td valign="top">good arrangment very interesting 7</td>', 'good arrangment very interesting 7', '2003-10-17 15:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(453937, 42427, 6597, '<td valign="top">interesting The cans and the bread have more interest than just the bread alone.<br/> Sue         7</td>', 'interesting The cans and the bread have more interest than just the bread alone. Sue         7', '2003-10-17 15:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(453966, 42462, 10686, '<td valign="top">I really like the warm color palette used here</td>', 'I really like the warm color palette used here', '2003-10-17 16:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(453970, 42429, 10686, '<td valign="top">Makes me want some sushi. The sushi is very attractive. I have 2 suggestions that I think would improve this shot: 1- The window light is quite pleasing, but it needs some fill the ginger, wasabe and the front edge of the sushi seem kind of dark. 2 -  A different plate with more of a Japanese style would help, or even a plain one. For me, the flowers peeking out  from under the sushi distract my eye from the beauty of the dish itself.</td>', 'Makes me want some sushi. The sushi is very attractive. I have 2 suggestions that I think would improve this shot: 1- The window light is quite pleasing, but it needs some fill the ginger, wasabe and the front edge of the sushi seem kind of dark. 2 -  A different plate with more of a Japanese style would help, or even a plain one. For me, the flowers peeking out  from under the sushi distract my eye from the beauty of the dish itself.', '2003-10-17 16:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(453971, 42402, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot !</td>', 'Nice candid shot !', '2003-10-17 16:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(453974, 42465, 10686, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, and I like the dark background to enhance the romantic mood, but I think it may be too dark, The shaft of the fork gets lost and leads my eye to the dark area of the background on the left The sides of the bowl  and support blend to much with the background</td>', 'This is a good idea, and I like the dark background to enhance the romantic mood, but I think it may be too dark, The shaft of the fork gets lost and leads my eye to the dark area of the background on the left The sides of the bowl  and support blend to much with the background', '2003-10-17 16:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(453981, 42469, 10686, '<td valign="top">2 comments and a couple of questions. First this looks very tasty, good job!. My only nitpicking comment is that the sour cream in the middle seems blown out. <br/> <br/>Are those Cashews in the background? and how do they figure into the dish? (This is not affecting my score, I guess I''ll just have to wait for the recipe)</td>', '2 comments and a couple of questions. First this looks very tasty, good job!. My only nitpicking comment is that the sour cream in the middle seems blown out.  Are those Cashews in the background? and how do they figure into the dish? (This is not affecting my score, I guess I''ll just have to wait for the recipe)', '2003-10-17 16:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(453985, 42337, 10686, '<td valign="top">interesting, but the pic seems small here</td>', 'interesting, but the pic seems small here', '2003-10-17 16:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(453988, 42470, 10686, '<td valign="top">You will probably get slammed, but not from me. I like this idea, especially the distorted colors. Reminds me of some dinners at the in-laws.</td>', 'You will probably get slammed, but not from me. I like this idea, especially the distorted colors. Reminds me of some dinners at the in-laws.', '2003-10-17 16:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(453991, 42411, 10686, '<td valign="top">Even though I don\''t really like crawdads, this is the best shot in here so far, 10. Really cookbook cover quality!!</td>', 'Even though I don\''t really like crawdads, this is the best shot in here so far, 10. Really cookbook cover quality!!', '2003-10-17 17:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(454019, 42458, 9550, '<td valign="top">Where''s the Beef? Great Macro shot of this dish. Beautiful colours and texture. I would have not used the white spatula! Maybe would have sprinkled some Kashews on top for good measure. Great Photo.</td>', 'Where''s the Beef? Great Macro shot of this dish. Beautiful colours and texture. I would have not used the white spatula! Maybe would have sprinkled some Kashews on top for good measure. Great Photo.', '2003-10-17 17:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(454026, 42267, 9550, '<td valign="top">My favorite dish. Add a little smoked sausage to it and you have a masterpiece. Maybe a little dash of pepper!  A little blury in the forground. Good luck</td>', 'My favorite dish. Add a little smoked sausage to it and you have a masterpiece. Maybe a little dash of pepper!  A little blury in the forground. Good luck', '2003-10-17 17:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(454036, 41981, 9550, '<td valign="top">I love any type of Asian food!!! This one tops the list for me. I could be an ass and score this really low cosidering my score is so high. But im a good sport. I can tell you spent alot of time on this. As did I on mine. I cant wait to see the recipe. The bright white background really pushes this photo in an almost 3-D image. The Black chop-sticks really set a accent to the photo. Great composition, Great lighting, I really dont see anything wrong with this shot. Good Luck. 10</td>', 'I love any type of Asian food!!! This one tops the list for me. I could be an ass and score this really low cosidering my score is so high. But im a good sport. I can tell you spent alot of time on this. As did I on mine. I cant wait to see the recipe. The bright white background really pushes this photo in an almost 3-D image. The Black chop-sticks really set a accent to the photo. Great composition, Great lighting, I really dont see anything wrong with this shot. Good Luck. 10', '2003-10-17 17:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(454039, 41593, 9550, '<td valign="top">Cant wait to try this with my coffee in the morning! I really like the contrast of the blue background against the white plate. Nice garnish. Great composition, Centerd almost perfect (IF NOT PERFECT) Good Luck.</td>', 'Cant wait to try this with my coffee in the morning! I really like the contrast of the blue background against the white plate. Nice garnish. Great composition, Centerd almost perfect (IF NOT PERFECT) Good Luck.', '2003-10-17 17:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(454078, 42100, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looking through the entries, I found 2 that stood out to be contenders in the top 3 so far.  This is one of them.  I think the lighting is good.  The only spot I see that could have been a tad better, is right at the bottom near the middle.  It gets a little bright right there.  Your focus and clarity are really good, and I like the presentation of the food very well.  There is a poster similar to this in one of our pizzarias and I have always liked it.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Looking through the entries, I found 2 that stood out to be contenders in the top 3 so far.  This is one of them.  I think the lighting is good.  The only spot I see that could have been a tad better, is right at the bottom near the middle.  It gets a little bright right there.  Your focus and clarity are really good, and I like the presentation of the food very well.  There is a poster similar to this in one of our pizzarias and I have always liked it.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2003-10-17 18:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(454080, 41593, 3080, '<td valign="top">Seems very silly to me to have flowers on the breakfast plate, but it does add a bit to look at in the photo.  I think this looks very good.  I like the presentation, and focus and clarity are really good as well.  we get some good detail in the inside of that muffin.  I also like how you added some extra fruit on the plate, but that flower just seems strange to me.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Seems very silly to me to have flowers on the breakfast plate, but it does add a bit to look at in the photo.  I think this looks very good.  I like the presentation, and focus and clarity are really good as well.  we get some good detail in the inside of that muffin.  I also like how you added some extra fruit on the plate, but that flower just seems strange to me.  ~Heather~', '2003-10-17 18:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(454085, 42437, 3080, '<td valign="top">We really don''t get to see much food in this shot at all.  The main focus seems to be the cook, and that''s not really what the challenge was meant to be.  I see some potatos and butter, and some salt, but not really much actual food to look at.  I realize that this does still fit the challenge by being the "during" of preparing the food, but wish that there were a bit more food in the shot.  As for the shot itself, the red tones seem to be jacked up too far.  Her skin is an unnatural color and the overall shot seems to have an orangish red tint.  ~Heather~</td>', 'We really don''t get to see much food in this shot at all.  The main focus seems to be the cook, and that''s not really what the challenge was meant to be.  I see some potatos and butter, and some salt, but not really much actual food to look at.  I realize that this does still fit the challenge by being the "during" of preparing the food, but wish that there were a bit more food in the shot.  As for the shot itself, the red tones seem to be jacked up too far.  Her skin is an unnatural color and the overall shot seems to have an orangish red tint.  ~Heather~', '2003-10-17 18:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(454094, 41995, 3080, '<td valign="top">Too much other clutter.  The hens easily get lost in the wide array of other things in the shot.  I think the food looks good, and the setup was well thought out, but it turns out way too busy for my personal taste.  There are pumpkins, and sunflower patterns, which alone don''t go well together.  Your focus and clarity seem good, and the colors are good too.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Too much other clutter.  The hens easily get lost in the wide array of other things in the shot.  I think the food looks good, and the setup was well thought out, but it turns out way too busy for my personal taste.  There are pumpkins, and sunflower patterns, which alone don''t go well together.  Your focus and clarity seem good, and the colors are good too.  ~Heather~', '2003-10-17 18:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(454096, 42335, 6536, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. Nice composition. I could see this in a starbucks ad. 9.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. Nice composition. I could see this in a starbucks ad. 9.', '2003-10-17 18:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(454099, 41981, 6536, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. My 10 for this contest. The subject really pops out at you. Great composition and lighting. 10.</td>', 'Excellent shot. My 10 for this contest. The subject really pops out at you. Great composition and lighting. 10.', '2003-10-17 18:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(454100, 42402, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately something we can all relate to, I''m sure.  The background bothers me here.  It''s crooked and angled.  Not enough to be dramatic, but rather just looks like you weren''t paying attention to lining up your background, which unfortunately makes it look like more of a snapshot.  Which is ok too.  I have plenty. lol.  I wonder how this would have come out if your angle were just a bit lower.  It looks a little more planned if we get down to the kids level and take the shot straight on.  Focus looks good, and lighting also looks ok.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately something we can all relate to, I''m sure.  The background bothers me here.  It''s crooked and angled.  Not enough to be dramatic, but rather just looks like you weren''t paying attention to lining up your background, which unfortunately makes it look like more of a snapshot.  Which is ok too.  I have plenty. lol.  I wonder how this would have come out if your angle were just a bit lower.  It looks a little more planned if we get down to the kids level and take the shot straight on.  Focus looks good, and lighting also looks ok.  ~Heather~', '2003-10-17 18:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(454101, 42440, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but need a little more lighting to brighten it up. Great angle and composition. Has a nice background. 5.</td>', 'Nice idea, but need a little more lighting to brighten it up. Great angle and composition. Has a nice background. 5.', '2003-10-17 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(454105, 42334, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Good composition, but I think you might want to sharpen the picture in photoshop a little. It''s a little out of focus. I like the color print on the dish. 5.</td>', 'Nice idea. Good composition, but I think you might want to sharpen the picture in photoshop a little. It''s a little out of focus. I like the color print on the dish. 5.', '2003-10-17 18:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(454201, 42195, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty presentation, interesting lighting - an overall nice shot. I especially like the refelction in the table.</td>', 'Very pretty presentation, interesting lighting - an overall nice shot. I especially like the refelction in the table.', '2003-10-17 20:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(454202, 42452, 12733, '<td valign="top">The fries look delicious, the pork chop looks suspicious. Imho showing more of the chop might have made it more appealing - and, again my own taste, I would have used a clean fork.</td>', 'The fries look delicious, the pork chop looks suspicious. Imho showing more of the chop might have made it more appealing - and, again my own taste, I would have used a clean fork.', '2003-10-17 20:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(454203, 42458, 12733, '<td valign="top">Wow, those noodles just jump out at you. Very nice mix of colors and textures, nicely lit and exposed.</td>', 'Wow, those noodles just jump out at you. Very nice mix of colors and textures, nicely lit and exposed.', '2003-10-17 20:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(454205, 41981, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice high-key effect of the spring rolls against the white tray. My sense of improved composition from the spills shifts back and forth with a feeling that they detract from the photo - the way your vision does with an optical illusion.</td>', 'Nice high-key effect of the spring rolls against the white tray. My sense of improved composition from the spills shifts back and forth with a feeling that they detract from the photo - the way your vision does with an optical illusion.', '2003-10-17 20:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(454206, 42470, 12733, '<td valign="top">I hope that''s not the result of the recipe you tried out. The colors are interesting, but too artificial for my taste.</td>', 'I hope that''s not the result of the recipe you tried out. The colors are interesting, but too artificial for my taste.', '2003-10-17 21:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(454207, 42402, 12733, '<td valign="top">She''s cute and obviously enjoying herself, but the background is very distracting.</td>', 'She''s cute and obviously enjoying herself, but the background is very distracting.', '2003-10-17 21:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(454208, 42439, 12733, '<td valign="top">The black lines say hot off the grill, and the red patches say hot on the tongue. Nice effect.</td>', 'The black lines say hot off the grill, and the red patches say hot on the tongue. Nice effect.', '2003-10-17 21:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(454212, 42462, 12733, '<td valign="top">The bread, wine, fruit and flowers make this picture stand out from the many that show the main dish alone. Very nice.</td>', 'The bread, wine, fruit and flowers make this picture stand out from the many that show the main dish alone. Very nice.', '2003-10-17 21:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(454213, 42012, 12733, '<td valign="top">I can almost taste it!</td>', 'I can almost taste it!', '2003-10-17 21:08:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(454215, 42420, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; more than just the food alone. The mousse goes nicely with your dishes.</td>', 'Nice composition; more than just the food alone. The mousse goes nicely with your dishes.', '2003-10-17 21:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(454216, 42144, 12733, '<td valign="top">Make sure the kids don''t grab it first. The lighting and black background make the popcorn stand out really nicely.</td>', 'Make sure the kids don''t grab it first. The lighting and black background make the popcorn stand out really nicely.', '2003-10-17 21:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(454217, 42429, 12733, '<td valign="top">The reflections on the plate create a lovely frame for the well photographed California roll.</td>', 'The reflections on the plate create a lovely frame for the well photographed California roll.', '2003-10-17 21:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(454218, 42384, 12733, '<td valign="top">Looks like it could be kind of tasty to me - but then I love hot food, and baked beans can really be a treat if they''re cooked right (but the pot doesn''t suggest real baking, which they need.) Unfortunately, the table in the background doesn''t strike me as romantic, just out of focus.</td>', 'Looks like it could be kind of tasty to me - but then I love hot food, and baked beans can really be a treat if they''re cooked right (but the pot doesn''t suggest real baking, which they need.) Unfortunately, the table in the background doesn''t strike me as romantic, just out of focus.', '2003-10-17 21:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(454219, 42417, 12733, '<td valign="top">The salad looks yummy, and everything came out clear and sharp. The leaves make a very attractive, if impractical, table cloth. Nice shot.</td>', 'The salad looks yummy, and everything came out clear and sharp. The leaves make a very attractive, if impractical, table cloth. Nice shot.', '2003-10-17 21:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(454220, 41995, 12733, '<td valign="top">A feast indeed, nicely arranged, lit and exposed.</td>', 'A feast indeed, nicely arranged, lit and exposed.', '2003-10-17 21:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(454222, 41593, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture, both in the baking and in the photographing.</td>', 'Beautiful texture, both in the baking and in the photographing.', '2003-10-17 21:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(454223, 42100, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for presentation, nicely photographed.</td>', 'Nice idea for presentation, nicely photographed.', '2003-10-17 21:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(454226, 42381, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute shot of a chipmunk, but imho it''s kind of in bad taste, given the topic. And the hot spot under the grill is really distracting.</td>', 'Cute shot of a chipmunk, but imho it''s kind of in bad taste, given the topic. And the hot spot under the grill is really distracting.', '2003-10-17 21:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(454228, 42074, 12733, '<td valign="top">The rigatoni is beautiful and nicely displayed and shot. The wine should add to the effect, but either through the choice of wine or the lighting, it comes out looking solid and murky rather than transluscent, as wine should be.</td>', 'The rigatoni is beautiful and nicely displayed and shot. The wine should add to the effect, but either through the choice of wine or the lighting, it comes out looking solid and murky rather than transluscent, as wine should be.', '2003-10-17 21:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
