(454624, 42469, 12733, '<td valign="top">pretty display of a delicious looking goulash. The white sauce in the center (sour cream? Yogurt?) is undoubtedly an important ingredient for the dish, but, to my view, it contrasts too sharply with the softer, more muted colors of the rest of the picture.</td>', 'pretty display of a delicious looking goulash. The white sauce in the center (sour cream? Yogurt?) is undoubtedly an important ingredient for the dish, but, to my view, it contrasts too sharply with the softer, more muted colors of the rest of the picture.', '2003-10-18 13:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(454627, 42411, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail in the crawfish face and legs. How can you eat something that is looking at you with such an expression? In my view, the garnish in the background adds to the picture; the garnish in the front should either have been placed to keep it in focus or removed.</td>', 'Beautiful detail in the crawfish face and legs. How can you eat something that is looking at you with such an expression? In my view, the garnish in the background adds to the picture; the garnish in the front should either have been placed to keep it in focus or removed.', '2003-10-18 13:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(454629, 42440, 12733, '<td valign="top">On the one hand, the tilt makes for a more exciting composition. But on the other - and this is the one that seems more important from my view - it makes the viewer a little dizzy, waiting for the dessert to slide off the table. The low-key treatment again makes a nice picture, but is confusing when applied to what should be a cheerful dessert rather than a sinister threat.</td>', 'On the one hand, the tilt makes for a more exciting composition. But on the other - and this is the one that seems more important from my view - it makes the viewer a little dizzy, waiting for the dessert to slide off the table. The low-key treatment again makes a nice picture, but is confusing when applied to what should be a cheerful dessert rather than a sinister threat.', '2003-10-18 13:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
