(454748, 42294, 12809, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Clean ''n simple.  Looks good on black.  The only thing I would have done differently is to flip this 180 degrees so the peas look like they are hanging.  It kind of looks like (to me, anyway) that they are defying gravity. :-)  Like the long crop on this, too.<br/> <br/>Very nice.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Clean ''n simple.  Looks good on black.  The only thing I would have done differently is to flip this 180 degrees so the peas look like they are hanging.  It kind of looks like (to me, anyway) that they are defying gravity. :-)  Like the long crop on this, too. Very nice.', '2003-10-18 17:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(454749, 42100, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like how the fork comes in on an angle.  The little bits of tomato and zuchini (?) really give this some color.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like how the fork comes in on an angle.  The little bits of tomato and zuchini (?) really give this some color.  Nice job.', '2003-10-18 17:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(454752, 42409, 12809, '<td valign="top">The presentation is very nice and I like the split color background.  Unfortunately this looks quite oversharpened...and/or maybe the lighting was too strong?  The shine on the jelly is quite bright.  Other than that, this is very good.</td>', 'The presentation is very nice and I like the split color background.  Unfortunately this looks quite oversharpened...and/or maybe the lighting was too strong?  The shine on the jelly is quite bright.  Other than that, this is very good.', '2003-10-18 18:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(454761, 41990, 6597, '<td valign="top">I like the green background catches my attention 7</td>', 'I like the green background catches my attention 7', '2003-10-18 19:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(454795, 42411, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great closeup of the crawfish. The greens mixed with the red color of the main subject helps to give great interest to the shot. The pictures shows all the textures on the crawfish (bumps and ridges). I like how you positioned the head making the eyes look right at you.</td>', 'Great closeup of the crawfish. The greens mixed with the red color of the main subject helps to give great interest to the shot. The pictures shows all the textures on the crawfish (bumps and ridges). I like how you positioned the head making the eyes look right at you.', '2003-10-18 20:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(454799, 42467, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very vivid red colors. The way you arranged the cheesecakes helps to give more interest to the shot. Love the highlights on the cherries. The tin cup''s beautiful ridges are displayed beautifully against the dark black background.</td>', 'Very vivid red colors. The way you arranged the cheesecakes helps to give more interest to the shot. Love the highlights on the cherries. The tin cup''s beautiful ridges are displayed beautifully against the dark black background.', '2003-10-18 20:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(454800, 42337, 10084, '<td valign="top">Picture is a bit small. More contrast on the shadow would really make this image pop out of the picture. I like the wood grain that you captured.</td>', 'Picture is a bit small. More contrast on the shadow would really make this image pop out of the picture. I like the wood grain that you captured.', '2003-10-18 20:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(454801, 42431, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very bold colors. All the colors in the shot are very strong and helps to add interest to the shot. The red fondue pot is really emphasize by having it surrounded by a black background. The poker going through the piece of bread shows what is going into the pot. Helps to give attention to the foreground.</td>', 'Very bold colors. All the colors in the shot are very strong and helps to add interest to the shot. The red fondue pot is really emphasize by having it surrounded by a black background. The poker going through the piece of bread shows what is going into the pot. Helps to give attention to the foreground.', '2003-10-18 20:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(454808, 42144, 10084, '<td valign="top">The way you have the lighting makes it feels dreamy. The dark background helps to give a feeling that you''re at the theatre. The fabric seems like the kind they use to cover the screen.</td>', 'The way you have the lighting makes it feels dreamy. The dark background helps to give a feeling that you''re at the theatre. The fabric seems like the kind they use to cover the screen.', '2003-10-18 20:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(454819, 42465, 10084, '<td valign="top">The blue fondue pot is too dark for the background. Either using a lighter colored pot or a littler colore backgound would help. The presentation and setup is nice and interesting.</td>', 'The blue fondue pot is too dark for the background. Either using a lighter colored pot or a littler colore backgound would help. The presentation and setup is nice and interesting.', '2003-10-18 21:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(454821, 42100, 12448, '<td valign="top">[b]CHOMP![/b} :)<br/> <br/>This looks delicious and very appetizing.  The colors are wonderful, the light background works very well and the cropping is almost perfect, i would have liked to see the noodles complete.  I give this one a  9</td>', '[b]CHOMP![/b} :) This looks delicious and very appetizing.  The colors are wonderful, the light background works very well and the cropping is almost perfect, i would have liked to see the noodles complete.  I give this one a  9', '2003-10-18 21:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(454822, 42458, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yum, but where is the beef?  I see one tiny little piece under that broccoli.  The lighting seems a tad dark but overall a wonderful shot.  I give you an 8 ;)</td>', 'Yum, but where is the beef?  I see one tiny little piece under that broccoli.  The lighting seems a tad dark but overall a wonderful shot.  I give you an 8 ;)', '2003-10-18 21:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(454823, 42267, 12448, '<td valign="top">One of my favs and this one isn''t from a box is it?  the DOF on this shot is just a bit off with the front so fuzzy and just a bit more red than I would have liked.  I''m giving you an 8, tighter cropping would have earned at least a 9 :)</td>', 'One of my favs and this one isn''t from a box is it?  the DOF on this shot is just a bit off with the front so fuzzy and just a bit more red than I would have liked.  I''m giving you an 8, tighter cropping would have earned at least a 9 :)', '2003-10-18 21:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(454824, 42467, 12448, '<td valign="top">So when is dessert being served?  These look so yummy!  The cropping is well done as is the lighting but the white to black background is a bit distracting, one color or the other would have gotten you a 9 or 10 from me, as is, an 8 :)</td>', 'So when is dessert being served?  These look so yummy!  The cropping is well done as is the lighting but the white to black background is a bit distracting, one color or the other would have gotten you a 9 or 10 from me, as is, an 8 :)', '2003-10-18 21:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(454825, 41593, 12448, '<td valign="top">These lookd delicious!  I can''t wait to see the recipe!  I like the background, the tablecloth is a nice contrast to the plate and ties into the blue in the muffins.  The presentation is very nice and the cropping is also well done.  It looks like the light is coming from behind the shot and I''m thinking it might be a bit better coming from above , bringing the colors of the muffing out more.  A 9 :)</td>', 'These lookd delicious!  I can''t wait to see the recipe!  I like the background, the tablecloth is a nice contrast to the plate and ties into the blue in the muffins.  The presentation is very nice and the cropping is also well done.  It looks like the light is coming from behind the shot and I''m thinking it might be a bit better coming from above , bringing the colors of the muffing out more.  A 9 :)', '2003-10-18 21:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(454826, 42428, 12448, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Classic!  Very classis and I''m thinking you are using a brown egg in this shot so you would get the slightly different hues in the black and whit.  The light coming ind from the right is a bit bright overall but the shot is cropped perfectly.  An 8 from me ;)</td>', 'LOL!  Classic!  Very classis and I''m thinking you are using a brown egg in this shot so you would get the slightly different hues in the black and whit.  The light coming ind from the right is a bit bright overall but the shot is cropped perfectly.  An 8 from me ;)', '2003-10-18 21:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(454827, 42098, 12448, '<td valign="top">This looks like a delicious dish and I''m sure my husband will be happy for a new idea for the pork.  As for the shot, the light is coming off a bit yellowish on my screen.  I like the composition of the shot, though all the green all over the meat is a bit distracting.  The cropping is good, cutting off the plate actually works in this shot but the plate pattern around the edges clashes a bit with the food.  An 8 from me. :)</td>', 'This looks like a delicious dish and I''m sure my husband will be happy for a new idea for the pork.  As for the shot, the light is coming off a bit yellowish on my screen.  I like the composition of the shot, though all the green all over the meat is a bit distracting.  The cropping is good, cutting off the plate actually works in this shot but the plate pattern around the edges clashes a bit with the food.  An 8 from me. :)', '2003-10-18 21:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(454829, 42381, 12448, '<td valign="top">LOL!  This is hilarious!  At least you didn''t take a road kill one and put him on there!  Even though I think I''ll pass on the recipe for this one, I love this shot.  The colors. the cropping, the light.  Pushing the envelope on meeting the challenge so I''m giving you an 8</td>', 'LOL!  This is hilarious!  At least you didn''t take a road kill one and put him on there!  Even though I think I''ll pass on the recipe for this one, I love this shot.  The colors. the cropping, the light.  Pushing the envelope on meeting the challenge so I''m giving you an 8', '2003-10-18 21:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(454832, 42462, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow, how pretty!  You almost don''t want to eat it and ruin the composition of the food! ;)  This looks lovely, the food looks like it ready to jump out at you but the background is a bit distracting.  Possibly if you had gone with a black or even brown one to match the table cover.  An 8 from me.</td>', 'Wow, how pretty!  You almost don''t want to eat it and ruin the composition of the food! ;)  This looks lovely, the food looks like it ready to jump out at you but the background is a bit distracting.  Possibly if you had gone with a black or even brown one to match the table cover.  An 8 from me.', '2003-10-18 22:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(454834, 42433, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love homemade bread.  I used to make it with my grandmother all the time.  I like this shot, the bread, the rolling pin the picture in the back, the vase and flowers all add to the shot.  What hurts it to me is the brown thing in the background, can''t really tell what it is and it fights the bread for attention.  Maybe if you had put a flour cannister or a recipe box?  An 8 from me.</td>', 'I love homemade bread.  I used to make it with my grandmother all the time.  I like this shot, the bread, the rolling pin the picture in the back, the vase and flowers all add to the shot.  What hurts it to me is the brown thing in the background, can''t really tell what it is and it fights the bread for attention.  Maybe if you had put a flour cannister or a recipe box?  An 8 from me.', '2003-10-18 22:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(454836, 41984, 12448, '<td valign="top">This will be one I come back to find out the recipe, I love this stuff!  :)  As for the shot, too many things going on at once and it pulls away from the main object, the food.  I think the formal setting for the Tex=Mex is a bit much, something much more casual would have really worked with this shot and a bottle of tequila! ;)  The lighting is also a bit off, too bright in the center and to dark on the upper corners.  An 8 overall from me.</td>', 'This will be one I come back to find out the recipe, I love this stuff!  :)  As for the shot, too many things going on at once and it pulls away from the main object, the food.  I think the formal setting for the Tex=Mex is a bit much, something much more casual would have really worked with this shot and a bottle of tequila! ;)  The lighting is also a bit off, too bright in the center and to dark on the upper corners.  An 8 overall from me.', '2003-10-18 22:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(454837, 42447, 12448, '<td valign="top">This looks so yummy!  That glaze is making me hungry! ;)<br/> <br/>The shot seems a bit off balance, like it''s leaning a bit to the left and the overall lighting is a bit harsh, the silver on the fork looks blown out.  The cropping is wonderful and the roses in the back with the angel knick knack  is a very nice touch.  An 8 from me ;)<br/></td>', 'This looks so yummy!  That glaze is making me hungry! ;) The shot seems a bit off balance, like it''s leaning a bit to the left and the overall lighting is a bit harsh, the silver on the fork looks blown out.  The cropping is wonderful and the roses in the back with the angel knick knack  is a very nice touch.  An 8 from me ;)', '2003-10-18 22:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(454839, 41860, 12448, '<td valign="top">Are we drunk yet? :)  This looks like a fun thing to make and the colors of the blackberries is very nice.  The cropping is a bit off to me, maybe if you had included the entire top and teh border is a bit distracting on this shot.    A 7 for now but I will be back.</td>', 'Are we drunk yet? :)  This looks like a fun thing to make and the colors of the blackberries is very nice.  The cropping is a bit off to me, maybe if you had included the entire top and teh border is a bit distracting on this shot.    A 7 for now but I will be back.', '2003-10-18 22:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(454841, 42419, 12448, '<td valign="top">This looks so good!  Take away the tomatoes and I''m eating at your house! :)  This is a good shot overall.  The finished product with the raw ingredients around it.  The clarity, the colors are wonderful and at first I started this at an 8 but am going to a 9 but I''ll be back :)</td>', 'This looks so good!  Take away the tomatoes and I''m eating at your house! :)  This is a good shot overall.  The finished product with the raw ingredients around it.  The clarity, the colors are wonderful and at first I started this at an 8 but am going to a 9 but I''ll be back :)', '2003-10-18 22:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(454842, 42195, 12448, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this shot is wonderful, well balanced and no glares.  The reflections in the glasses is subtle and very pleasing to the eye.  I keep thinking if that third glass was in focus it would be close to perfect but then it reminds me of the "third" party butting in type thing too, just on the fringes ready to ruin the mood per say.  I think if had brought the camera up just a bit and gotten more of what was in the top of the glasses this would be a perfect shot.  An 8 to start with.</td>', 'The lighting on this shot is wonderful, well balanced and no glares.  The reflections in the glasses is subtle and very pleasing to the eye.  I keep thinking if that third glass was in focus it would be close to perfect but then it reminds me of the "third" party butting in type thing too, just on the fringes ready to ruin the mood per say.  I think if had brought the camera up just a bit and gotten more of what was in the top of the glasses this would be a perfect shot.  An 8 to start with.', '2003-10-18 22:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(454844, 42452, 12448, '<td valign="top">Looks very yummy.  But the cropping leaves me wanting on this shot.  There is too much space between the plates and tehe dirty fork, though indicting that a bit has been taken is really distracting in the end.  The colors are wonderful, the lighting is nice and bright showing off your subjects so an 8 for this one.</td>', 'Looks very yummy.  But the cropping leaves me wanting on this shot.  There is too much space between the plates and tehe dirty fork, though indicting that a bit has been taken is really distracting in the end.  The colors are wonderful, the lighting is nice and bright showing off your subjects so an 8 for this one.', '2003-10-18 22:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(454866, 42195, 3981, '<td valign="top">Presentation and lighting are great. My only constructive criticism would be that the image needs to be sharper.</td>', 'Presentation and lighting are great. My only constructive criticism would be that the image needs to be sharper.', '2003-10-19 00:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(454867, 42392, 3981, '<td valign="top">Very nice presentation.  Lighting is a little harsh in the lower right corner and those images there are somewhat out of focus. Good effort and meets the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice presentation.  Lighting is a little harsh in the lower right corner and those images there are somewhat out of focus. Good effort and meets the challenge.', '2003-10-19 00:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
