(454988, 42467, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Excellent contrast too.  Well done - my top shot of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Excellent contrast too.  Well done - my top shot of the challenge.', '2003-10-19 08:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(454989, 41523, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice use of thirds.  Nice DOF.  I like the colourisation, nice editing.  Not many people chose drinks, so this certainly stands out well.</td>', 'Nice use of thirds.  Nice DOF.  I like the colourisation, nice editing.  Not many people chose drinks, so this certainly stands out well.', '2003-10-19 08:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(454990, 42411, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and DOF.  Excellent contrast too.  I''m not normally keen on food that looks back at me, but this is an excellent shot.</td>', 'Nice composition and DOF.  Excellent contrast too.  I''m not normally keen on food that looks back at me, but this is an excellent shot.', '2003-10-19 08:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(454991, 42428, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Good use of lighting.  Excellent contrast too.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Good use of lighting.  Excellent contrast too.  Good luck.', '2003-10-19 08:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(454992, 41995, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting.  Could you fit any more food in the frame?? :-)  8</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting.  Could you fit any more food in the frame?? :-)  8', '2003-10-19 08:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(455009, 42411, 12759, '<td valign="top">To eat it, or be eaten by it, that is the question. Nice photo.</td>', 'To eat it, or be eaten by it, that is the question. Nice photo.', '2003-10-19 10:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(455015, 41610, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and texture. You can almost feel the juiciness of the oranges.</td>', 'Nice lighting and texture. You can almost feel the juiciness of the oranges.', '2003-10-19 10:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(455017, 42267, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome contrast in colors!  Love the blue against red!  The DOF is quite shallow though making the mac &amp; cheese look not so appetizing!  Also the reflections on the macaroni are distracting!</td>', 'Awesome contrast in colors!  Love the blue against red!  The DOF is quite shallow though making the mac & cheese look not so appetizing!  Also the reflections on the macaroni are distracting!', '2003-10-19 11:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(455018, 42381, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot but in most cultures represented here I do not believe that it actually meets the challenge...  Great focus and use of DOF</td>', 'This is a neat shot but in most cultures represented here I do not believe that it actually meets the challenge...  Great focus and use of DOF', '2003-10-19 11:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(455020, 42439, 9906, '<td valign="top">Pretty good focus here.  Nice textures too.  However as a photo it''s not to appetizing.  I would pull back on the crop a little.  I would like to see the cooking process in a shot like this. As Emerill would say, "you need to call your cable operator and request that smell-o-vision" ;-)</td>', 'Pretty good focus here.  Nice textures too.  However as a photo it''s not to appetizing.  I would pull back on the crop a little.  I would like to see the cooking process in a shot like this. As Emerill would say, "you need to call your cable operator and request that smell-o-vision" ;-)', '2003-10-19 11:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(455038, 42022, 8760, '<td valign="top">This is one of the easiest recipe i''ve seen... Just an....apple ! Lazy you !!</td>', 'This is one of the easiest recipe i''ve seen... Just an....apple ! Lazy you !!', '2003-10-19 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(455039, 42384, 12448, '<td valign="top">Especially with those flames from the candles! ;)  This is a very cute shot and idea.  The DOF is wonderful and the clarity in the front is again, wonderful.  The cropping is a bit tight in the front, and the border is okay but would have worked better if the thick black wasn''t on the outside.  An 8 :)</td>', 'Especially with those flames from the candles! ;)  This is a very cute shot and idea.  The DOF is wonderful and the clarity in the front is again, wonderful.  The cropping is a bit tight in the front, and the border is okay but would have worked better if the thick black wasn''t on the outside.  An 8 :)', '2003-10-19 11:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(455041, 42231, 8760, '<td valign="top">I''ve never eaten this, but it sounds really good. Like a mix of italian and french cuisine... And the pic is very nice too. It''s a good idea to show the hands which are making it ! Good job</td>', 'I''ve never eaten this, but it sounds really good. Like a mix of italian and french cuisine... And the pic is very nice too. It''s a good idea to show the hands which are making it ! Good job', '2003-10-19 11:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(455043, 42433, 8760, '<td valign="top">The back of the scene is a bit too blurry for me...</td>', 'The back of the scene is a bit too blurry for me...', '2003-10-19 11:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(455045, 42294, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful idea the black background is a very nice touch.  But the peas look a little dark, the light reflecting off the actual peas is a nice touch.  A 7 for now but I''ll be back :)</td>', 'This is a wonderful idea the black background is a very nice touch.  But the peas look a little dark, the light reflecting off the actual peas is a nice touch.  A 7 for now but I''ll be back :)', '2003-10-19 11:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(455046, 42402, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge!  I love how she is trying to put the spatula in her mouth up &amp; down instead of sideways.  Nice choice to go B/W The focus seems a little soft though.  Did you do this on purpose?  The DOF should be (IMHO) a little tighter or the cropping.  The stuff in the background and to her right is very distracting.  You took this at work didn''t you.  Where do you cook?<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge!  I love how she is trying to put the spatula in her mouth up & down instead of sideways.  Nice choice to go B/W The focus seems a little soft though.  Did you do this on purpose?  The DOF should be (IMHO) a little tighter or the cropping.  The stuff in the background and to her right is very distracting.  You took this at work didn''t you.  Where do you cook?TC', '2003-10-19 11:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(455050, 42431, 8760, '<td valign="top">I bet this is a swiss photographer ! Very nice , clean and sharp picture</td>', 'I bet this is a swiss photographer ! Very nice , clean and sharp picture', '2003-10-19 11:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(455054, 41981, 8760, '<td valign="top">The best of the challenge ! Ready for a ribbon ? 10</td>', 'The best of the challenge ! Ready for a ribbon ? 10', '2003-10-19 11:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(455057, 42384, 8760, '<td valign="top">...very funny and a nice picture... meets the challenge overall ! 9</td>', '...very funny and a nice picture... meets the challenge overall ! 9', '2003-10-19 11:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(455060, 42370, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yum This looks delicious and I can''t wait to see the recipe!  The variety of colors in this shot is very appealing and the presentation is excellent.  The lighting is just a tad dark on the top to me and the picture ends up losing impact on the upper part.  An 8 to start but I will be back :)</td>', 'Yum This looks delicious and I can''t wait to see the recipe!  The variety of colors in this shot is very appealing and the presentation is excellent.  The lighting is just a tad dark on the top to me and the picture ends up losing impact on the upper part.  An 8 to start but I will be back :)', '2003-10-19 11:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(455062, 42428, 8760, '<td valign="top">Quality of the pic : 10...challenge : 1 (it''s not a recipe !!)...total : 6</td>', 'Quality of the pic : 10...challenge : 1 (it''s not a recipe !!)...total : 6', '2003-10-19 12:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(455063, 42074, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Looks yummy!  :)  The presentation of the food is perfect, the colors are a bit muted and the wine glass almost gets lost on the background but that adds to the shot for me since it look like the wine is almost floating!  Two forks is a bit distracting, the one getting cut off at the top draws you out of the shot.  An 8 to start but I''ll be back :)</td>', 'Very nice.  Looks yummy!  :)  The presentation of the food is perfect, the colors are a bit muted and the wine glass almost gets lost on the background but that adds to the shot for me since it look like the wine is almost floating!  Two forks is a bit distracting, the one getting cut off at the top draws you out of the shot.  An 8 to start but I''ll be back :)', '2003-10-19 12:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(455067, 42441, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wherer''s the pasta?  :)  This looks very yummy, I love tuna!  But the angle of the shot takes away from it.  I keep thinking the tuna is going to slide out of the shot.  The lighting and DOF are wonderful, an 8 to start.</td>', 'Wherer''s the pasta?  :)  This looks very yummy, I love tuna!  But the angle of the shot takes away from it.  I keep thinking the tuna is going to slide out of the shot.  The lighting and DOF are wonderful, an 8 to start.', '2003-10-19 12:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(455068, 42028, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yummmmmmmy!  Gimme! ;)  This is a good overall shot, the round cup, the square plate the lighting is well done.  The table cloth is a bit distracting but not too much.  An 8 to start but I''ll be back.</td>', 'Yummmmmmmy!  Gimme! ;)  This is a good overall shot, the round cup, the square plate the lighting is well done.  The table cloth is a bit distracting but not too much.  An 8 to start but I''ll be back.', '2003-10-19 12:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(455069, 42465, 12448, '<td valign="top">Chocolate and Strawberries!  YUM!!! ;)  But this shot leaves me wanting more, if one of the strawberries had been dipped already and the background blends too mcuh with the pot for the fondue.  The chocolate spread all over the plate is also a bit distracting.   A 7 to start</td>', 'Chocolate and Strawberries!  YUM!!! ;)  But this shot leaves me wanting more, if one of the strawberries had been dipped already and the background blends too mcuh with the pot for the fondue.  The chocolate spread all over the plate is also a bit distracting.   A 7 to start', '2003-10-19 12:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(455070, 42420, 12448, '<td valign="top">The composition of this shot is wonderful, the cropping is also well doen and the setting is close to perfect.  But the lighting, the colors seems off a bit, also what is that being reflected in the spoon? :)  A 7 to start</td>', 'The composition of this shot is wonderful, the cropping is also well doen and the setting is close to perfect.  But the lighting, the colors seems off a bit, also what is that being reflected in the spoon? :)  A 7 to start', '2003-10-19 12:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(455072, 42437, 12448, '<td valign="top">When is dinner? ;)  A nice shot, good compostion overall, well balanced and good cropping.  The clarity is lacking a bit and the lighting seems a bit harsh.  Her concentration on her task is a good study of human nature. :)  A 7 to start</td>', 'When is dinner? ;)  A nice shot, good compostion overall, well balanced and good cropping.  The clarity is lacking a bit and the lighting seems a bit harsh.  Her concentration on her task is a good study of human nature. :)  A 7 to start', '2003-10-19 12:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(455073, 41523, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot really threw me at first, the upside right glass, the upside down bottle til it dawned on me that it was a mirror image of the bottle, duh! ;)  Very nice!  I like the cropping on this one but the angle throws me a bit.  I had started this one at a 7 but am bumping it up to a n 8 for the color, the unique approach and the overall shot ;)</td>', 'This shot really threw me at first, the upside right glass, the upside down bottle til it dawned on me that it was a mirror image of the bottle, duh! ;)  Very nice!  I like the cropping on this one but the angle throws me a bit.  I had started this one at a 7 but am bumping it up to a n 8 for the color, the unique approach and the overall shot ;)', '2003-10-19 12:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(455074, 42472, 12448, '<td valign="top">No flour?  No Milk?  If it really is that easy I''ll be making them!  :  This is a very good shot overall, the cropping, the set up is welld one.  The lighting seems to come from a natural source but the egg seems so dark and lost.  I had started at a 7 but am bumping up to an 8</td>', 'No flour?  No Milk?  If it really is that easy I''ll be making them!  :  This is a very good shot overall, the cropping, the set up is welld one.  The lighting seems to come from a natural source but the egg seems so dark and lost.  I had started at a 7 but am bumping up to an 8', '2003-10-19 12:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(455075, 42178, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m not really big on the psychedelic colors in this example.  I can''t really tell if the focus is good or not.  It does look a little blown out on the top, center to left, part of image.</td>', 'I''m not really big on the psychedelic colors in this example.  I can''t really tell if the focus is good or not.  It does look a little blown out on the top, center to left, part of image.', '2003-10-19 12:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(455077, 41990, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice use of contrasting colors here.  Also really like the shadows.  Focus is dead on on the four o''clock egg.  The DOF is too tight though.  This makes the rest of the image a little hard to look at.</td>', 'Nice use of contrasting colors here.  Also really like the shadows.  Focus is dead on on the four o''clock egg.  The DOF is too tight though.  This makes the rest of the image a little hard to look at.', '2003-10-19 12:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(455125, 42028, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent Presentation</td>', 'Excellent Presentation', '2003-10-19 14:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(455126, 42199, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent Presentation, and great contrast of colors.  Good job!</td>', 'Excellent Presentation, and great contrast of colors.  Good job!', '2003-10-19 14:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(455127, 41523, 7487, '<td valign="top">Great Presentation!</td>', 'Great Presentation!', '2003-10-19 14:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(455129, 42098, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice light and colors. Well done photo.</td>', 'Very nice light and colors. Well done photo.', '2003-10-19 14:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(455130, 42420, 7487, '<td valign="top">Great creativity in the presentation!</td>', 'Great creativity in the presentation!', '2003-10-19 14:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(455131, 42462, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2003-10-19 14:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(455132, 42429, 7487, '<td valign="top">Good Presentation!</td>', 'Good Presentation!', '2003-10-19 14:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(455133, 42458, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice color and light. I like the shallow focus, but know many will not. Good work.</td>', 'Nice color and light. I like the shallow focus, but know many will not. Good work.', '2003-10-19 14:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(455134, 41995, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent, excellent presentation!  What a great array of colors to set it off!!!!  Great job!!!!</td>', 'Excellent, excellent presentation!  What a great array of colors to set it off!!!!  Great job!!!!', '2003-10-19 14:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(455135, 42381, 7487, '<td valign="top">&lt;smiling&gt;  Very creative!!!!  Good job!</td>', '<smiling>  Very creative!!!!  Good job!', '2003-10-19 14:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(455136, 41593, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent Presentation!</td>', 'Excellent Presentation!', '2003-10-19 14:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(455137, 42467, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2003-10-19 14:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(455138, 42433, 7487, '<td valign="top">Very good pic!  Crisp forefront, excellent background to set it off!  Good job!</td>', 'Very good pic!  Crisp forefront, excellent background to set it off!  Good job!', '2003-10-19 14:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(455139, 42100, 327, '<td valign="top">fix me a big bowl!! Looks great, nice color and wonderful composition and light.</td>', 'fix me a big bowl!! Looks great, nice color and wonderful composition and light.', '2003-10-19 14:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(455140, 41981, 7487, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  Great pic.  Only one thing that I found distracting.  The platter seemed endless against the background.  <br/>Great picture though!!!</td>', 'Great colors!  Great pic.  Only one thing that I found distracting.  The platter seemed endless against the background.  Great picture though!!!', '2003-10-19 14:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(455142, 42100, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent!!!  Made me hungry!</td>', 'Excellent!!!  Made me hungry!', '2003-10-19 14:22:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(455146, 42409, 8911, '<td valign="top">Okay, I just ate and here you are making me hungry.... The one thing I would suggest is that a softer light source would have helped - there''s a lot of reflections/glare, and it looks a bit splotchy (probably because of the shapes that are catching the light). The presentation as you set it up is so pretty.... (Now, for voting to finish so I can see the recipe!)</td>', 'Okay, I just ate and here you are making me hungry.... The one thing I would suggest is that a softer light source would have helped - there''s a lot of reflections/glare, and it looks a bit splotchy (probably because of the shapes that are catching the light). The presentation as you set it up is so pretty.... (Now, for voting to finish so I can see the recipe!)', '2003-10-19 14:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(455163, 42231, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely setup; I wish it had been cropped a bit more tightly vertically, as I find the shape beyond the edge of the counter very distracting - my eyes come back to it as least as often as your main subjects, despite the way the color tends to encourage me to look at them. I''m looking forward to seeing the recipe; it certainly makes an attractive dish, from what we can see here!</td>', 'This is a lovely setup; I wish it had been cropped a bit more tightly vertically, as I find the shape beyond the edge of the counter very distracting - my eyes come back to it as least as often as your main subjects, despite the way the color tends to encourage me to look at them. I''m looking forward to seeing the recipe; it certainly makes an attractive dish, from what we can see here!', '2003-10-19 15:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(455165, 42465, 8911, '<td valign="top">I really like the choice to put this against a black background - and nice control on the lighting (fill flash, yes?) to make sure everything is visible. I like the way the colors (especially the bright red of the strawberries) stand out, as well.</td>', 'I really like the choice to put this against a black background - and nice control on the lighting (fill flash, yes?) to make sure everything is visible. I like the way the colors (especially the bright red of the strawberries) stand out, as well.', '2003-10-19 15:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(455174, 41593, 10858, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite photos on this challenge! Nice harmony of colours and beautiful composition! I would give 10 if I could vote!</td>', 'One of my favourite photos on this challenge! Nice harmony of colours and beautiful composition! I would give 10 if I could vote!', '2003-10-19 15:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(455175, 42195, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the composition! I would give 10 if I were a member and could vote as well.</td>', 'I love the lighting and the composition! I would give 10 if I were a member and could vote as well.', '2003-10-19 15:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(455178, 42433, 10858, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. The photo and the lavender really gives a nice traditional feeling. I sense much creativeness in this photot. Shame I cannot vote. I would give 10!</td>', 'Lovely composition. The photo and the lavender really gives a nice traditional feeling. I sense much creativeness in this photot. Shame I cannot vote. I would give 10!', '2003-10-19 16:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(455179, 42428, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but maybe a bit too light and simple for me.</td>', 'I like the idea, but maybe a bit too light and simple for me.', '2003-10-19 16:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(455180, 41771, 10858, '<td valign="top">Cheering one. :-)</td>', 'Cheering one. :-)', '2003-10-19 16:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(455182, 42469, 10858, '<td valign="top">Lovely one! Althought I would have taken the fork in photo with its whole wideness - and bit more of the the red pepper too -, and I don''t really know what do the nuts in the back do with goulash. But... but I think I go upstairs and make this one for dinner! :) Would give 9 if I could vote.</td>', 'Lovely one! Althought I would have taken the fork in photo with its whole wideness - and bit more of the the red pepper too -, and I don''t really know what do the nuts in the back do with goulash. But... but I think I go upstairs and make this one for dinner! :) Would give 9 if I could vote.', '2003-10-19 16:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(455183, 41860, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the colours, good work! I am waiting impatiently the recipe. :-)</td>', 'I love the colours, good work! I am waiting impatiently the recipe. :-)', '2003-10-19 16:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(455213, 42417, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like how you used the leaves for a background.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like how you used the leaves for a background.  Good job.', '2003-10-19 16:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(455216, 41610, 12809, '<td valign="top">Good mix of colors.  Everything is nice ''n bright and sharp.  Nice job.</td>', 'Good mix of colors.  Everything is nice ''n bright and sharp.  Nice job.', '2003-10-19 16:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(455218, 42370, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great presentation, lots of details, good color, and sharp image.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very nice.  Great presentation, lots of details, good color, and sharp image.  Nice job.', '2003-10-19 17:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(455219, 42428, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean, simple.  Looks nice in b&amp;w.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice, clean, simple.  Looks nice in b&w.  Good job.', '2003-10-19 17:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(455220, 42199, 12809, '<td valign="top">Looks very yummy!  I like the crop and the colors are good.  I wish the front weren''t so out of focus - the right side of the dessert is nice ''n sharp, but not the front.<br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'Looks very yummy!  I like the crop and the colors are good.  I wish the front weren''t so out of focus - the right side of the dessert is nice ''n sharp, but not the front. Good job.', '2003-10-19 17:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(455221, 42469, 12809, '<td valign="top">Mmmm, recipe please! :-)  Can''t wait to see this one.<br/> <br/>Nice presentation.  I like how you''ve included the nuts and pepper in the background.</td>', 'Mmmm, recipe please! :-)  Can''t wait to see this one. Nice presentation.  I like how you''ve included the nuts and pepper in the background.', '2003-10-19 17:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(455222, 42447, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good color on the strawberries.  Nice attention to details; the figurine, English tea cup, sprinkles, etc.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good color on the strawberries.  Nice attention to details; the figurine, English tea cup, sprinkles, etc.', '2003-10-19 17:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(455223, 41771, 12809, '<td valign="top">Even these are making me hungry.  :-D  That''s one lucky pooch.<br/> <br/>Nice macro, good ''n sharp.</td>', 'Even these are making me hungry.  :-D  That''s one lucky pooch. Nice macro, good ''n sharp.', '2003-10-19 17:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(455224, 42462, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here.. the food looks appealing :)  I feel that the plate is a bit ''cramped'' in the frame... maybe a little more breathing room on the left and right woudl be nice :)</td>', 'Nice composition here.. the food looks appealing :)  I feel that the plate is a bit ''cramped'' in the frame... maybe a little more breathing room on the left and right woudl be nice :)', '2003-10-19 17:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(455225, 42337, 772, '<td valign="top">This image is too small to give proper feedback.  The lighting also appears to be a bit weak and the tonal range rather flat as well.</td>', 'This image is too small to give proper feedback.  The lighting also appears to be a bit weak and the tonal range rather flat as well.', '2003-10-19 17:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(455226, 41984, 772, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is not very flattering.  Must be an on cam flash.. the shadows are not very visible but they are harsh.</td>', 'The lighting here is not very flattering.  Must be an on cam flash.. the shadows are not very visible but they are harsh.', '2003-10-19 17:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(455227, 42440, 772, '<td valign="top">Not enough light...</td>', 'Not enough light...', '2003-10-19 17:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(455228, 42428, 4090, '<td valign="top">one of the top 3 i think ...... 10/10 love it</td>', 'one of the top 3 i think ...... 10/10 love it', '2003-10-19 17:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(455230, 42441, 4090, '<td valign="top">cool good lighting, nice angle 10/10</td>', 'cool good lighting, nice angle 10/10', '2003-10-19 17:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(455231, 42028, 4090, '<td valign="top">9/10 if it had a white backgroung it would be a ten IMHO</td>', '9/10 if it had a white backgroung it would be a ten IMHO', '2003-10-19 17:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(455232, 41981, 4090, '<td valign="top">how cool is this ..... 10/10 love the colours</td>', 'how cool is this ..... 10/10 love the colours', '2003-10-19 17:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(455252, 42470, 772, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like something I would want to eat :)</td>', 'Doesn''t look like something I would want to eat :)', '2003-10-19 18:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
