(456546, 42238, 9387, '<td valign="top">This looks really great except for the milk in the background.  That looks really washed out.  You might have wanted it that way but it seems that the white of the plate and the milk are really not very clear at all.</td>', 'This looks really great except for the milk in the background.  That looks really washed out.  You might have wanted it that way but it seems that the white of the plate and the milk are really not very clear at all.', '2003-10-21 01:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(456547, 41995, 9387, '<td valign="top">I commend your idea but it seems a little too busy for me.</td>', 'I commend your idea but it seems a little too busy for me.', '2003-10-21 01:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(456548, 41508, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like this --simple, good composition and you can actually tell the milk is milk.</td>', 'I like this --simple, good composition and you can actually tell the milk is milk.', '2003-10-21 01:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(456549, 42334, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I think the composition of this photo is good I find that the choice of dish with the meal does not fit together well.  The picture could also be a bit brighter.  Looks good though.</td>', 'While I think the composition of this photo is good I find that the choice of dish with the meal does not fit together well.  The picture could also be a bit brighter.  Looks good though.', '2003-10-21 01:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(456550, 42417, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like the color combination and the bowl but I wish you would have gotten a little closer.</td>', 'I like the color combination and the bowl but I wish you would have gotten a little closer.', '2003-10-21 01:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(456551, 42231, 9387, '<td valign="top">Can I have the recipe for that.  Looks great and my favorite cheese.   Good composition, but the spots on the tomatoes take away from the picture.  I think also that a different color for the counter (I know you can''t change it) would have helped.  Maybe put something down so it was a little lighter background.  I do like the picture though.</td>', 'Can I have the recipe for that.  Looks great and my favorite cheese.   Good composition, but the spots on the tomatoes take away from the picture.  I think also that a different color for the counter (I know you can''t change it) would have helped.  Maybe put something down so it was a little lighter background.  I do like the picture though.', '2003-10-21 01:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(456552, 41593, 9387, '<td valign="top">Great.  LIke the composition on the plate and the clarity of the subject.  Looks like I could reach out and eat it now.</td>', 'Great.  LIke the composition on the plate and the clarity of the subject.  Looks like I could reach out and eat it now.', '2003-10-21 01:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(456554, 42467, 9387, '<td valign="top">While the idea is great I think I would have given you a higher score had the flash not been reflected in all the cherries.  It is a little disturbing besides losing the clarity of the picture.</td>', 'While the idea is great I think I would have given you a higher score had the flash not been reflected in all the cherries.  It is a little disturbing besides losing the clarity of the picture.', '2003-10-21 01:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(456555, 42074, 9387, '<td valign="top">This is very good.  I like the composition, the colors, the added glass of wine and the green scallions on top.  My only complaint (and it is minor) is the reflection in the top of the utensils.  Otherwise wonderful photo.</td>', 'This is very good.  I like the composition, the colors, the added glass of wine and the green scallions on top.  My only complaint (and it is minor) is the reflection in the top of the utensils.  Otherwise wonderful photo.', '2003-10-21 01:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(456559, 42238, 12902, '<td valign="top">Great picture... Excellent choice!</td>', 'Great picture... Excellent choice!', '2003-10-21 02:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(456560, 42411, 12902, '<td valign="top">I think this one is one of the best. Maybe "The best". I just love it.</td>', 'I think this one is one of the best. Maybe "The best". I just love it.', '2003-10-21 02:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(456561, 42447, 12902, '<td valign="top">Great picture, yammy looking cake.</td>', 'Great picture, yammy looking cake.', '2003-10-21 02:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(456563, 42465, 12902, '<td valign="top">I will be checking to see if this one was rewarded with the blue ribbon or with any of the next two. It is closer to the blue from what I think.</td>', 'I will be checking to see if this one was rewarded with the blue ribbon or with any of the next two. It is closer to the blue from what I think.', '2003-10-21 02:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(456564, 42467, 12902, '<td valign="top">Good picture. Top ten I would say.</td>', 'Good picture. Top ten I would say.', '2003-10-21 02:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(456588, 42411, 13400, '<td valign="top">Fit to be in any restaurant magazine depicting it''s cuisine.  Beautifully done.</td>', 'Fit to be in any restaurant magazine depicting it''s cuisine.  Beautifully done.', '2003-10-21 04:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(456589, 42428, 8682, '<td valign="top">I love this high-key... One of my favourites of this challenge. 10<br/></td>', 'I love this high-key... One of my favourites of this challenge. 10', '2003-10-21 04:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(456590, 41981, 8682, '<td valign="top">No doubt, it´s a great picture. I love the composition and the colours are great, too.<br/>For me, this is the best work of this challenge, so ... 10</td>', 'No doubt, it´s a great picture. I love the composition and the colours are great, too.For me, this is the best work of this challenge, so ... 10', '2003-10-21 04:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(456591, 42431, 8682, '<td valign="top">Yipppi... I love fondue.... I love the composition and the lighting is perfect, too... This is one of my favourites of this challenge... 10<br/></td>', 'Yipppi... I love fondue.... I love the composition and the lighting is perfect, too... This is one of my favourites of this challenge... 10', '2003-10-21 04:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(456592, 42467, 8682, '<td valign="top">Yeah... I love the colour and the composition... Ummm... after see that, I´m hungry... 10</td>', 'Yeah... I love the colour and the composition... Ummm... after see that, I´m hungry... 10', '2003-10-21 04:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(456593, 42462, 8682, '<td valign="top">Congrats!!! It´s a really good work. The composition is perfect, the light is brilliant too... So it´s a brilliant shot, one of my favourites of this challenge... 10<br/></td>', 'Congrats!!! It´s a really good work. The composition is perfect, the light is brilliant too... So it´s a brilliant shot, one of my favourites of this challenge... 10', '2003-10-21 04:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(456594, 42335, 8682, '<td valign="top">Great... Just a brilliant shot!!! I love the composition and the light is pretty good, too...<br/>This is one of the best of this challenge in my opinion... 9</td>', 'Great... Just a brilliant shot!!! I love the composition and the light is pretty good, too...This is one of the best of this challenge in my opinion... 9', '2003-10-21 04:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(456595, 41860, 8682, '<td valign="top">Great!!!! Congrats for a good work!! It´s just a brilliant shot. One of the best of this week... 9<br/></td>', 'Great!!!! Congrats for a good work!! It´s just a brilliant shot. One of the best of this week... 9', '2003-10-21 04:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(456651, 42428, 10773, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fabulous!</td>', 'Absolutely fabulous!', '2003-10-21 09:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(456791, 41981, 656, '<td valign="top">great exposure control, very attractive composition and food styling too.  Good entry.</td>', 'great exposure control, very attractive composition and food styling too.  Good entry.', '2003-10-21 12:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(456792, 42441, 656, '<td valign="top">could easily see this in a magazine.  Very good selective focus and great presentation.  No so sure about the very out of focus bowl in the background - something more like an elegant fork or slim stemed glassware would maybe be more appropriate ?</td>', 'could easily see this in a magazine.  Very good selective focus and great presentation.  No so sure about the very out of focus bowl in the background - something more like an elegant fork or slim stemed glassware would maybe be more appropriate ?', '2003-10-21 12:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(456793, 42411, 656, '<td valign="top">I like the colour contrasts in this - with the green/ blue background - good choice of focus.  Maybe the foreground leaves are distracting and spoil the ''lead in'' but that is minor.</td>', 'I like the colour contrasts in this - with the green/ blue background - good choice of focus.  Maybe the foreground leaves are distracting and spoil the ''lead in'' but that is minor.', '2003-10-21 12:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(456935, 42467, 12733, '<td valign="top">They do look yummy. Nice arrangement and closeup. I think a more diffused light might have avoided the hot spots on the cherries; I find them a little much. On the other hand, the bright light works very well on the metal - so you do have a tough choice there.</td>', 'They do look yummy. Nice arrangement and closeup. I think a more diffused light might have avoided the hot spots on the cherries; I find them a little much. On the other hand, the bright light works very well on the metal - so you do have a tough choice there.', '2003-10-21 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(456978, 42381, 10151, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot...great exposure!</td>', 'Wonderful shot...great exposure!', '2003-10-21 16:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(456981, 42199, 10151, '<td valign="top">Breakfast of Champions!! YUM :)</td>', 'Breakfast of Champions!! YUM :)', '2003-10-21 16:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(456982, 42028, 10151, '<td valign="top">Loving the square plate...great presentation over all! simple and eligant.</td>', 'Loving the square plate...great presentation over all! simple and eligant.', '2003-10-21 16:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(456984, 42427, 10151, '<td valign="top">A sandwich shop in my home town used to make their sandwiches out of these!  Brings back memories!!</td>', 'A sandwich shop in my home town used to make their sandwiches out of these!  Brings back memories!!', '2003-10-21 16:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(456988, 42384, 10151, '<td valign="top">mmmmm...the magical fruit.</td>', 'mmmmm...the magical fruit.', '2003-10-21 16:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(457000, 42428, 13380, '<td valign="top">I love this one - I''m not sure why, i just do.  I think the monocolor look of it - white on white on white - lends the egg kind of a solemn feeling.</td>', 'I love this one - I''m not sure why, i just do.  I think the monocolor look of it - white on white on white - lends the egg kind of a solemn feeling.', '2003-10-21 16:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(457001, 41860, 10151, '<td valign="top">Now that is my kind of dessert!</td>', 'Now that is my kind of dessert!', '2003-10-21 16:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(457004, 42409, 10151, '<td valign="top">Yummy!!  Looks a bit over-exposed by the looks of the whipped cream, but its got my mouth watering!</td>', 'Yummy!!  Looks a bit over-exposed by the looks of the whipped cream, but its got my mouth watering!', '2003-10-21 16:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(457010, 42441, 10151, '<td valign="top">Might have gone with a different angle to get more green in there, otherwise</td>', 'Might have gone with a different angle to get more green in there, otherwise', '2003-10-21 16:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(457068, 42384, 13403, '<td valign="top">hehehe</td>', 'hehehe', '2003-10-21 17:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(457069, 42440, 13403, '<td valign="top">hmm, you should work on the contrast perhaps.. could be my monitor, but this looks like a lot of the same gray</td>', 'hmm, you should work on the contrast perhaps.. could be my monitor, but this looks like a lot of the same gray', '2003-10-21 18:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(457070, 42267, 13403, '<td valign="top">mm... succulent..    more saturation would really do the trick ;)</td>', 'mm... succulent..    more saturation would really do the trick ;)', '2003-10-21 18:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(457113, 41981, 6870, '<td valign="top">This looks good! I like the lighting here, and the composition is scrumptious! 9</td>', 'This looks good! I like the lighting here, and the composition is scrumptious! 9', '2003-10-21 19:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(457140, 42381, 10510, '<td valign="top">I guess my sense of humor is as sick as yours (haha) because I absolutely love this picture and the title.  What a wonderful photo capture of a skittish creature.  My favorite!</td>', 'I guess my sense of humor is as sick as yours (haha) because I absolutely love this picture and the title.  What a wonderful photo capture of a skittish creature.  My favorite!', '2003-10-21 20:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(457142, 42420, 10510, '<td valign="top">Wonderful presentation.  I love the china and silver.</td>', 'Wonderful presentation.  I love the china and silver.', '2003-10-21 20:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(457145, 41981, 10510, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The colors are so crisp on the white plate and I like the way the plate blends with the background.  10</td>', 'Beautiful.  The colors are so crisp on the white plate and I like the way the plate blends with the background.  10', '2003-10-21 20:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(457147, 42411, 10510, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but I would have to leave the table if this were served to me!  I like mine already out of the shell.  9</td>', 'Great photo, but I would have to leave the table if this were served to me!  I like mine already out of the shell.  9', '2003-10-21 20:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(457149, 42419, 10510, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Might have been a bit better without the ingredients surrounding the dish.  Looks yummy, can''t wait to see the recipe.</td>', 'Very nice.  Might have been a bit better without the ingredients surrounding the dish.  Looks yummy, can''t wait to see the recipe.', '2003-10-21 20:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(457152, 42022, 10510, '<td valign="top">I take it that you do not actually cook, haha.  Great photo.</td>', 'I take it that you do not actually cook, haha.  Great photo.', '2003-10-21 20:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(457154, 42462, 10510, '<td valign="top">Lovely presentation and colors.</td>', 'Lovely presentation and colors.', '2003-10-21 20:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(457156, 42439, 10510, '<td valign="top">These look soooo good, but I hope they are not on the same grill that the chipmunk was on!</td>', 'These look soooo good, but I hope they are not on the same grill that the chipmunk was on!', '2003-10-21 20:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(457158, 41593, 10510, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I can''t wait to make these for my husband, he will love them.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I can''t wait to make these for my husband, he will love them.', '2003-10-21 20:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(457393, 42419, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful clarity...very crisp feel to this shot!  Wonderful array of colors, so much texture and detail here...keeps the eyes busy!  Great job!  10+</td>', 'wonderful clarity...very crisp feel to this shot!  Wonderful array of colors, so much texture and detail here...keeps the eyes busy!  Great job!  10+', '2003-10-22 01:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(457404, 41771, 9441, '<td valign="top">wonderful macro and texture detail!  Great job!  10</td>', 'wonderful macro and texture detail!  Great job!  10', '2003-10-22 01:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(457408, 42370, 9441, '<td valign="top">looks great...and very delicious.  Wonderful color clarity, very crisp and sharp....nicely done!</td>', 'looks great...and very delicious.  Wonderful color clarity, very crisp and sharp....nicely done!', '2003-10-22 01:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(457412, 42462, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful warm color hues.  Nice clarity to this photo.....wonderful composition...10</td>', 'Beautiful warm color hues.  Nice clarity to this photo.....wonderful composition...10', '2003-10-22 01:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(457564, 41981, 9685, '<td valign="top">The white background combined with the splash of colour of the food makes you want to eat the photo! Very creative layout, could go into a Recipe Book! Well done!</td>', 'The white background combined with the splash of colour of the food makes you want to eat the photo! Very creative layout, could go into a Recipe Book! Well done!', '2003-10-22 03:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(457565, 42100, 9685, '<td valign="top">White background with colorful food makes this pasta look so an enticing!  Well done!</td>', 'White background with colorful food makes this pasta look so an enticing!  Well done!', '2003-10-22 03:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(457974, 42462, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nicely presented! The extra care you took with garnishing pays off here. I''m sure Nona''s recipe is yummy.  Does that chicken have spinach in it? Overall vg job! 10!</td>', 'Nicely presented! The extra care you took with garnishing pays off here. I''m sure Nona''s recipe is yummy.  Does that chicken have spinach in it? Overall vg job! 10!', '2003-10-22 10:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(457983, 42437, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but the whites are over exposed.  The little peek at the pot isn''t necessary.  A tighter cropwould elimate some of the clutter.  Could be a little better planned out, to make it simpler.<br/>Hope this helps.  <br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Grayce</td>', 'I like the idea here, but the whites are over exposed.  The little peek at the pot isn''t necessary.  A tighter cropwould elimate some of the clutter.  Could be a little better planned out, to make it simpler.Hope this helps.  Regards, Grayce', '2003-10-22 10:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(457984, 42178, 11557, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea</td>', 'Interesting idea', '2003-10-22 10:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(458073, 42452, 2883, '<td valign="top">It''s a good composition. As with filiming food, the coloring is off though.</td>', 'It''s a good composition. As with filiming food, the coloring is off though.', '2003-10-22 11:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(458084, 42429, 2883, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and composition, but there seems to be an overtone of green in the photo.</td>', 'I like the angle and composition, but there seems to be an overtone of green in the photo.', '2003-10-22 11:49:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(458087, 41990, 2883, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would be better if all the eggs were in focus. The shadows are distracting as well.</td>', 'I think this photo would be better if all the eggs were in focus. The shadows are distracting as well.', '2003-10-22 11:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(458089, 42335, 2883, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field and focus. I also like the rich chocolate coloring.</td>', 'Nice depth of field and focus. I also like the rich chocolate coloring.', '2003-10-22 11:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(458095, 42465, 2883, '<td valign="top">The blue pot is lost in the background. A different color backdrop probably would help. Good composition and lighting though.</td>', 'The blue pot is lost in the background. A different color backdrop probably would help. Good composition and lighting though.', '2003-10-22 11:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(458104, 41984, 2883, '<td valign="top">The lighting is dark and the overall photo isn''t very exciting. A diffeent angle would probably help.</td>', 'The lighting is dark and the overall photo isn''t very exciting. A diffeent angle would probably help.', '2003-10-22 12:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(458109, 42294, 2883, '<td valign="top">The shapes in this photo are appealing. The contrast with the background also helps.</td>', 'The shapes in this photo are appealing. The contrast with the background also helps.', '2003-10-22 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(458307, 42462, 6008, '<td valign="top">This has the classic look you''d expect to find in a cookery book or even on a menu of a fancy restaurant. The food also looks good (even though I think it''s chicken). The lighting is good, has a slight warmth to it that''s appealing. The fruit and flora adds a nice dimension too. About the only thing I''m not too keen on is the very tip of the fork on the right. I think it needed to be more in the shot or not there at all. It looks like you took a lot of time and effort to get both the food looking good and the presentation.</td>', 'This has the classic look you''d expect to find in a cookery book or even on a menu of a fancy restaurant. The food also looks good (even though I think it''s chicken). The lighting is good, has a slight warmth to it that''s appealing. The fruit and flora adds a nice dimension too. About the only thing I''m not too keen on is the very tip of the fork on the right. I think it needed to be more in the shot or not there at all. It looks like you took a lot of time and effort to get both the food looking good and the presentation.', '2003-10-22 13:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(458316, 42028, 6008, '<td valign="top">Looks very tasty and very visually appealing. The image is very clear, the detail on the leaves really stand out. The lighting on the lemon cup is also good. The background fabric is a good choice, it offers a nice range of colors without being over the top or too distracting. I''ve seen this use of dof in many cookery books, and I think it works well, however, initially my eyes didnt seem to like the dof on the upper crust of the first bread slice. Very well presented.</td>', 'Looks very tasty and very visually appealing. The image is very clear, the detail on the leaves really stand out. The lighting on the lemon cup is also good. The background fabric is a good choice, it offers a nice range of colors without being over the top or too distracting. I''ve seen this use of dof in many cookery books, and I think it works well, however, initially my eyes didnt seem to like the dof on the upper crust of the first bread slice. Very well presented.', '2003-10-22 13:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(458321, 42411, 6008, '<td valign="top">This doesnt look very appetizing to me personally, but the image is really good. It has a nice bright redness, which really highlights the garnish. The use of dof works well too. The lighting seems spot on also. Not sure i can see much here to improve on.</td>', 'This doesnt look very appetizing to me personally, but the image is really good. It has a nice bright redness, which really highlights the garnish. The use of dof works well too. The lighting seems spot on also. Not sure i can see much here to improve on.', '2003-10-22 13:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(458325, 42012, 6008, '<td valign="top">The presentation is really good here, providing nice warm tones, very fall-like. Having the juices dribble down the sides and into the plate really sets the tastebuds drooling. There doesnt seem to be too much to the dish itself, but it has nice textures and the wonderful caramel-colored juices helps make it very appealing. Compositional is also well done.</td>', 'The presentation is really good here, providing nice warm tones, very fall-like. Having the juices dribble down the sides and into the plate really sets the tastebuds drooling. There doesnt seem to be too much to the dish itself, but it has nice textures and the wonderful caramel-colored juices helps make it very appealing. Compositional is also well done.', '2003-10-22 14:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(458328, 42441, 6008, '<td valign="top">The unusual angle on this makes it stand out a little more. The colors are very neutral, except for the green, and coupled with the white plate/bowl it has a nice minimalist feel. This is certainly something I could expect to see in a cookery book or magazine, or even adorning a restaurant menu. Very nicely prepared and presented.</td>', 'The unusual angle on this makes it stand out a little more. The colors are very neutral, except for the green, and coupled with the white plate/bowl it has a nice minimalist feel. This is certainly something I could expect to see in a cookery book or magazine, or even adorning a restaurant menu. Very nicely prepared and presented.', '2003-10-22 14:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(458334, 41984, 6008, '<td valign="top">The presentation is good, albeit fairly standard, and the dish itself looks quite tasty. I like that the accompanying dishes also seem to match the theme. The only change I could possibly see would be to change the lighting a little more to enhance a mood. This seems to have a very even light.</td>', 'The presentation is good, albeit fairly standard, and the dish itself looks quite tasty. I like that the accompanying dishes also seem to match the theme. The only change I could possibly see would be to change the lighting a little more to enhance a mood. This seems to have a very even light.', '2003-10-22 14:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(458339, 41771, 6008, '<td valign="top">They may be dog biscuits/cookies but they sure look good. The texture is great, the lighting great as I dont see any harsh shadows, the contrasting color tones appealing. I''m also glad you decided to do a close-up of these. I''m certainly interested in reading the recipe when the challenge is finished. Different and well shot, I like it!</td>', 'They may be dog biscuits/cookies but they sure look good. The texture is great, the lighting great as I dont see any harsh shadows, the contrasting color tones appealing. I''m also glad you decided to do a close-up of these. I''m certainly interested in reading the recipe when the challenge is finished. Different and well shot, I like it!', '2003-10-22 14:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(458344, 42335, 6008, '<td valign="top">The composition is great, and I like how you left ''cino'' in. I think the coffee-colored writing really adds something to the image instead of just a plain mug/cup. The use of dof is excellent, the lighting is wonderful, the image has great sharpness where it needs to be. I could without doubt see this in a cookery book, on packaging, advertising, or a number of other places. Very well done.</td>', 'The composition is great, and I like how you left ''cino'' in. I think the coffee-colored writing really adds something to the image instead of just a plain mug/cup. The use of dof is excellent, the lighting is wonderful, the image has great sharpness where it needs to be. I could without doubt see this in a cookery book, on packaging, advertising, or a number of other places. Very well done.', '2003-10-22 14:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(458367, 42440, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. I like the angle you took this picture at. The colors are nice, and the focus is great. Looks yummy! :D<br/> <br/>Neg .. I think the curves need to be adjusted to brigthen it up a little. I''m not fussy on the spoon being there halfway in the frame. <br/> <br/>7</td>', 'Pos .. I like the angle you took this picture at. The colors are nice, and the focus is great. Looks yummy! :D Neg .. I think the curves need to be adjusted to brigthen it up a little. I''m not fussy on the spoon being there halfway in the frame.  7', '2003-10-22 14:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(458375, 42384, 12061, '<td valign="top">LOL too funny .. I have a feeling this night won''t be so romantic after all.. :D<br/> <br/>Pos .. DOF looks nice in this shot. Focus great. Composition good. The table and candles look beautiful.<br/>Neg .. I think this picture would look even better as b&amp;w. <br/> <br/>7<br/></td>', 'LOL too funny .. I have a feeling this night won''t be so romantic after all.. :D Pos .. DOF looks nice in this shot. Focus great. Composition good. The table and candles look beautiful.Neg .. I think this picture would look even better as b&w.  7', '2003-10-22 14:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(458383, 42439, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. Great macro work, it is very focused. <br/>Neg .. the composition could be improved .. for this particular subject, I think its a bit too close up. I would be nice if you could see more of the BBQ, even a night shot where you can see the flames underneath :D <br/></td>', 'Pos .. Great macro work, it is very focused. Neg .. the composition could be improved .. for this particular subject, I think its a bit too close up. I would be nice if you could see more of the BBQ, even a night shot where you can see the flames underneath :D ', '2003-10-22 14:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(458388, 42144, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. I like the colors and background is kind of nice. Nice photo :D<br/>Neg .. Its slightly out of focus, The composition would be better if the whole bowl was in frame, and too bad you couldn''t have a seamless background .. the ripples are distracting.<br/></td>', 'Pos .. I like the colors and background is kind of nice. Nice photo :DNeg .. Its slightly out of focus, The composition would be better if the whole bowl was in frame, and too bad you couldn''t have a seamless background .. the ripples are distracting.', '2003-10-22 14:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(458395, 42465, 12061, '<td valign="top">Pos .. excellent focusing, love the total black background and the candle adds a very nice touch.<br/>Neg .. The knife is a throw off for me .. I think it would be better as well if you show more of the top view. <br/> <br/>8</td>', 'Pos .. excellent focusing, love the total black background and the candle adds a very nice touch.Neg .. The knife is a throw off for me .. I think it would be better as well if you show more of the top view.  8', '2003-10-22 14:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(458403, 42012, 12061, '<td valign="top">YUMMMY!! This desert and photograph both look very tasty!! Its like a shot straight from a magazine! nice work! Only comment - It would be great if the lines in the table cloth straight rather than on an angle :)<br/> <br/>9!</td>', 'YUMMMY!! This desert and photograph both look very tasty!! Its like a shot straight from a magazine! nice work! Only comment - It would be great if the lines in the table cloth straight rather than on an angle :) 9!', '2003-10-22 14:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
