(458555, 41981, 8159, '<td valign="top">Excellent food styling. I like the white plate on white background, but I wish the back edge of the plate was a <i>little</i> more distinct like the other three are. This definitely looks like something you might see in a food magazine or recipe book which utiliizes this "style" of imagery.</td>', 'Excellent food styling. I like the white plate on white background, but I wish the back edge of the plate was a little more distinct like the other three are. This definitely looks like something you might see in a food magazine or recipe book which utiliizes this "style" of imagery.', '2003-10-22 15:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
