(458867, 42384, 1031, '<td valign="top">You are missing the big pile of garlic. I have a friend who used to cook in co-op student housing ... someone would come in the kitchen and see her dicing 7 or 8 onions and they''d ask "what''s for dinner," and she''d reply "I haven''t decided yet."</td>', 'You are missing the big pile of garlic. I have a friend who used to cook in co-op student housing ... someone would come in the kitchen and see her dicing 7 or 8 onions and they''d ask "what''s for dinner," and she''d reply "I haven''t decided yet."', '2003-10-22 17:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(458869, 42428, 1031, '<td valign="top">... and risk salmonella, unfortunately. Nice photo though!</td>', '... and risk salmonella, unfortunately. Nice photo though!', '2003-10-22 18:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(458872, 42238, 1031, '<td valign="top">Got the color and detail an both the cake and berries just right; the milk glass breaks up the background without distracting from the main subjects.</td>', 'Got the color and detail an both the cake and berries just right; the milk glass breaks up the background without distracting from the main subjects.', '2003-10-22 18:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(458879, 42467, 1031, '<td valign="top">If you get the one with four cherries do you win a prize? I could probably eat several hundred of these ...</td>', 'If you get the one with four cherries do you win a prize? I could probably eat several hundred of these ...', '2003-10-22 18:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(458885, 42267, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the use of "primary colors" but with the lighting wasn''t quite so harsh.</td>', 'I like the use of "primary colors" but with the lighting wasn''t quite so harsh.', '2003-10-22 18:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(458967, 41981, 8970, '<td valign="top">lovely composition.  everything seems to fall into place just right, however I wish that I could see some differential between the back of the plate and the white background.</td>', 'lovely composition.  everything seems to fall into place just right, however I wish that I could see some differential between the back of the plate and the white background.', '2003-10-22 19:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(459120, 42335, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lush texture and richness. very appetising and very well shot. It''s a ribbon winner for me. Loss of a point only for the slight lack of DOF on the far side of the top of the cup. [9]</td>', 'Lush texture and richness. very appetising and very well shot. It''s a ribbon winner for me. Loss of a point only for the slight lack of DOF on the far side of the top of the cup. [9]', '2003-10-22 20:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(459122, 42411, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Rich tones, lovely colours and (despite my pity for it!) a tasty looking dish. Hope it didn\''t die in vain.  ;)   [10]<br/> <br/>Congrats on the blue ribbon...</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Rich tones, lovely colours and (despite my pity for it!) a tasty looking dish. Hope it didn\''t die in vain.  ;)   [10] Congrats on the blue ribbon...', '2003-10-22 20:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(459125, 42044, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very novel approach - technical materpiece with gorgeous lighting, crisp focus and supreme composition. [10]<br/> <br/>Congrats on your ribbon...</td>', 'Very novel approach - technical materpiece with gorgeous lighting, crisp focus and supreme composition. [10] Congrats on your ribbon...', '2003-10-22 20:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(459135, 42178, 8860, '<td valign="top">The FX here are inappropriate for the subject in my view. As a macro it shows no clear detail and as a design it is a little crude - sorry! It''s a shame because this is a good composition otherwise. You''ll probably score low with this because people will be wanting some shots that look appetising.</td>', 'The FX here are inappropriate for the subject in my view. As a macro it shows no clear detail and as a design it is a little crude - sorry! It''s a shame because this is a good composition otherwise. You''ll probably score low with this because people will be wanting some shots that look appetising.', '2003-10-22 20:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(459141, 41981, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dynamic shot with nice design elements. Composition could be tighter, cropping closer to top of chopsticks. Flat lighting removes some of the appetising features of the subject. [6]</td>', 'Dynamic shot with nice design elements. Composition could be tighter, cropping closer to top of chopsticks. Flat lighting removes some of the appetising features of the subject. [6]', '2003-10-22 20:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(459150, 42381, 8860, '<td valign="top">Refreshing bit of humour and a great capture. Little fella could be sharper but I''m sure the luxury of time evaded you. [7]</td>', 'Refreshing bit of humour and a great capture. Little fella could be sharper but I''m sure the luxury of time evaded you. [7]', '2003-10-22 20:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(459157, 41523, 8860, '<td valign="top">Creative viewpoint and dynamic composition make this a refreshing shot. Awkward jaggy highlight on the glass is a bit distracting. [8]</td>', 'Creative viewpoint and dynamic composition make this a refreshing shot. Awkward jaggy highlight on the glass is a bit distracting. [8]', '2003-10-22 20:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(459221, 42437, 6870, '<td valign="top">Do you have a recipe for her? Just kidding. I love the warm colors of this image; it makes her look like a warm person.</td>', 'Do you have a recipe for her? Just kidding. I love the warm colors of this image; it makes her look like a warm person.', '2003-10-22 20:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(459223, 42335, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and effective use of depth of field.</td>', 'Lovely colors and effective use of depth of field.', '2003-10-22 20:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(459225, 41593, 6870, '<td valign="top">These look yummy! The flower adds some nice color and makes the muffins look more attractive.</td>', 'These look yummy! The flower adds some nice color and makes the muffins look more attractive.', '2003-10-22 20:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(459231, 42144, 6870, '<td valign="top">You don''t know how many times I''ve given popcorn to my kids for ''dinner!'' Nice idea. The popcorn in front of the bowl adds a nice informality that popcorn usually has. I would recommend you just sharpen things up a bit with focus, and then with post processing. You might also want to experiment with adding more contrast to get your whites just a little bit whiter and your darks just a little bit darker for a cleaner, clearer image. Nice work.</td>', 'You don''t know how many times I''ve given popcorn to my kids for ''dinner!'' Nice idea. The popcorn in front of the bowl adds a nice informality that popcorn usually has. I would recommend you just sharpen things up a bit with focus, and then with post processing. You might also want to experiment with adding more contrast to get your whites just a little bit whiter and your darks just a little bit darker for a cleaner, clearer image. Nice work.', '2003-10-22 20:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(459248, 42470, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yep. I''ll need these after all of the food I''ll be making--and eating--after this challenge is over! Nice point of view, and I like the informal arrangement of the pills. I would recommend getting even closer, since the lines, shapes and colors around the pills aren''t really doing much in terms of helping the photo communicate anything. You may want to experiment more with point of view, too. If this is ''antacid aftermath''--a lovely title, by the way!--how can you best communicate this feeling or mood? Will special lighting or a special background help? Just things to think about. I think this is a solid photo with lots of things going for it. Good luck!</td>', 'Yep. I''ll need these after all of the food I''ll be making--and eating--after this challenge is over! Nice point of view, and I like the informal arrangement of the pills. I would recommend getting even closer, since the lines, shapes and colors around the pills aren''t really doing much in terms of helping the photo communicate anything. You may want to experiment more with point of view, too. If this is ''antacid aftermath''--a lovely title, by the way!--how can you best communicate this feeling or mood? Will special lighting or a special background help? Just things to think about. I think this is a solid photo with lots of things going for it. Good luck!', '2003-10-22 20:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(459261, 42098, 6624, '<td valign="top">looks delicious and nicely presented...looking forward to the recipe</td>', 'looks delicious and nicely presented...looking forward to the recipe', '2003-10-22 20:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(459263, 41593, 6624, '<td valign="top">they muffin looks wonderful and the presentation is very nice, the addition of some extra apple and blueberry really works for the image</td>', 'they muffin looks wonderful and the presentation is very nice, the addition of some extra apple and blueberry really works for the image', '2003-10-22 20:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(459264, 42411, 6624, '<td valign="top">yum, and nice to accessorize with Dill</td>', 'yum, and nice to accessorize with Dill', '2003-10-22 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(459278, 42402, 6202, '<td valign="top">Simply darling.  I don\''t think there is a kid alive that can resist the bowl and spoon when done.  All the stuff in your backround is distracting try and shoot with a little less clutter and it will improve it.</td>', 'Simply darling.  I don\''t think there is a kid alive that can resist the bowl and spoon when done.  All the stuff in your backround is distracting try and shoot with a little less clutter and it will improve it.', '2003-10-22 21:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
