(459431, 41981, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The spring rolls are nicely framed by the garnishes and chopsticks.</td>', 'Great composition. The spring rolls are nicely framed by the garnishes and chopsticks.', '2003-10-22 23:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(459433, 42044, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great focus and exposure.</td>', 'Great focus and exposure.', '2003-10-22 23:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(459437, 42370, 10402, '<td valign="top">Attractive arrangement and good DOF.</td>', 'Attractive arrangement and good DOF.', '2003-10-22 23:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(459439, 42267, 10402, '<td valign="top">The blue plate and red tomato make an attractive photo of a visually boring (but tasty) food.</td>', 'The blue plate and red tomato make an attractive photo of a visually boring (but tasty) food.', '2003-10-22 23:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(459440, 42062, 10402, '<td valign="top">The many colors and textures make this salad visually very interesting (and delicious too, I''m sure).</td>', 'The many colors and textures make this salad visually very interesting (and delicious too, I''m sure).', '2003-10-22 23:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(459443, 41593, 10402, '<td valign="top">The colorful garnish adds interest. The texture of the muffins is displayed very well.</td>', 'The colorful garnish adds interest. The texture of the muffins is displayed very well.', '2003-10-22 23:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(459448, 41990, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement and the lighting. The specular highlights in the filling show its unusually creamy texture.<br/> <br/>Hmmm... Only seven halves... I couldn''t have resisted eating one either.  ;-)</td>', 'I like the arrangement and the lighting. The specular highlights in the filling show its unusually creamy texture. Hmmm... Only seven halves... I couldn''t have resisted eating one either.  ;-)', '2003-10-22 23:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(459452, 42472, 3981, '<td valign="top">What can I say?  It''s beautifully done in presentation, clarity and composition.  Meets the challenge very well!</td>', 'What can I say?  It''s beautifully done in presentation, clarity and composition.  Meets the challenge very well!', '2003-10-22 23:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(459457, 42409, 10402, '<td valign="top">The overall arrangement is nice, and I like the two-toned background. The cream dallops lack detail; more oblique lighting might have shown off their texture better.</td>', 'The overall arrangement is nice, and I like the two-toned background. The cream dallops lack detail; more oblique lighting might have shown off their texture better.', '2003-10-22 23:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(459458, 42469, 10402, '<td valign="top">A bit soft (sharpening would have helped). The nuts and pepper work well in the background.</td>', 'A bit soft (sharpening would have helped). The nuts and pepper work well in the background.', '2003-10-22 23:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(459460, 42178, 10402, '<td valign="top">The oversaturated colors work well here, nicely outlining the layers of this onion.</td>', 'The oversaturated colors work well here, nicely outlining the layers of this onion.', '2003-10-22 23:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(459462, 42465, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. The dark tones and candle set a proper mood for this romantic dish. I do wish there was a bit more chocolate, perhaps a freshly dipped fruit ready to eat.</td>', 'Good lighting. The dark tones and candle set a proper mood for this romantic dish. I do wish there was a bit more chocolate, perhaps a freshly dipped fruit ready to eat.', '2003-10-22 23:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(459467, 42453, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighting shows off the texture of the eggs, and the bacon provides a nice contrast. A bit soft; some sharpening would help.</td>', 'The lighting shows off the texture of the eggs, and the bacon provides a nice contrast. A bit soft; some sharpening would help.', '2003-10-22 23:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(459472, 42402, 10402, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of baking! She has a great pose and the soft lighting works well. The background, although realistic, is a bit distracting.</td>', 'My favorite part of baking! She has a great pose and the soft lighting works well. The background, although realistic, is a bit distracting.', '2003-10-22 23:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(459479, 41984, 6870, '<td valign="top">Oh man, I love this stuff! I like the formal arrangement for something that is not really all that formal--nice idea for contrast to get our attention. Was this taken with a flash? If so, you might want to experiment with natural light. Nothing is moving, so you could even do a long exposure. Better yet, set this up outside on a sunny day--but in solid shade, and you''ll get brightness, natural colors, and a generally more sophisticated look to things. Note the bright spots on the spoon, plate, and other items and also note the harsh shadows behind things. This is what a flash does. So have fun and experiment! Then send me some of that dip!</td>', 'Oh man, I love this stuff! I like the formal arrangement for something that is not really all that formal--nice idea for contrast to get our attention. Was this taken with a flash? If so, you might want to experiment with natural light. Nothing is moving, so you could even do a long exposure. Better yet, set this up outside on a sunny day--but in solid shade, and you''ll get brightness, natural colors, and a generally more sophisticated look to things. Note the bright spots on the spoon, plate, and other items and also note the harsh shadows behind things. This is what a flash does. So have fun and experiment! Then send me some of that dip!', '2003-10-23 00:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(459480, 42381, 10402, '<td valign="top">Chipmunk should be marinated before grilling. But he''s so cute I''d hate to eat him. You caught a great pose. Good composition. You probably didn''t have much control over the lighting, but the way the top of the grill is lit works well. A little sharpening might enhance the texture of the critter''s fur.</td>', 'Chipmunk should be marinated before grilling. But he''s so cute I''d hate to eat him. You caught a great pose. Good composition. You probably didn''t have much control over the lighting, but the way the top of the grill is lit works well. A little sharpening might enhance the texture of the critter''s fur.', '2003-10-23 00:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(459483, 42267, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing macro of this food! The close-up view really brings out the textures and colors of this food nicely. There is a general glare to things, though, that might be avoided with more diffused light--outside in the solid shade, for instance, would give you nice natural colors with little glare. Anyway, just some thing to experiment with. Have fun!</td>', 'Very intriguing macro of this food! The close-up view really brings out the textures and colors of this food nicely. There is a general glare to things, though, that might be avoided with more diffused light--outside in the solid shade, for instance, would give you nice natural colors with little glare. Anyway, just some thing to experiment with. Have fun!', '2003-10-23 00:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(459487, 41995, 10402, '<td valign="top">I love these! Making them part of a fall still life was a great idea, although it makes the image a little busy. The lighting doesn''t do justice to the food here; the glare is a bit overwhelming.</td>', 'I love these! Making them part of a fall still life was a great idea, although it makes the image a little busy. The lighting doesn''t do justice to the food here; the glare is a bit overwhelming.', '2003-10-23 00:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(459489, 42392, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like your still life set-up  here. There is a nice balance to the composition, and a variety of colors and textures that are quite inviting. I enjoy the soft look to things, too. You do have some harsh highlights and shadows though, that if eliminated would enhance the old world softness I see elsewhere. You can perhaps use more diffused light, or even go outside on a bright day and take the shot in solid shade:  you''ll get bright light, soft shadows and be much more able to manipulate things. Anyway, nice work and good luck!</td>', 'I like your still life set-up  here. There is a nice balance to the composition, and a variety of colors and textures that are quite inviting. I enjoy the soft look to things, too. You do have some harsh highlights and shadows though, that if eliminated would enhance the old world softness I see elsewhere. You can perhaps use more diffused light, or even go outside on a bright day and take the shot in solid shade:  you''ll get bright light, soft shadows and be much more able to manipulate things. Anyway, nice work and good luck!', '2003-10-23 00:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(459493, 42447, 6870, '<td valign="top">Now this looks good! I like the elegant dinnerware and lace that sets if off. The little fairy godmother is also a nice touch! The highlights and shadows are a bit harsh here, so you may want to experiment with diffusing your light, or just take everything outside on a bright day, find some solid shade (like in your garage), and just use sunlight--you''ll get natural colors, more pleasant hightlights and shadows and a generally more appealing shot. Just a thought. Again--nice work and good luck. Most of all--have fun eating this cake!</td>', 'Now this looks good! I like the elegant dinnerware and lace that sets if off. The little fairy godmother is also a nice touch! The highlights and shadows are a bit harsh here, so you may want to experiment with diffusing your light, or just take everything outside on a bright day, find some solid shade (like in your garage), and just use sunlight--you''ll get natural colors, more pleasant hightlights and shadows and a generally more appealing shot. Just a thought. Again--nice work and good luck. Most of all--have fun eating this cake!', '2003-10-23 00:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(459496, 42433, 10402, '<td valign="top">The background elements were carefully chosen to add interest and contrast, and carefully kept blurred to make the bread the star of this photo. The lighting brings out its textures, both the crust and the inside. Great photo!</td>', 'The background elements were carefully chosen to add interest and contrast, and carefully kept blurred to make the bread the star of this photo. The lighting brings out its textures, both the crust and the inside. Great photo!', '2003-10-23 00:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(459500, 42427, 6870, '<td valign="top">THis looks uniique and fun. I like how you show the empty can and the bread outside of it--as well as a loaf inside a can. Interesting composition and arrangement for this shot, too. You might want to experiment with point of view here, too. This shot shows me that the bread is unique because it is baked in a can. This is a pretty straight-on shot. Would this bread look even more delicious up closer? How much coffee can do you need to show so there is as little as possible, but we still know its a coffee can? Just things to think about. Good luck and bon appetit! Nice work.</td>', 'THis looks uniique and fun. I like how you show the empty can and the bread outside of it--as well as a loaf inside a can. Interesting composition and arrangement for this shot, too. You might want to experiment with point of view here, too. This shot shows me that the bread is unique because it is baked in a can. This is a pretty straight-on shot. Would this bread look even more delicious up closer? How much coffee can do you need to show so there is as little as possible, but we still know its a coffee can? Just things to think about. Good luck and bon appetit! Nice work.', '2003-10-23 00:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(459505, 42231, 10402, '<td valign="top">Showing hands cutting the cheese promotes this image from a still life to an action photo. Using a clear glass casserole lets us see the carefully stacked ingredients inside. A wooden pepper grinder would have been a bit more classy, and the plastic thing to the left of the casserole doesn''t seem to fit. And I don''t like the frame at all. But overall a good photo.</td>', 'Showing hands cutting the cheese promotes this image from a still life to an action photo. Using a clear glass casserole lets us see the carefully stacked ingredients inside. A wooden pepper grinder would have been a bit more classy, and the plastic thing to the left of the casserole doesn''t seem to fit. And I don''t like the frame at all. But overall a good photo.', '2003-10-23 00:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(459506, 41990, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love these little guys, and so am anxious to see your recipe! Fun title, too! You might want to experiment with point of view here some more. The depth of field you''re using is usually used to indicate that the part that is in focus is just like the parts that are out of focus. However, in this shot, we can really see everything, so we (I) just wish it were all in sharp focus. If your point of view were much closer, say on one or two eggs, then the depth of field could imply that there are more eggs behind the one in focus and that a sinfully good time awaits if we were to indulge. Just something to think about. Nice work!</td>', 'I love these little guys, and so am anxious to see your recipe! Fun title, too! You might want to experiment with point of view here some more. The depth of field you''re using is usually used to indicate that the part that is in focus is just like the parts that are out of focus. However, in this shot, we can really see everything, so we (I) just wish it were all in sharp focus. If your point of view were much closer, say on one or two eggs, then the depth of field could imply that there are more eggs behind the one in focus and that a sinfully good time awaits if we were to indulge. Just something to think about. Nice work!', '2003-10-23 00:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(459508, 42472, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great lighting; it really shows off the signature shape of peanut butter cookies. Good use of color.</td>', 'Great lighting; it really shows off the signature shape of peanut butter cookies. Good use of color.', '2003-10-23 00:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(459541, 42453, 9411, '<td valign="top">mmm,, from a food styling point of view, the bowl should have been wiped off.<br/>It''s a bit over exposed so the eggs look rather like popcorn. Good angle though.<br/>5</td>', 'mmm,, from a food styling point of view, the bowl should have been wiped off.It''s a bit over exposed so the eggs look rather like popcorn. Good angle though.5', '2003-10-23 00:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(459542, 42417, 9411, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this is really tasty.  The one thing I''m not sure about is the colour. I might have tried to contrast a bit more to bring out the rich purples in the cabbage, and greens in the avacado. The overall purple cast to the entire shot, is just a bit off putting. Really good idea, using the leaves as the entire background. 6</td>', 'I''m sure this is really tasty.  The one thing I''m not sure about is the colour. I might have tried to contrast a bit more to bring out the rich purples in the cabbage, and greens in the avacado. The overall purple cast to the entire shot, is just a bit off putting. Really good idea, using the leaves as the entire background. 6', '2003-10-23 00:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(459545, 42062, 9411, '<td valign="top">That looks really good!  One thing I find distracting though is the herbs scattered around the plate at the top, It feels like things are flying off the plate.  6</td>', 'That looks really good!  One thing I find distracting though is the herbs scattered around the plate at the top, It feels like things are flying off the plate.  6', '2003-10-23 01:00:57.000000', NULL, 0),
