(459927, 41771, 9504, '<td valign="top">Gotta love this recipe -- at least my dogs will!  I cook for my dogs a few times a week.  I feed them cheap cuts of meat, rice or potatoes (or grains) and veggies -- all fresh -- and it is cheaper than buying dog food!  My two dogs also eat a can of salmon (when on sale or mackerel) and a sweet potato when I am in a hurry.  I can feed them for about $.25 -.75 cent a meal -- and they eat way better than most children.  It''s so simple...  As a society we have been brainwashed to believe dog food is king...on the contrary if you read up on it.  Great photo!!</td>', 'Gotta love this recipe -- at least my dogs will!  I cook for my dogs a few times a week.  I feed them cheap cuts of meat, rice or potatoes (or grains) and veggies -- all fresh -- and it is cheaper than buying dog food!  My two dogs also eat a can of salmon (when on sale or mackerel) and a sweet potato when I am in a hurry.  I can feed them for about $.25 -.75 cent a meal -- and they eat way better than most children.  It''s so simple...  As a society we have been brainwashed to believe dog food is king...on the contrary if you read up on it.  Great photo!!', '2003-10-23 11:31:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(459931, 42433, 9504, '<td valign="top">I''ve gotta try this recipe.  It looks delicious.  You''ve sold me!  Thanks...great shot!</td>', 'I''ve gotta try this recipe.  It looks delicious.  You''ve sold me!  Thanks...great shot!', '2003-10-23 11:34:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(459937, 41981, 9504, '<td valign="top">Congrats on winning. I didn''t have time to vote, but you won my #1 spot!  I knew an Asian inspired dish would win.  Their recipes are an artform.<br/> <br/>Just curious, I tried a recipe like this once (and I love Asian foods of all varieties) and when I tasted it, it came out inedible.  I am a good cook and so since that time I have shyed away from rice paper recipes like this.  I made a shrimp rice paper roll with cilantro, shrimp and something else.  Does this have nice flavor?</td>', 'Congrats on winning. I didn''t have time to vote, but you won my #1 spot!  I knew an Asian inspired dish would win.  Their recipes are an artform. Just curious, I tried a recipe like this once (and I love Asian foods of all varieties) and when I tasted it, it came out inedible.  I am a good cook and so since that time I have shyed away from rice paper recipes like this.  I made a shrimp rice paper roll with cilantro, shrimp and something else.  Does this have nice flavor?', '2003-10-23 11:39:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(459942, 42462, 9504, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo!  You made me want to go start cooking right away...  While you have a lot of item in the photo, they all work exceptionally well together. The atmosphere looks lovely and festive -- and the dish divine!  Thanks for sharing.  I must try this...</td>', 'Stunning photo!  You made me want to go start cooking right away...  While you have a lot of item in the photo, they all work exceptionally well together. The atmosphere looks lovely and festive -- and the dish divine!  Thanks for sharing.  I must try this...', '2003-10-23 11:42:52.000000', NULL, 0),
